#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access Group Management"
msgstr "Pengelolaan Grup Akses"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Access Group Management page provides an overview of all existing access "
"groups in your organization and allows administrators to create, edit, or "
"delete them."
msgstr "Halaman Pengelolaan Grup Akses memberikan gambaran umum tentang semua grup akses yang ada di organisasi Anda dan memungkinkan administrator untuk membuat, mengedit, atau menghapusnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:3
msgid "Navigate to menu:Admin[Access Control] to open the page."
msgstr "Buka menu:Admin[Access Control] untuk membuka halaman tersebut."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access groups overview"
msgstr "Gambaran umum grup akses"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The access groups table lists all custom access groups configured for the "
"current organization.  Predefined roles (such as `{productname} "
"Administrator` or `Organization Administrator`) are built-in system roles "
"and cannot be edited or deleted here; they are managed under menu:Users[User "
"List] and menu:Admin[Users]."
msgstr "Tabel grup akses mencantumkan semua grup akses khusus yang dikonfigurasi untuk organisasi saat ini.  Peran yang telah ditentukan sebelumnya (seperti `{productname} Administrator` atau `Organization Administrator`) merupakan peran bawaan sistem dan tidak dapat diedit atau dihapus di sini; peran tersebut dikelola melalui menu:Users[User List] dan menu:Admin[Users]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Use the `Filter by name or description` field above the table to search for "
"specific access groups."
msgstr "Gunakan kolom `Filter by name or description` di atas tabel untuk mencari grup akses tertentu."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:7
msgid "The table displays the following columns:"
msgstr "Tabel tersebut menampilkan kolom-kolom berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Name*: The unique name of the access group.\n"
msgstr "*Name*: Nama unik grup akses.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Description*: The description of the role and its responsibilities.\n"
msgstr "*Description*: Deskripsi peran dan tanggung jawabnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Organization*: The organization to which the access group belongs.\n"
msgstr "*Organization*: Organisasi tempat grup akses tersebut berada.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Users*: The number of users currently assigned to the access group.\n"
msgstr "*Users*: Jumlah pengguna yang saat ini ditetapkan ke grup akses.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Permissions*: The number of permissions granted to the access group.\n"
msgstr "*Permissions*: Jumlah izin yang diberikan kepada grup akses.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Actions*: Contains the following actions:\n"
msgstr "*Actions*: Berisi tindakan berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Edit icon: Click to view and modify group details, permissions, and assigned "
"users.\n"
msgstr "Ikon edit: Klik untuk melihat dan mengubah detail grup, izin, serta pengguna yang ditetapkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete icon: Click to delete the access group.\n"
msgstr "Ikon hapus: Klik untuk menghapus grup akses.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create access group"
msgstr "Membuat grup akses"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:17
msgid "To create an access group, use the following procedure:"
msgstr "Untuk membuat grup akses, gunakan prosedur berikut:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Namespaces and permissions"
msgstr "Namespace dan izin"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Permissions in {productname} are organized hierarchically by namespaces.  "
"Namespaces represent two distinct scopes:"
msgstr "Izin dalam {productname} disusun secara hierarkis berdasarkan namespace.  Namespace mewakili dua cakupan yang berbeda:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "API namespaces"
msgstr "Namespace API"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Represent programmatic API endpoints and XML-RPC/JSON-RPC functions (such as "
"`api.system.bootstrap` or `api.saltkey.accept`).  In the {webui}, API "
"namespaces are indicated by an API icon.  These permissions govern automated "
"calls, scripts, and API interactions with the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Mewakili endpoint API terprogram dan fungsi XML-RPC/JSON-RPC (seperti `api.system.bootstrap` atau `api.saltkey.accept`).  Di {webui}, namespace API ditandai dengan ikon API.  Izin ini mengatur panggilan otomatis, skrip, dan interaksi API dengan Server {productname}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Web UI namespaces"
msgstr "Namespace Antarmuka Web"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Represent functional areas, pages, and actions in the {webui}.  For example, "
"the `account.address` namespace corresponds to the menu:User "
"Account[Addresses] page in the {webui}, while `system.details.packages` "
"corresponds to the packages subtab in the system details view."
msgstr "Mewakili area fungsional, halaman, dan tindakan di {webui}.  Misalnya, namespace `account.address` berkaitan dengan halaman menu:User Account[Addresses] di {webui}, sedangkan `system.details.packages` berkaitan dengan subtab paket dalam tampilan detail sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:24
msgid "Each namespace supports two access levels:"
msgstr "Setiap namespace mendukung dua tingkat akses:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*View*: Grants read-only access to view pages, inspect configurations, or "
"retrieve data.\n"
msgstr "*View*: Memberikan akses hanya baca untuk melihat halaman, memeriksa konfigurasi, atau mengambil data.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Modify*: Grants full access to create, update, execute, or delete resources "
"within that namespace.\n"
msgstr "*Modify*: Memberikan akses penuh untuk membuat, memperbarui, menjalankan, atau menghapus sumber daya dalam namespace tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:27
msgid "The permissions table includes the following controls:"
msgstr "Tabel izin mencakup kontrol berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Search*: Filter namespaces by name using the `Filter by name` field.\n"
msgstr "*Search*: Memfilter namespace berdasarkan nama menggunakan kolom `Filter by name`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "*API filter*: Display only permissions for API endpoints.\n"
msgstr "*API filter*: Hanya menampilkan izin untuk endpoint API.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Web filter*: Display only permissions for the {webui}.\n"
msgstr "*Web filter*: Hanya menampilkan izin untuk {webui}.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Only selected filter*: Display only the permissions currently selected for "
"this access group, providing a quick summary of the granted rights.\n"
msgstr "*Only selected filter*: Hanya menampilkan izin yang saat ini dipilih untuk grup akses ini, sehingga memberikan ringkasan singkat tentang hak akses yang diberikan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Expand / Collapse*: Toggle individual tree branches or use btn:[Expand All] "
"/ btn:[Collapse All] to expand or collapse the entire namespace tree.\n"
msgstr "*Expand / Collapse*: Memperluas atau menciutkan setiap cabang pohon, atau menggunakan btn:[Expand All] / btn:[Collapse All] untuk memperluas atau menciutkan seluruh pohon namespace.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:33
msgid ""
"{productname} provides descriptions for common namespaces in the permissions "
"table.  SUSE plans to add full descriptions of all namespaces in future "
"releases.  For more information about RBAC architecture and namespace "
"examples, see xref:administration:role-based-access-control.adoc[]."
msgstr "{productname} menyediakan deskripsi untuk namespace yang umum digunakan dalam tabel izin.  SUSE berencana menambahkan deskripsi lengkap untuk semua namespace dalam rilis mendatang.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang arsitektur RBAC dan contoh namespace, lihat xref:administration:role-based-access-control.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit or delete an access group"
msgstr "Mengedit atau menghapus grup akses"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:35
msgid "To modify an existing access group, use the following procedure:"
msgstr "Untuk mengubah grup akses yang sudah ada, gunakan prosedur berikut:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Editing an access group"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengedit grup akses"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:37
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:44
msgid "In the {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Access Control]."
msgstr "Di {webui}, buka menu:Admin[Access Control]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:38
msgid "In the `Actions` column of the access group, click the Edit icon."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Actions` grup akses, klik ikon Edit."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:39
msgid ""
"The `Access Group Details` page opens with the `Details`, `Namespaces & "
"Permissions`, and `Users` tabs."
msgstr "Halaman `Access Group Details` akan terbuka dengan tab `Details`, `Namespaces & Permissions`, dan `Users`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Adjust group properties, permissions, or user assignments as needed across "
"the tabs.  Note that the organization cannot be changed after creation."
msgstr "Sesuaikan properti grup, izin, atau penetapan pengguna sesuai kebutuhan pada tab-tab tersebut.  Perhatikan bahwa organisasi tidak dapat diubah setelah grup dibuat."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Update Access Group] at the bottom of the page to save your "
"changes."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Update Access Group] di bagian bawah halaman untuk menyimpan perubahan Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:42
msgid "To delete an access group, use the following procedure:"
msgstr "Untuk menghapus grup akses, gunakan prosedur berikut:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting an access group"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menghapus grup akses"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:45
msgid "In the `Actions` column of the access group, click the Delete icon."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Actions` grup akses, klik ikon Hapus."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/access-control.adoc:46
msgid ""
"In the `Delete Access Group` dialog, confirm the deletion.  Deleting an "
"access group revokes the custom role and its permissions from all assigned "
"users.  _____"
msgstr "Dalam dialog `Delete Access Group`, konfirmasikan penghapusan.  Menghapus grup akses akan mencabut peran khusus beserta izinnya dari semua pengguna yang ditetapkan.  _____"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/admin-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Admin Menu"
msgstr "Menu Admin"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/admin-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The `Admin` menu provides access to features for managing {productname} "
"configuration.  Configuration tasks include creating and managing "
"organizations, users, and tasks.  You can also use the setup wizard to help "
"configure {productname}."
msgstr "Menu `Admin` menyediakan akses ke fitur untuk mengelola konfigurasi {productname}.  Tugas konfigurasi mencakup pembuatan dan pengelolaan organisasi, pengguna, serta tugas.  Anda juga dapat menggunakan wizard penyiapan untuk membantu mengonfigurasi {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/admin-menu.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The `Admin` menu is only available if you are logged in to {productname} "
"with an administrator account."
msgstr "Menu `Admin` hanya tersedia jika Anda masuk ke {productname} menggunakan akun administrator."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/bootstrap-script.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap Script"
msgstr "Skrip Bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/bootstrap-script.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In the menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Bootstrap Script] section you can "
"generate a custom bootstrap script.  Bootstrap scripts are used to register "
"clients with {productname}.  The generated script will be placed in "
"`/srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/` on your {productname} Server."
msgstr "Di bagian menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Bootstrap Script], Anda dapat membuat skrip bootstrap khusus.  Skrip bootstrap digunakan untuk mendaftarkan klien ke {productname}.  Skrip yang dihasilkan akan ditempatkan di `/srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/` pada Server {productname} Anda."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/bootstrap-script.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/general.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap Script Options"
msgstr "Opsi Skrip Bootstrap"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/bootstrap-script.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option                            | Description   | Default\n"
"| {productname} Server hostname     | The hostname for the {productname} "
"Server to register the client to | Pre-populated\n"
"| SSL cert location                 | Location and name of the SSL "
"certificate | Pre-populated\n"
"| Bootstrap using Salt              | Check to bootstrap clients | Checked\n"
"| Enable SSL                        | Check to use the corporate public CA "
"certificate on the client, uncheck to use self-managed CA certificates. | "
"Checked\n"
"| Enable Client GPG checking        | Check to use GPG, uncheck to disable "
"GPG checking | Checked\n"
"| Enable Remote Configuration       | Check to allow configuration from a "
"remote server. | Unchecked\n"
"| Enable Remote Commands            | Check to allow commands from a remote "
"server. | Unchecked\n"
"| Client HTTP Proxy                 | The hostname of the proxy server, if "
"you are using one. | Unpopulated\n"
"| Client HTTP Proxy Username        | The username to use on the proxy "
"server, if you are using one. | Unpopulated\n"
"| Client HTTP Proxy Password        | The password to use on the proxy "
"server, if you are using one. | Unpopulated\n"
msgstr ""
"| Opsi                              | Deskripsi   | Default\n"
"| Nama host Server {productname}    | Nama host Server {productname} tempat klien akan didaftarkan | Terisi otomatis\n"
"| Lokasi sertifikat SSL      | Lokasi dan nama sertifikat SSL | Terisi otomatis\n"
"| Bootstrap menggunakan Salt        | Centang untuk melakukan bootstrap pada klien | Dicentang\n"
"| Aktifkan SSL                      | Centang untuk menggunakan sertifikat CA publik perusahaan pada klien, hapus centang untuk menggunakan sertifikat CA yang dikelola sendiri. | Dicentang\n"
"| Aktifkan pemeriksaan GPG Klien     | Centang untuk menggunakan GPG, hapus centang untuk menonaktifkan pemeriksaan GPG | Dicentang\n"
"| Aktifkan Konfigurasi Jarak Jauh    | Centang untuk mengizinkan konfigurasi dari server jarak jauh. | Tidak dicentang\n"
"| Aktifkan Perintah Jarak Jauh       | Centang untuk mengizinkan perintah dari server jarak jauh. | Tidak dicentang\n"
"| Proksi HTTP Klien              | Nama host server proksi, jika Anda menggunakannya. | Belum diisi\n"
"| Nama Pengguna Proksi HTTP Klien   | Nama pengguna yang akan digunakan pada server proksi, jika Anda menggunakannya. | Belum diisi\n"
"| Kata Sandi Proksi HTTP Klien      | Kata sandi yang akan digunakan pada server proksi, jika Anda menggunakannya. | Belum diisi\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/bootstrap-script.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Do not disable SSL in your bootstrap script.  Ensure that `Enable SSL` is "
"checked in the {webui}, or that the setting `USING_SSL=1` exists in the "
"bootstrap script.  If you disable SSL, the registration process requires "
"custom SSL certificates.  For more about custom certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs.adoc[]."
msgstr "Jangan nonaktifkan SSL dalam skrip bootstrap Anda.  Pastikan `Enable SSL` dicentang di {webui}, atau pengaturan `USING_SSL=1` ada dalam skrip bootstrap.  Jika Anda menonaktifkan SSL, proses pendaftaran memerlukan sertifikat SSL khusus.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang sertifikat khusus, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/cobbler.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{cobbler}"
msgstr "{cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/cobbler.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Cobbler] page allows you to run a "
"{cobbler} synchronization.  You can repair or rebuild the contents of the "
"`/srv/tftpboot/` and `/srv/www/cobbler/` directories after a manual "
"modification of the {cobbler} setup."
msgstr "Halaman menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Cobbler] memungkinkan Anda menjalankan sinkronisasi {cobbler}.  Anda dapat memperbaiki atau membangun ulang isi direktori `/srv/tftpboot/` dan `/srv/www/cobbler/` setelah melakukan perubahan manual pada konfigurasi {cobbler}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/cobbler.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about autoinstallation powered by {cobbler}, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang instalasi otomatis yang didukung oleh {cobbler}, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/cobbler.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{suse} only supports {cobbler} functions that are available in the "
"{productname} {webui}, or through the {productname} API.  Only supported "
"features are documented here."
msgstr "{suse} hanya mendukung fungsi {cobbler} yang tersedia di {webui} {productname}, atau melalui API {productname}.  Hanya fitur yang didukung yang didokumentasikan di sini."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/cobbler.adoc:5
msgid "Using NFS for the persisent volumes of {cobbler} is not supported."
msgstr "Penggunaan NFS untuk volume persisten {cobbler} tidak didukung."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/general.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "General"
msgstr "Umum"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/general.adoc:2
msgid ""
"On the menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > General] page you can configure "
"your {productname} installation."
msgstr "Pada halaman menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > General], Anda dapat mengonfigurasi instalasi {productname} Anda."

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/general.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option                       | Description   | Default\n"
"| Administrator Email Address  | Email address of the {productname} "
"administrator. | Pre-populated\n"
"| {productname} Hostname       | Hostname of the {productname} Server. | "
"Pre-populated\n"
"| HTTP Proxy                   | The hostname and port of the proxy, if you "
"are using one. Use syntax `<hostname>:<port>`, for example: "
"`<example.com>:8080`. | None\n"
"| HTTP Proxy username          | The username to use on the proxy server, if "
"you are using one. | None\n"
"| HTTP Proxy password        | The password to use on the proxy server, if "
"you are using one. | None\n"
"| Confirm HTTP Proxy password  | The directory where RPM packages are "
"mirrored. | `/var/spacewalk/`\n"
"| RPM repository mount point   | The hostname of the proxy server, if you "
"are using one. | None\n"
"| Default to SSL        | Check to use SSL as the default value for "
"communications. | Checked\n"
msgstr ""
"| Opsi                         | Deskripsi   | Default\n"
"| Alamat Email Administrator   | Alamat email administrator {productname}. | Terisi otomatis\n"
"| Nama Host {productname}      | Nama host Server {productname}. | Terisi otomatis\n"
"| Proksi HTTP                  | Nama host dan port proksi, jika Anda menggunakannya. Gunakan sintaks `<hostname>:<port>`, misalnya: `<example.com>:8080`. | Tidak ada\n"
"| Nama pengguna Proksi HTTP    | Nama pengguna yang akan digunakan pada server proksi, jika Anda menggunakannya. | Tidak ada\n"
"| Kata sandi Proksi HTTP       | Kata sandi yang akan digunakan pada server proksi, jika Anda menggunakannya. | Tidak ada\n"
"| Konfirmasi kata sandi Proksi HTTP | Direktori tempat paket RPM dicerminkan. | `/var/spacewalk/`\n"
"| Titik kait repositori RPM    | Nama host server proksi, jika Anda menggunakannya. | Tidak ada\n"
"| Gunakan SSL secara default   | Centang untuk menggunakan SSL sebagai nilai default untuk komunikasi. | Dicentang\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/manager-config-organizations.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Organizations"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi Organisasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/manager-config-organizations.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Organizations] section contains "
"details about organizations in {productname}, and provides links to create "
"and configure organizations and users."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Organizations] berisi detail tentang organisasi di {productname}, serta menyediakan tautan untuk membuat dan mengonfigurasi organisasi dan pengguna."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/manager-configuration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manager Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi Manager"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/manager-configuration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Admin[Manager Configuration] section contains tabs to allow you to "
"configure {productname}."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Admin[Manager Configuration] berisi tab yang memungkinkan Anda mengonfigurasi {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/manager-configuration.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Options"
msgstr "Opsi Konfigurasi"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/manager-configuration.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option             | Description\n"
"| General            | Configure your {productname} installation.\n"
"| Bootstrap Script   | Generate a custom bootstrap script.\n"
"| Organizations      | Create and configure organizations and users.\n"
"| Restart            | Restart {productname}. You will need to do this after "
"making configuration changes.\n"
"| {cobbler}          | Run a {cobbler} synchronization.\n"
"| Monitoring         | Enable server monitoring.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Opsi               | Deskripsi\n"
"| Umum               | Mengonfigurasi instalasi {productname} Anda.\n"
"| Skrip Bootstrap    | Membuat skrip bootstrap khusus.\n"
"| Organisasi         | Membuat dan mengonfigurasi organisasi dan pengguna.\n"
"| Mulai Ulang        | Memulai ulang {productname}. Anda perlu melakukannya setelah membuat perubahan konfigurasi.\n"
"| {cobbler}          | Menjalankan sinkronisasi {cobbler}.\n"
"| Pemantauan         | Mengaktifkan pemantauan server.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/monitoring.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitoring"
msgstr "Pemantauan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/monitoring.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Monitoring] section allows you to "
"enable {productname} monitoring with Prometheus."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Monitoring] memungkinkan Anda mengaktifkan pemantauan {productname} dengan Prometheus."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/monitoring.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about monitoring, see "
"xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pemantauan, lihat xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/organizations.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organizations"
msgstr "Organisasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/organizations.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Admin[Organizations] section allows you to create and manage your "
"{productname} organizations.  Click an organization in the list to see "
"details."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Admin[Organizations] memungkinkan Anda membuat dan mengelola organisasi {productname} Anda.  Klik organisasi dalam daftar untuk melihat detailnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/organizations.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration-channels.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration.adoc:8
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-menu.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about organizations, see "
"xref:administration:organizations.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang organisasi, lihat xref:administration:organizations.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/payg.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{Payg}"
msgstr "{Payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/payg.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Admin[{payg}] section allows you to view and manage {payg} "
"instances.  Every instance shows its description and connection data."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Admin[{payg}] memungkinkan Anda melihat dan mengelola instans {payg}.  Setiap instans menampilkan deskripsi dan data koneksinya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/payg.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To add new instance, click btn:[Add {payg}].  Click an instance to modify "
"its details."
msgstr "Untuk menambahkan instans baru, klik btn:[Add {payg}].  Klik instans untuk mengubah detailnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/payg.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/restart.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restart"
msgstr "Mulai Ulang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/restart.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Restart] section allows you to "
"restart {productname}.  You will need to do this after making configuration "
"changes.  It will take some time for {productname} to become available again "
"after a restart."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Restart] memungkinkan Anda memulai ulang {productname}.  Anda perlu melakukannya setelah membuat perubahan konfigurasi.  {productname} memerlukan waktu beberapa saat agar tersedia kembali setelah dimulai ulang."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup Wizard"
msgstr "Wizard Penyiapan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] section helps you configure {productname}.  It "
"is the default page when you use the {productname} {webui} for the first "
"time."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] membantu Anda mengonfigurasi {productname}.  Bagian ini merupakan halaman default saat Anda menggunakan {webui} {productname} untuk pertama kalinya."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup Wizard Options"
msgstr "Opsi Wizard Penyiapan"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option             | Description\n"
"| HTTP Proxy         | Configure an HTTP proxy connection.\n"
"| Organization Credentials   | Configure an organization for accessing "
"{scclongform}.\n"
"| Products      | View product entitlements and subscribe to product "
"channels.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Opsi               | Deskripsi\n"
"| Proksi HTTP        | Mengonfigurasi koneksi proksi HTTP.\n"
"| Kredensial Organisasi | Mengonfigurasi organisasi untuk mengakses {scclongform}.\n"
"| Produk     | Melihat hak penggunaan produk dan berlangganan saluran produk.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the HTTP Proxy"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi Proksi HTTP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} can connect to the {scclongform} (SCC) or other remote servers "
"using a proxy.  Navigate to the `HTTP Proxy` tab to configure the proxy."
msgstr "{productname} dapat terhubung ke {scclongform} (SCC) atau server jarak jauh lainnya menggunakan proksi.  Buka tab `HTTP Proxy` untuk mengonfigurasi proksi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You will need to provide the hostname of the proxy.  Use the syntax "
"`<hostname>:<port>`.  For example: `example.com:8080`."
msgstr "Anda perlu memberikan nama host proksi.  Gunakan sintaks `<hostname>:<port>`.  Misalnya: `example.com:8080`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:8
msgid "You can disable use of the proxy by clearing the fields."
msgstr "Anda dapat menonaktifkan penggunaan proksi dengan mengosongkan kolom-kolom tersebut."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:9
msgid ""
"When choosing a username or password for your {productname} Proxy, ensure it "
"does not contain an `@` or `:` character.  These characters are reserved."
msgstr "Saat memilih nama pengguna atau kata sandi untuk Proksi {productname} Anda, pastikan tidak ada karakter `@` atau `:` di dalamnya.  Karakter-karakter ini dicadangkan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Organization Credentials"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi Kredensial Organisasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Your {scclongform} account is associated with the administration account of "
"your organization.  You can share your {scclongform} access with other users "
"within your organization.  Navigate to the `Organization Credentials` tab to "
"grant users within your organization access to your {scclongform} account."
msgstr "Akun {scclongform} Anda dikaitkan dengan akun administrasi organisasi Anda.  Anda dapat membagikan akses {scclongform} Anda kepada pengguna lain dalam organisasi Anda.  Buka tab `Organization Credentials` untuk memberi pengguna dalam organisasi Anda akses ke akun {scclongform} Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Add a new credential], enter the username and password of the "
"user to grant access to, and click btn:[Save].  A new credential card is "
"shown for the user you have granted access to.  Use these buttons on the "
"card to edit or revoke access:"
msgstr "Klik btn:[Add a new credential], masukkan nama pengguna dan kata sandi pengguna yang akan diberi akses, lalu klik btn:[Save].  Kartu kredensial baru akan ditampilkan untuk pengguna yang telah Anda beri akses.  Gunakan tombol-tombol berikut pada kartu untuk mengedit atau mencabut akses:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:13
msgid "Check credential validation status (green tick or red cross icon)."
msgstr "Periksa status validasi kredensial (ikon centang hijau atau silang merah)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:14
msgid "To re-check the credential with SCC, click the icon."
msgstr "Untuk memeriksa ulang kredensial dengan SCC, klik ikon tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Set the primary credentials for inter-server synchronization (yellow star "
"icon)."
msgstr "Tetapkan kredensial utama untuk sinkronisasi antarserver (ikon bintang kuning)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:16
msgid "List the subscriptions related to a certain credential (list icon)."
msgstr "Tampilkan daftar langganan yang terkait dengan kredensial tertentu (ikon daftar)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:17
msgid "Edit the credential (pencil icon)."
msgstr "Edit kredensial (ikon pensil)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:18
msgid "Delete the credential (trash can icon)."
msgstr "Hapus kredensial (ikon tempat sampah)."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Products"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi Produk"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Your {suse} subscription entitles you to access a range of products.  "
"Navigate to the `Products` tab to browse the products available to you and "
"synchronize {productname} with {scclongform}."
msgstr "Langganan {suse} Anda memberikan hak untuk mengakses berbagai produk.  Buka tab `Products` untuk menelusuri produk yang tersedia bagi Anda dan menyinkronkan {productname} dengan {scclongform}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:21
msgid "Filters help you search for products by description or architecture."
msgstr "Filter membantu Anda mencari produk berdasarkan deskripsi atau arsitektur."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:22
msgid ""
"The list is organized by product name showing products on top which have a "
"subscription.  Freely available products appear at the end of the list.  For "
"each product, you can see the architecture it can be used on.  Click the "
"arrow next to the product name to see associated channels and extensions.  "
"Click the btn:[Channels] icon to see the complete list of channels "
"associated with each product."
msgstr "Daftar disusun berdasarkan nama produk, dengan produk yang memiliki langganan ditampilkan di bagian atas.  Produk yang tersedia secara gratis ditampilkan di bagian akhir daftar.  Untuk setiap produk, Anda dapat melihat arsitektur yang didukungnya.  Klik panah di samping nama produk untuk melihat saluran dan ekstensi terkait.  Klik ikon btn:[Channels] untuk melihat daftar lengkap saluran yang terkait dengan setiap produk."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:23
msgid ""
"For products based on {sle}{nbsp}15 and above, you can choose to only "
"synchronize required packages, or to also include recommended products.  "
"Toggle the btn:[include recommended] switch on to synchronize all products, "
"and toggle the switch off to synchronize only required products."
msgstr "Untuk produk berbasis {sle}{nbsp}15 dan versi yang lebih baru, Anda dapat memilih untuk hanya menyinkronkan paket yang diperlukan, atau juga menyertakan produk yang direkomendasikan.  Aktifkan sakelar btn:[include recommended] untuk menyinkronkan semua produk, dan nonaktifkan sakelar tersebut untuk hanya menyinkronkan produk yang diperlukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:24
msgid ""
"You can further refine which products you want to synchronize by selecting "
"or deselecting individual product."
msgstr "Anda dapat menentukan lebih lanjut produk yang ingin disinkronkan dengan memilih atau membatalkan pilihan setiap produk."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:25
msgid ""
"When you have completed your selection, click btn:[Add products], and click "
"btn:[Refresh] to schedule the synchronization."
msgstr "Setelah selesai memilih, klik btn:[Add products], lalu klik btn:[Refresh] untuk menjadwalkan sinkronisasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Synchronization progress for each product is shown in a progress bar next to "
"the product name.  Depending on the products you have chosen, "
"synchronization can take up to several hours.  New products will be "
"available for you to use in {productname} when synchronization is complete."
msgstr "Progres sinkronisasi setiap produk ditampilkan dalam bilah progres di samping nama produk.  Bergantung pada produk yang Anda pilih, sinkronisasi dapat memerlukan waktu hingga beberapa jam.  Produk baru akan tersedia untuk digunakan di {productname} setelah sinkronisasi selesai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/setup-wizard.adoc:27
msgid ""
"If your synchronization fails, it could be because of a third party GPG key "
"or your company firewall blocking access to the download server.  Please "
"check the notification details for the error.  For more information about "
"troubleshooting product synchronization, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc[]."
msgstr "Jika sinkronisasi gagal, penyebabnya mungkin kunci GPG pihak ketiga atau firewall perusahaan Anda yang memblokir akses ke server unduhan.  Periksa detail notifikasi untuk mengetahui kesalahannya.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pemecahan masalah sinkronisasi produk, lihat xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/show-tomcat-logs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Show Tomcat Logs"
msgstr "Menampilkan Log Tomcat"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/show-tomcat-logs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Admin[Show Tomcat Logs] section shows the Apache Tomcat log file.  "
"You can also view the Tomcat log from the command prompt at "
"`/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Admin[Show Tomcat Logs] menampilkan berkas log Apache Tomcat.  Anda juga dapat melihat log Tomcat melalui prompt perintah di `/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/show-tomcat-logs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The menu:Admin[Show Tomcat Logs] section is only available if you are signed "
"in to {productname} with an administrator account."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Admin[Show Tomcat Logs] hanya tersedia jika Anda masuk ke {productname} menggunakan akun administrator."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/task-engine-status.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task Engine Status"
msgstr "Status Mesin Tugas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/task-engine-status.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Admin[Task Engine Status] section shows all running tasks by the "
"{productname} task engine."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Admin[Task Engine Status] menampilkan semua tugas yang sedang dijalankan oleh mesin tugas {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/task-engine-status.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `Last Execution Times` tab to see the task list.  Each task "
"shows the time it was last run, and the current status of the task."
msgstr "Buka tab `Last Execution Times` untuk melihat daftar tugas.  Setiap tugas menampilkan waktu terakhir dijalankan dan statusnya saat ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/task-engine-status.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `Runtime Status` tab to see all tasks that have run in the "
"past five minutes.  Each task shows the start and end time, the amount of "
"time the task ran for, and the current status.  Some tasks will also provide "
"further data, if available."
msgstr "Buka tab `Runtime Status` untuk melihat semua tugas yang telah dijalankan dalam lima menit terakhir.  Setiap tugas menampilkan waktu mulai dan selesai, durasi pelaksanaan, serta statusnya saat ini.  Beberapa tugas juga menyediakan data tambahan, jika tersedia."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/task-schedules.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task Schedules"
msgstr "Jadwal Tugas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/task-schedules.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Admin[Task Schedules] section lists all predefined task bunches.  "
"Tasks can be grouped together in bunches to simplify managing them."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Admin[Task Schedules] mencantumkan semua kumpulan tugas yang telah ditentukan sebelumnya.  Tugas dapat dikelompokkan ke dalam kumpulan untuk mempermudah pengelolaannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/task-schedules.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This page shows the schedule for each bunch of tasks.  Every schedule shows "
"how frequently it runs using `cron` notation, the time it became active, and "
"the bunch that it belongs to."
msgstr "Halaman ini menampilkan jadwal untuk setiap kumpulan tugas.  Setiap jadwal menampilkan frekuensi pelaksanaan menggunakan notasi `cron`, waktu mulai aktif, dan kumpulan tugas yang terkait dengannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/task-schedules.adoc:4
msgid "Click a schedule to change its frequency, disable or activate it."
msgstr "Klik jadwal untuk mengubah frekuensinya, menonaktifkan, atau mengaktifkannya."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/task-schedules.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Do not disable a schedule if you are not certain what it does.  Some "
"schedules are essential for {productname} to work properly."
msgstr "Jangan nonaktifkan jadwal jika Anda tidak yakin akan fungsinya.  Beberapa jadwal sangat penting agar {productname} dapat berfungsi dengan baik."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/task-schedules.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For more information about task schedules, see "
"xref:administration:task-schedules.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang jadwal tugas, lihat xref:administration:task-schedules.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/users.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users"
msgstr "Pengguna"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/users.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Admin[Users] section allows you to view and manage all users of the "
"organization you are logged in to.  Every user shows the username, real "
"name, the organization they are associated with, and whether the user is an "
"organization or {productname} administrator."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Admin[Users] memungkinkan Anda melihat dan mengelola semua pengguna dalam organisasi tempat Anda masuk.  Setiap pengguna ditampilkan dengan nama pengguna, nama asli, organisasi yang terkait dengannya, serta keterangan apakah pengguna tersebut merupakan administrator organisasi atau administrator {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/users.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To change a user's {productname} Administrator role, check or uncheck "
"`{productname} Admin` as required."
msgstr "Untuk mengubah peran Administrator {productname} seorang pengguna, centang atau hapus centang pada `{productname} Admin` sesuai kebutuhan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/users.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Click a username to modify the user account details, and change other "
"administrator roles."
msgstr "Klik nama pengguna untuk mengubah detail akun pengguna dan peran administrator lainnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/admin/users.adoc:5
msgid "For more information, see xref:reference:users/user-details.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:reference:users/user-details.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "CVE Audit"
msgstr "Audit CVE"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Audit[CVE Audit] section shows you which CVEs have been applied to "
"your clients.  A CVE (common vulnerabilities and exposures) is a fix for a "
"publicly known security vulnerability.  It is important that you apply CVEs "
"to your clients as soon as they become available."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Audit[CVE Audit] menampilkan CVE yang telah diterapkan pada klien Anda.  CVE (common vulnerabilities and exposures) adalah perbaikan untuk kerentanan keamanan yang diketahui publik.  Penting untuk menerapkan CVE pada klien Anda segera setelah tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Each CVE contains an identification number, a description of the "
"vulnerability, and links to further information.  CVE identification numbers "
"use the form `CVE-YEAR-XXXX`."
msgstr "Setiap CVE berisi nomor identifikasi, deskripsi kerentanan, dan tautan ke informasi lebih lanjut.  Nomor identifikasi CVE menggunakan format `CVE-YEAR-XXXX`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc:4
msgid "Clients are listed with a patch status icon."
msgstr "Klien dicantumkan dengan ikon status patch."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-all.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-relevant.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patch Status Icons"
msgstr "Ikon Status Patch"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Icon | Description | Action Required\n"
"| icon:exclamation-circle[role=\"red\"] | Affected, patches are not released "
"for the CVE. | The client is affected by a vulnerability for which a patch "
"has not yet been released.\n"
"| icon:exclamation-circle[role=\"red\"] | Affected, patches were released "
"for the CVE but {productname} can't find them in any of the relevant "
"channels. | The client is affected by a vulnerability that received a patch, "
"but {productname} is unable to locate any of the patches in relevant "
"channels.\n"
"| icon:shield[role=\"red\"] | Affected, only partial patches are available "
"for the CVE. | The client is affected by a vulnerability and {productname} "
"has patches for it, but applying the patches will only fix some of the "
"vulnerable packages.\n"
"\n"
"| icon:exclamation-triangle[role=\"orange\"] | Affected, patches are "
"available in channels that are not assigned | The client is affected by a "
"vulnerability and {productname} has patches for it, but the channels "
"offering the patches are not assigned to the client.\n"
"| icon:exclamation-triangle[role=\"orange\"] | Affected, patches are "
"available in a product migration target | The client is affected by a "
"vulnerability and {productname} has patches for it, but applying the patch "
"requires migrating the product to a newer version.\n"
"| icon:shield[role=\"orange\"] | Affected, at least one patch is available "
"in an assigned channel | The client is affected by the vulnerability and "
"{productname} has patches available in a channel that is directly assigned "
"to the client.\n"
"| icon:circle[role=\"green\"]| Not affected | The client is not affected "
"because none of the CVE vulnerable packages are installed.\n"
"| icon:check-circle[role=\"green\"] | Patched | A patch has been "
"successfully installed on the client.\n"
"| icon:minus-circle[role=\"gray\"] | Unknown, CVE metadata not available | "
"The patch status cannot be determined because the CVE metadata required for "
"OVAL-based auditing is missing or has not yet been synchronized.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Ikon | Deskripsi | Tindakan yang Diperlukan\n"
"| icon:exclamation-circle[role=\"red\"] | Terdampak, patch untuk CVE belum dirilis. | Klien terdampak oleh kerentanan yang patch-nya belum dirilis.\n"
"| icon:exclamation-circle[role=\"red\"] | Terdampak, patch untuk CVE telah dirilis, tetapi {productname} tidak dapat menemukannya di saluran mana pun yang relevan. | Klien terdampak oleh kerentanan yang telah memiliki patch, tetapi {productname} tidak dapat menemukan patch tersebut di saluran yang relevan.\n"
"| icon:shield[role=\"red\"] | Terdampak, hanya patch parsial yang tersedia untuk CVE. | Klien terdampak oleh kerentanan dan {productname} memiliki patch untuk kerentanan tersebut, tetapi penerapan patch hanya akan memperbaiki sebagian paket yang rentan.\n"
"\n"
"| icon:exclamation-triangle[role=\"orange\"] | Terdampak, patch tersedia di saluran yang belum ditetapkan | Klien terdampak oleh kerentanan dan {productname} memiliki patch untuk kerentanan tersebut, tetapi saluran yang menyediakan patch belum ditetapkan ke klien.\n"
"| icon:exclamation-triangle[role=\"orange\"] | Terdampak, patch tersedia di target migrasi produk | Klien terdampak oleh kerentanan dan {productname} memiliki patch untuk kerentanan tersebut, tetapi penerapan patch mengharuskan migrasi produk ke versi yang lebih baru.\n"
"| icon:shield[role=\"orange\"] | Terdampak, setidaknya satu patch tersedia di saluran yang telah ditetapkan | Klien terdampak oleh kerentanan dan {productname} memiliki patch yang tersedia di saluran yang ditetapkan langsung ke klien.\n"
"| icon:circle[role=\"green\"]| Tidak terdampak | Klien tidak terdampak karena tidak ada paket yang rentan terhadap CVE tersebut yang terinstal.\n"
"| icon:check-circle[role=\"green\"] | Patch telah diterapkan | Patch telah berhasil diinstal pada klien.\n"
"| icon:minus-circle[role=\"gray\"] | Tidak diketahui, metadata CVE tidak tersedia | Status patch tidak dapat ditentukan karena metadata CVE yang diperlukan untuk audit berbasis OVAL tidak tersedia atau belum disinkronkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about CVE auditing, see "
"xref:administration:auditing.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang audit CVE, lihat xref:administration:auditing.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Audit Menu"
msgstr "Menu Audit"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The `Audit` menu provides access to features for managing security updates "
"on your clients.  Audit tasks include finding and updating clients with the "
"latest CVE patches, subscription matching, and managing OpenSCAP scans."
msgstr "Menu `Audit` menyediakan akses ke fitur untuk mengelola pembaruan keamanan pada klien Anda.  Tugas audit mencakup pencarian dan pembaruan klien dengan patch CVE terbaru, pencocokan langganan, serta pengelolaan pemindaian OpenSCAP."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-openscap-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenSCAP"
msgstr "OpenSCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-openscap-overview.adoc:2
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-all-scans.adoc:2
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Audit[OpenSCAP] section displays the results of OpenSCAP scans that "
"you have performed on your clients."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Audit[OpenSCAP] menampilkan hasil pemindaian OpenSCAP yang telah Anda lakukan pada klien Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-openscap-overview.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The Security Certification and Authorization Package (SCAP) is a "
"standardized compliance checking solution for enterprise-level Linux "
"infrastructures.  {productname} uses OpenSCAP to implement the SCAP "
"specifications."
msgstr "Security Certification and Authorization Package (SCAP) merupakan solusi pemeriksaan kepatuhan terstandar untuk infrastruktur Linux tingkat perusahaan.  {productname} menggunakan OpenSCAP untuk menerapkan spesifikasi SCAP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-openscap-overview.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-advanced-search.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-all-scans.adoc:7
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-menu.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-xccdf-diff.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about OpenSCAP, see "
"xref:administration:openscap.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang OpenSCAP, lihat xref:administration:openscap.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-content.adoc:1
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "SCAP Content"
msgstr "Konten SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-content.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Audit[SCAP Content] section displays the SCAP content files "
"available in your organization.  SCAP content files contain the security "
"benchmarks and profiles used to evaluate system compliance."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Audit[SCAP Content] menampilkan berkas konten SCAP yang tersedia dalam organisasi Anda.  Berkas konten SCAP berisi tolok ukur dan profil keamanan yang digunakan untuk mengevaluasi kepatuhan sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-content.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Upload] to upload a new SCAP content file.  For more information "
"about uploading SCAP content, see <<ref-scap-content-upload>>."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Upload] untuk mengunggah berkas konten SCAP baru.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengunggahan konten SCAP, lihat <<ref-scap-content-upload>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-content.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Each row in the list provides btn:[Edit] and btn:[Delete] action buttons.  "
"Use btn:[Edit] to modify the name, description, or replace the uploaded "
"files for an existing SCAP content entry.  Use btn:[Delete] to remove the "
"SCAP content entry.  A confirmation dialog is displayed before deletion."
msgstr "Setiap baris dalam daftar menyediakan tombol tindakan btn:[Edit] dan btn:[Delete].  Gunakan btn:[Edit] untuk mengubah nama, deskripsi, atau mengganti berkas yang diunggah untuk entri konten SCAP yang sudah ada. Gunakan btn:[Delete] untuk menghapus entri konten SCAP.  Dialog konfirmasi ditampilkan sebelum penghapusan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-content.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can filter the list using the search bar, which searches across the "
"name, file name, and description fields."
msgstr "Anda dapat memfilter daftar menggunakan bilah pencarian, yang menelusuri kolom nama, nama berkas, dan deskripsi."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-content.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "SCAP Content List Columns"
msgstr "Kolom Daftar Konten SCAP"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-content.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column      | Description\n"
"| Name        | The display name of the SCAP content.\n"
"| Description | A brief description of the SCAP content.\n"
"| File Name   | The file name of the uploaded DataStream file.\n"
"| Actions     | Available actions: Edit and Delete.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom       | Deskripsi\n"
"| Nama        | Nama tampilan konten SCAP.\n"
"| Deskripsi   | Deskripsi singkat konten SCAP.\n"
"| Nama Berkas | Nama berkas DataStream yang diunggah.\n"
"| Tindakan    | Tindakan yang tersedia: Edit dan Hapus.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-content.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload SCAP content"
msgstr "Mengunggah konten SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-content.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The menu:Audit[SCAP Content > Upload] page allows you to upload new SCAP "
"content to your organization."
msgstr "Halaman menu:Audit[SCAP Content > Upload] memungkinkan Anda mengunggah konten SCAP baru ke organisasi Anda."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-content.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload SCAP Content Fields"
msgstr "Kolom Pengunggahan Konten SCAP"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-content.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field                | Required | Description\n"
"| Name                 | Yes      | A display name for the SCAP content.\n"
"| Description          | No       | A brief description of the SCAP "
"content.\n"
"| SCAP Datastream File | Yes      | The DataStream file (`*-ds.xml`) to "
"upload.\n"
"| XCCDF File           | Yes      | The XCCDF file (`*-xccdf.xml`) to "
"upload.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom               | Wajib | Deskripsi\n"
"| Nama                | Ya  | Nama tampilan untuk konten SCAP.\n"
"| Deskripsi           | Tidak | Deskripsi singkat konten SCAP.\n"
"| Berkas SCAP Datastream | Ya | Berkas DataStream (`*-ds.xml`) yang akan diunggah.\n"
"| Berkas XCCDF        | Ya    | Berkas XCCDF (`*-xccdf.xml`) yang akan diunggah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-content.adoc:12
msgid "Click btn:[Upload] to save the new SCAP content."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Upload] untuk menyimpan konten SCAP baru."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-content.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit SCAP content"
msgstr "Mengedit konten SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-content.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The menu:Audit[SCAP Content > Edit] page allows you to update an existing "
"SCAP content entry.  You can change the name, description, or replace the "
"uploaded DataStream and XCCDF files.  If you do not upload a new file, the "
"existing file is retained."
msgstr "Halaman menu:Audit[SCAP Content > Edit] memungkinkan Anda memperbarui entri konten SCAP yang sudah ada.  Anda dapat mengubah nama, deskripsi, atau mengganti berkas DataStream dan XCCDF yang telah diunggah.  Jika Anda tidak mengunggah berkas baru, berkas yang ada akan dipertahankan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-content.adoc:15
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-tailoring-files.adoc:15
msgid "Click btn:[Update] to save the changes."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Update] untuk menyimpan perubahan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "SCAP Policies"
msgstr "Kebijakan SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Audit[SCAP Policies] section displays the compliance policies "
"defined in your organization.  Each policy ties together a SCAP content "
"file, an XCCDF profile, and optional tailoring to define a compliance "
"standard."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Audit[SCAP Policies] menampilkan kebijakan kepatuhan yang ditetapkan dalam organisasi Anda.  Setiap kebijakan menggabungkan berkas konten SCAP, profil XCCDF, dan penyesuaian opsional untuk menetapkan standar kepatuhan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create] to create a new compliance policy.  For more information "
"about creating policies, see <<ref-scap-policy-create>>."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create] untuk membuat kebijakan kepatuhan baru.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pembuatan kebijakan, lihat <<ref-scap-policy-create>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Each row in the list provides btn:[Details], btn:[Edit], and btn:[Delete] "
"action buttons.  Use btn:[Details] to view the policy summary, "
"configuration, and scan history.  Use btn:[Edit] to modify the policy.  Use "
"btn:[Delete] to remove the policy.  A confirmation dialog is displayed "
"before deletion."
msgstr "Setiap baris dalam daftar menyediakan tombol tindakan btn:[Details], btn:[Edit], dan btn:[Delete].  Gunakan btn:[Details] untuk melihat ringkasan kebijakan, konfigurasi, dan riwayat pemindaian.  Gunakan btn:[Edit] untuk mengubah kebijakan.  Gunakan btn:[Delete] untuk menghapus kebijakan.  Dialog konfirmasi ditampilkan sebelum penghapusan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can filter the list using the search bar, which searches across the "
"policy name and SCAP content name."
msgstr "Anda dapat memfilter daftar menggunakan bilah pencarian, yang menelusuri nama kebijakan dan nama konten SCAP."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "SCAP Policies List Columns"
msgstr "Kolom Daftar Kebijakan SCAP"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column          | Description\n"
"| Name            | The display name of the compliance policy.\n"
"| Content         | The name of the associated SCAP content, or `N/A` if "
"none is assigned.\n"
"| Systems Scanned | The number of systems that have been scanned using this "
"policy.\n"
"| Compliance      | A compliance badge showing the percentage of compliant "
"systems and the ratio of compliant to total scanned systems.\n"
"| Actions         | Available actions: Details, Edit, and Delete.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom              | Deskripsi\n"
"| Nama               | Nama tampilan kebijakan kepatuhan.\n"
"| Konten             | Nama konten SCAP yang terkait, atau `N/A` jika tidak ada yang ditetapkan.\n"
"| Sistem yang Dipindai | Jumlah sistem yang telah dipindai menggunakan kebijakan ini.\n"
"| Kepatuhan          | Lencana kepatuhan yang menampilkan persentase sistem yang patuh dan rasio jumlah sistem yang patuh terhadap total sistem yang dipindai.\n"
"| Tindakan           | Tindakan yang tersedia: Detail, Edit, dan Hapus.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create compliance policy"
msgstr "Membuat kebijakan kepatuhan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The menu:Audit[SCAP Policies > Create] page allows you to define a new "
"compliance policy."
msgstr "Halaman menu:Audit[SCAP Policies > Create] memungkinkan Anda menetapkan kebijakan kepatuhan baru."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create Compliance Policy Fields"
msgstr "Kolom Pembuatan Kebijakan Kepatuhan"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field                  | Required | Description\n"
"| Policy Name            | Yes      | A display name for the compliance "
"policy.\n"
"| Description            | No       | A brief description of the policy.\n"
"| SCAP Content           | Yes      | Select a SCAP content file. The XCCDF "
"Profile list is populated based on this selection.\n"
"| XCCDF Profile          | Yes      | Select an XCCDF profile from the "
"chosen SCAP content.\n"
"| Tailoring File         | No       | Optionally select a tailoring file to "
"customize the profile. The Tailoring Profile list is populated based on this "
"selection.\n"
"| Tailoring Profile      | No       | Select a profile from the chosen "
"tailoring file.\n"
"| Advanced Arguments     | No       | Additional command-line arguments, for "
"example: `--rule <rule_id> --remediate`.\n"
"| OVAL Files             | No       | Paths to local OVAL definitions on the "
"target system, comma separated.\n"
"| Fetch Remote Resources | No       | Enable fetching of remote resources "
"during scans. This requires internet access and significant memory on the "
"target system.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom                  | Wajib    | Deskripsi\n"
"| Nama Kebijakan      | Ya       | Nama tampilan untuk kebijakan kepatuhan.\n"
"| Deskripsi     | Tidak    | Deskripsi singkat kebijakan.\n"
"| Konten SCAP            | Ya       | Pilih berkas konten SCAP. Daftar Profil XCCDF diisi berdasarkan pilihan ini.\n"
"| Profil XCCDF           | Ya       | Pilih profil XCCDF dari konten SCAP yang dipilih.\n"
"| Berkas Penyesuaian     | Tidak    | Jika diperlukan, pilih berkas penyesuaian untuk menyesuaikan profil. Daftar Profil Penyesuaian diisi berdasarkan pilihan ini.\n"
"| Profil Penyesuaian     | Tidak    | Pilih profil dari berkas penyesuaian yang dipilih.\n"
"| Argumen Lanjutan       | Tidak    | Argumen baris perintah tambahan, misalnya: `--rule <rule_id> --remediate`.\n"
"| Berkas OVAL            | Tidak    | Jalur ke definisi OVAL lokal pada sistem target, dipisahkan dengan koma.\n"
"| Ambil Sumber Daya Jarak Jauh | Tidak | Aktifkan pengambilan sumber daya jarak jauh selama pemindaian. Opsi ini memerlukan akses internet dan memori yang besar pada sistem target.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Enabling btn:[Fetch Remote Resources] requires internet access and "
"significant available memory on the target minion.  Ensure the target system "
"has sufficient resources before enabling this option."
msgstr "Mengaktifkan btn:[Fetch Remote Resources] memerlukan akses internet dan memori tersedia yang besar pada minion target.  Pastikan sistem target memiliki sumber daya yang memadai sebelum mengaktifkan opsi ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:13
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to save the new policy."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create] untuk menyimpan kebijakan baru."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit compliance policy"
msgstr "Mengedit kebijakan kepatuhan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The menu:Audit[SCAP Policies > Edit] page allows you to update an existing "
"compliance policy.  All fields from the creation form can be modified."
msgstr "Halaman menu:Audit[SCAP Policies > Edit] memungkinkan Anda memperbarui kebijakan kepatuhan yang sudah ada.  Semua kolom pada formulir pembuatan dapat diubah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Update] to save the changes.  Click btn:[Back to List] to return "
"to the policies list without saving."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Update] untuk menyimpan perubahan.  Klik btn:[Back to List] untuk kembali ke daftar kebijakan tanpa menyimpan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Policy details"
msgstr "Detail kebijakan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:18
msgid ""
"The menu:Audit[SCAP Policies > Details] page displays a comprehensive "
"overview of a compliance policy, including compliance statistics, "
"configuration, and scan history."
msgstr "Halaman menu:Audit[SCAP Policies > Details] menampilkan gambaran menyeluruh tentang kebijakan kepatuhan, termasuk statistik kepatuhan, konfigurasi, dan riwayat pemindaian."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Summary cards"
msgstr "Kartu ringkasan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:20
msgid "The top of the page shows four summary cards:"
msgstr "Bagian atas halaman menampilkan empat kartu ringkasan:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Summary Cards"
msgstr "Kartu Ringkasan"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Card             | Description\n"
"| Total Scans      | The total number of scans performed using this "
"policy.\n"
"| Systems Scanned  | The number of unique systems scanned.\n"
"| Compliant Scans  | The number of scans where all rules passed.\n"
"| Compliance Rate  | The percentage of scans that are compliant.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kartu                | Deskripsi\n"
"| Total Pemindaian     | Jumlah total pemindaian yang dilakukan menggunakan kebijakan ini.\n"
"| Sistem yang Dipindai | Jumlah sistem unik yang dipindai.\n"
"| Pemindaian yang Patuh | Jumlah pemindaian yang seluruh aturannya berhasil dipenuhi.\n"
"| Tingkat Kepatuhan    | Persentase pemindaian yang patuh.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Policy configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi kebijakan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:24
msgid "This panel displays the current configuration of the policy:"
msgstr "Panel ini menampilkan konfigurasi kebijakan saat ini:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:26
msgid "XCCDF Profile"
msgstr "Profil XCCDF"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:27
msgid "Tailoring File (if configured)"
msgstr "Berkas Penyesuaian (jika dikonfigurasi)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:28
msgid "Tailoring Profile (if configured)"
msgstr "Profil Penyesuaian (jika dikonfigurasi)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:29
msgid "OVAL Files (if configured)"
msgstr "Berkas OVAL (jika dikonfigurasi)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:30
msgid "Advanced Arguments (if configured)"
msgstr "Argumen Lanjutan (jika dikonfigurasi)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:31
msgid "Fetch Remote Resources (Yes or No)"
msgstr "Ambil Sumber Daya Jarak Jauh (Ya atau Tidak)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:32
msgid "Description (if provided)"
msgstr "Deskripsi (jika diberikan)"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scan history"
msgstr "Riwayat pemindaian"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The scan history table shows all scans performed using this policy.  Use the "
"checkbox btn:[Show only latest scan per system] to filter the table to "
"display only the most recent scan for each system."
msgstr "Tabel riwayat pemindaian menampilkan semua pemindaian yang dilakukan menggunakan kebijakan ini.  Gunakan kotak centang btn:[Show only latest scan per system] untuk memfilter tabel agar hanya menampilkan pemindaian terbaru untuk setiap sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:35
msgid ""
"You can filter the scan history using the search bar, which searches by "
"system name."
msgstr "Anda dapat memfilter riwayat pemindaian menggunakan bilah pencarian, yang menelusuri berdasarkan nama sistem."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scan History Columns"
msgstr "Kolom Riwayat Pemindaian"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-policies.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column    | Description\n"
"| System    | The name of the scanned system, linked to the system details "
"page.\n"
"| Scan Date | The date and time the scan was performed.\n"
"| Passed    | The number of rules that passed.\n"
"| Failed    | The number of rules that failed.\n"
"| Other     | The number of rules that were not selected or not "
"applicable.\n"
"| Status    | The compliance status: `Compliant` (no failures) or "
"`Non-Compliant` (one or more failures).\n"
"| Actions   | Click btn:[View Details] to view the full XCCDF scan "
"results.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom     | Deskripsi\n"
"| Sistem    | Nama sistem yang dipindai, ditautkan ke halaman detail sistem.\n"
"| Tanggal Pemindaian | Tanggal dan waktu pemindaian dilakukan.\n"
"| Lulus     | Jumlah aturan yang lulus.\n"
"| Gagal     | Jumlah aturan yang gagal.\n"
"| Lainnya   | Jumlah aturan yang tidak dipilih atau tidak berlaku.\n"
"| Status    | Status kepatuhan: `Compliant` (tidak ada kegagalan) atau `Non-Compliant` (satu atau lebih kegagalan).\n"
"| Tindakan  | Klik btn:[View Details] untuk melihat hasil lengkap pemindaian XCCDF.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-tailoring-files.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tailoring Files"
msgstr "Berkas Penyesuaian"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-tailoring-files.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Audit[Tailoring Files] section displays the SCAP tailoring files "
"available in your organization.  Tailoring files allow you to customize "
"XCCDF profiles by enabling, disabling, or modifying specific rules without "
"changing the original SCAP content."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Audit[Tailoring Files] menampilkan berkas penyesuaian SCAP yang tersedia dalam organisasi Anda.  Berkas penyesuaian memungkinkan Anda menyesuaikan profil XCCDF dengan mengaktifkan, menonaktifkan, atau mengubah aturan tertentu tanpa mengubah konten SCAP asli."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-tailoring-files.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create] to upload a new tailoring file.  For more information "
"about uploading tailoring files, see <<ref-scap-tailoring-file-upload>>."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create] untuk mengunggah berkas penyesuaian baru.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengunggahan berkas penyesuaian, lihat <<ref-scap-tailoring-file-upload>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-tailoring-files.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Each row in the list provides btn:[Edit] and btn:[Delete] action buttons.  "
"Use btn:[Edit] to modify the name, description, or replace the uploaded "
"tailoring file.  Use btn:[Delete] to remove the tailoring file entry.  A "
"confirmation dialog is displayed before deletion."
msgstr "Setiap baris dalam daftar menyediakan tombol tindakan btn:[Edit] dan btn:[Delete].  Gunakan btn:[Edit] untuk mengubah nama, deskripsi, atau mengganti berkas penyesuaian yang telah diunggah.  Gunakan btn:[Delete] untuk menghapus entri berkas penyesuaian.  Dialog konfirmasi ditampilkan sebelum penghapusan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-tailoring-files.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can filter the list using the search bar, which searches across the "
"label and file name fields."
msgstr "Anda dapat memfilter daftar menggunakan bilah pencarian, yang menelusuri kolom label dan nama berkas."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-tailoring-files.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tailoring Files List Columns"
msgstr "Kolom Daftar Berkas Penyesuaian"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-tailoring-files.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column             | Description\n"
"| Label              | The display name of the tailoring file.\n"
"| Tailoring File Name | The file name of the uploaded tailoring file.\n"
"| Actions            | Available actions: Edit and Delete.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom                  | Deskripsi\n"
"| Label                  | Nama tampilan berkas penyesuaian.\n"
"| Nama Berkas Penyesuaian | Nama berkas penyesuaian yang diunggah.\n"
"| Tindakan               | Tindakan yang tersedia: Edit dan Hapus.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-tailoring-files.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload tailoring file"
msgstr "Mengunggah berkas penyesuaian"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-tailoring-files.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The menu:Audit[Tailoring Files > Create] page allows you to upload a new "
"tailoring file."
msgstr "Halaman menu:Audit[Tailoring Files > Create] memungkinkan Anda mengunggah berkas penyesuaian baru."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-tailoring-files.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload Tailoring File Fields"
msgstr "Kolom Pengunggahan Berkas Penyesuaian"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-tailoring-files.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field          | Required | Description\n"
"| Name           | Yes      | A display name for the tailoring file.\n"
"| Description    | No       | A brief description of the tailoring file.\n"
"| Tailoring File | Yes      | The tailoring XML file (`.xml`) to upload.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom              | Wajib    | Deskripsi\n"
"| Nama               | Ya | Nama tampilan untuk berkas penyesuaian.\n"
"| Deskripsi          | Tidak    | Deskripsi singkat berkas penyesuaian.\n"
"| Berkas Penyesuaian | Ya       | Berkas XML penyesuaian (`.xml`) yang akan diunggah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-tailoring-files.adoc:12
msgid "Click btn:[Upload] to save the new tailoring file."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Upload] untuk menyimpan berkas penyesuaian baru."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-tailoring-files.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit tailoring file"
msgstr "Mengedit berkas penyesuaian"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-scap-tailoring-files.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The menu:Audit[Tailoring Files > Edit] page allows you to update an existing "
"tailoring file entry.  You can change the name, description, or upload a "
"replacement file.  If you do not upload a new file, the existing file is "
"retained."
msgstr "Halaman menu:Audit[Tailoring Files > Edit] memungkinkan Anda memperbarui entri berkas penyesuaian yang sudah ada.  Anda dapat mengubah nama, deskripsi, atau mengunggah berkas pengganti.  Jika Anda tidak mengunggah berkas baru, berkas yang ada akan dipertahankan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-subscription-matching.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subscription Matching"
msgstr "Pencocokan Langganan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-subscription-matching.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Audit[Subscription Matching] section provides reports that match "
"your currently installed clients to your existing product subscriptions.  "
"Subscription matching reports provide information about clients that do not "
"have a subscription, and subscription start and end dates."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Audit[Subscription Matching] menyediakan laporan yang mencocokkan klien yang saat ini terinstal dengan langganan produk yang Anda miliki.  Laporan pencocokan langganan memberikan informasi tentang klien yang tidak memiliki langganan, serta tanggal mulai dan berakhirnya langganan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-subscription-matching.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subscription Matching Options"
msgstr "Opsi Pencocokan Langganan"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-subscription-matching.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column          | Description\n"
"| Part Number     | Identifier of the matched product\n"
"| Description     | Description of the matched product\n"
"| Policy          | The type of subscription matched to the product\n"
"| Matched/Total   | The number of clients currently using the subscription, "
"of the total available.\n"
"If the subscription is fully matched, the quantity column value is "
"highlighted.\n"
"| Start Date      | Start date of the subscription\n"
"| End Date        | End date of the subscription\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom           | Deskripsi\n"
"| Nomor Komponen  | Pengidentifikasi produk yang dicocokkan\n"
"| Deskripsi       | Deskripsi produk yang dicocokkan\n"
"| Kebijakan       | Jenis langganan yang dicocokkan dengan produk\n"
"| Dicocokkan/Total | Jumlah klien yang saat ini menggunakan langganan, dari total yang tersedia.\n"
"Jika langganan telah sepenuhnya dicocokkan, nilai pada kolom jumlah disorot.\n"
"| Tanggal Mulai   | Tanggal mulai langganan\n"
"| Tanggal Berakhir | Tanggal berakhirnya langganan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-subscription-matching.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Table entries are highlighted if they are due to expire within three "
"months.  Table entries that have already expired are shown in grayscale."
msgstr "Entri tabel disorot jika akan kedaluwarsa dalam tiga bulan.  Entri tabel yang sudah kedaluwarsa ditampilkan dalam skala abu-abu."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-subscription-matching.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For messages relating to subscription matching, navigate to the `Messages` "
"tab."
msgstr "Untuk melihat pesan terkait pencocokan langganan, buka tab `Messages`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-subscription-matching.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subscription Matching Messages"
msgstr "Pesan Pencocokan Langganan"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-subscription-matching.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Message                 | Type | Description | Action\n"
"| Unsupported part number detected | Debug | The detected part number is "
"unknown or unsupported. | Call {suse} support and open a Service Request "
"ticket to have the part number added to the product.\n"
"| Physical system is reported as virtual guest, please check hardware data          "
"| Debug | A client is reporting as virtual, but could be a physical "
"client. | Check the client hardware data.\n"
"| Virtual guest has unknown host, assuming it is a physical system | Warning "
"| A virtual client has an unknown host. During the matching process, it was "
"treated as a physical system. This might translate into a wrong subscription "
"assignment. | Check the virtual host manager (VHM) configuration to ensure "
"it is reporting correctly.\n"
"For Linux-based hosts using `libvirt`, check that the host is registered, "
"and that the virtual host system type is set correctly.\n"
"| System has an unknown number of sockets, assuming 16 | Warning | Unable to "
"determine how many CPUs a client has. {productname} used the default value "
"of 16 CPUs every time the number was relevant for matching a "
"subscription. This might translate into a wrong subscription assignment. | "
"Schedule a hardware refresh on this client.\n"
"| Two subscriptions with the same part number are in a bundle | "
"Informational | Two subscriptions were identified to be part of a bundle "
"and, as result, they were merged together during the computation process. | "
"No actions needed.\n"
"| Two subscriptions with the same part number (and other properties) have "
"been merged together | Informational | Two subscription shared multiple "
"common properties and they were merged together during the computation "
"process. | No actions needed.\n"
"| Pinned match adjusted due to merged subscriptions | Informational | A user "
"defined pin was updated since the chosen subscription was merged with "
"another one. | No actions needed.\n"
"| Subscription with unsupported part number and no associated product has "
"been ignored. | Informational | An unknown subscription without any "
"associated product has been detected and it was ignored during the matching "
"process. | No actions needed.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Pesan                   | Jenis | Deskripsi | Tindakan\n"
"| Nomor komponen yang tidak didukung terdeteksi | Debug | Nomor komponen yang terdeteksi tidak dikenal atau tidak didukung. | Hubungi dukungan {suse} dan buat tiket Service Request agar nomor komponen ditambahkan ke produk.\n"
"| Sistem fisik dilaporkan sebagai tamu virtual, periksa data perangkat keras | Debug | Klien melaporkan dirinya sebagai sistem virtual, tetapi mungkin merupakan klien fisik. | Periksa data perangkat keras klien.\n"
"| Host tamu virtual tidak diketahui, dianggap sebagai sistem fisik | Peringatan | Klien virtual memiliki host yang tidak diketahui. Selama proses pencocokan, klien tersebut diperlakukan sebagai sistem fisik. Hal ini dapat menyebabkan penetapan langganan yang salah. | Periksa konfigurasi virtual host manager (VHM) untuk memastikan pelaporannya benar.\n"
"Untuk host berbasis Linux yang menggunakan `libvirt`, pastikan host telah terdaftar dan jenis sistem host virtual telah diatur dengan benar.\n"
"| Jumlah soket sistem tidak diketahui, dianggap 16 | Peringatan | Jumlah CPU yang dimiliki klien tidak dapat ditentukan. {productname} menggunakan nilai default 16 CPU setiap kali jumlah tersebut diperlukan untuk pencocokan langganan. Hal ini dapat menyebabkan penetapan langganan yang salah. | Jadwalkan penyegaran data perangkat keras pada klien ini.\n"
"| Dua langganan dengan nomor komponen yang sama berada dalam satu bundel | Informasi | Dua langganan diidentifikasi sebagai bagian dari satu bundel dan, sebagai hasilnya, digabungkan selama proses perhitungan. | Tidak diperlukan tindakan.\n"
"| Dua langganan dengan nomor komponen yang sama (dan properti lainnya) telah digabungkan | Informasi | Dua langganan memiliki beberapa properti yang sama dan digabungkan selama proses perhitungan. | Tidak diperlukan tindakan.\n"
"| Pencocokan yang disematkan disesuaikan karena penggabungan langganan | Informasi | Penyematan yang ditentukan pengguna diperbarui karena langganan yang dipilih digabungkan dengan langganan lain. | Tidak diperlukan tindakan.\n"
"| Langganan dengan nomor komponen yang tidak didukung dan tanpa produk terkait telah diabaikan. | Informasi | Langganan yang tidak dikenal tanpa produk terkait terdeteksi dan diabaikan selama proses pencocokan. | Tidak diperlukan tindakan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-subscription-matching.adoc:9
msgid "To pin clients to a particular subscription, navigate to the `Pins` tab."
msgstr "Untuk menyematkan klien ke langganan tertentu, buka tab `Pins`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-subscription-matching.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pin Statuses"
msgstr "Status Penyematan"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-subscription-matching.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Status                  | Description\n"
"| Satisfied               | The client and subscription were matched "
"correctly.\n"
"| Not satisfied           | The client was not successfully matched with a "
"subscription.\n"
"| Pending next run        | Waiting for the next matcher run.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Status                  | Deskripsi\n"
"| Terpenuhi               | Klien dan langganan berhasil dicocokkan dengan benar.\n"
"| Tidak terpenuhi         | Klien tidak berhasil dicocokkan dengan langganan.\n"
"| Menunggu pelaksanaan berikutnya | Menunggu pelaksanaan proses pencocokan berikutnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/audit-subscription-matching.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For more information about subscription matching, see "
"xref:administration:subscription-matching.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pencocokan langganan, lihat xref:administration:subscription-matching.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-advanced-search.adoc:1
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/package.adoc:28
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/advanced-search.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced Search"
msgstr "Pencarian Lanjutan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-advanced-search.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Advanced Search] section allows you to search "
"through OpenSCAP scans and results."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Advanced Search] memungkinkan Anda menelusuri pemindaian dan hasil OpenSCAP."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-all-scans.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "All Scans"
msgstr "Semua Pemindaian"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-all-scans.adoc:3
msgid ""
"￼The Security Content Automation Protocol (SCAP) is a synthesis of "
"interoperable specifications derived from community ideas."
msgstr "￼Security Content Automation Protocol (SCAP) merupakan gabungan spesifikasi yang dapat saling beroperasi dan berasal dari gagasan komunitas."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-all-scans.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenSCAP Scan Details"
msgstr "Detail Pemindaian OpenSCAP"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-all-scans.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Name          | Description | Evaluation Results\n"
"| System        | The name of the scanned client. |\n"
"| XCCDF Profile | The evaluated profile. |\n"
"| Completed     | The time that the scan was completed. |\n"
"| Satisfied     | The total number of rules that have been satisfied. | A "
"rule is satisfied if the result of the evaluation is `Pass` or `Fixed`.\n"
"| Dissatisfied  | The total number of rules that are not satisfied. | A rule "
"is dissatisfied if the result of the evaluation is `Fail`.\n"
"| Unknown | The total number of rules that were not able to be evaluated. | "
"A rule is unknown if the result of the evaluation is `Error`, `Unknown` or "
"`Not checked`.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nama          | Deskripsi | Hasil Evaluasi\n"
"| Sistem        | Nama klien yang dipindai. |\n"
"| Profil XCCDF  | Profil yang dievaluasi. |\n"
"| Selesai       | Waktu pemindaian selesai. |\n"
"| Terpenuhi     | Jumlah total aturan yang telah terpenuhi. | Aturan dianggap terpenuhi jika hasil evaluasinya adalah `Pass` atau `Fixed`.\n"
"| Tidak Terpenuhi | Jumlah total aturan yang tidak terpenuhi. | Aturan dianggap tidak terpenuhi jika hasil evaluasinya adalah `Fail`.\n"
"| Tidak Diketahui | Jumlah total aturan yang tidak dapat dievaluasi. | Aturan dianggap tidak diketahui jika hasil evaluasinya adalah `Error`, `Unknown`, atau `Not checked`.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-all-scans.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Rules can also return other results, including `Informational`, `Not "
"Applicable`, or `Not Selected`.  Rules that return these results are not "
"shown in the scan results."
msgstr "Aturan juga dapat memberikan hasil lain, termasuk `Informational`, `Not Applicable`, atau `Not Selected`.  Aturan yang memberikan hasil tersebut tidak ditampilkan dalam hasil pemindaian."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenSCAP Menu"
msgstr "Menu OpenSCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-menu.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The Security Content Automation Protocol (SCAP) is a synthesis of "
"interoperable specifications derived from community ideas.  {productname} "
"uses OpenSCAP to implement the SCAP specifications."
msgstr "Security Content Automation Protocol (SCAP) merupakan gabungan spesifikasi yang dapat saling beroperasi dan berasal dari gagasan komunitas.  {productname} menggunakan OpenSCAP untuk menerapkan spesifikasi SCAP."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-xccdf-diff.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "XCCDF Diff"
msgstr "XCCDF Diff"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/audit/openscap-xccdf-diff.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > XCCDF Diff] section allows you to compare two "
"OpenSCAP XCCDF scans."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > XCCDF Diff] memungkinkan Anda membandingkan dua pemindaian XCCDF OpenSCAP."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-bootstrap.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrapping Command Line Tools"
msgstr "Alat Baris Perintah Bootstrapping"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-bootstrap.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To access a shell inside the Server container run `mgrctl term` on the "
"container host. From there, one can run the CLI tools as usual."
msgstr "Untuk mengakses shell di dalam kontainer Server, jalankan `mgrctl term` pada host kontainer. Dari sana, Anda dapat menjalankan alat CLI seperti biasa."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-bootstrap.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The `mgr-create-bootstrap-repo` tool allows you to create a bootstrap "
"repository."
msgstr "Alat `mgr-create-bootstrap-repo` memungkinkan Anda membuat repositori bootstrap."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-bootstrap.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Use the `mgr-create-bootstrap-repo` command on the {productname} Server to "
"create a new bootstrap repository.  The `-l` option lists all available "
"repositories:"
msgstr "Gunakan perintah `mgr-create-bootstrap-repo` pada Server {productname} untuk membuat repositori bootstrap baru.  Opsi `-l` mencantumkan semua repositori yang tersedia:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-bootstrap.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -l\n"
msgstr "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -l\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-bootstrap.adoc:6
msgid "Give the repository name to create the bootstrap repository you require:"
msgstr "Berikan nama repositori untuk membuat repositori bootstrap yang Anda perlukan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-bootstrap.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo <repo-name>\n"
msgstr "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo <repo-name>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-bootstrap.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You can also create a new bootstrap repository from a custom channel, with "
"the `--with-custom-channels` option:"
msgstr "Anda juga dapat membuat repositori bootstrap baru dari saluran khusus menggunakan opsi `--with-custom-channels`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-bootstrap.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --with-custom-channels\n"
msgstr "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --with-custom-channels\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-bootstrap.adoc:10
msgid ""
"If you create a bootstrap repository that contains custom channels, and "
"later attempt to rebuild with the `mgr-create-bootstrap-repo` command, the "
"custom channel information will remain in the bootstrap repository.  To "
"remove custom channel information from your bootstrap repository, use the "
"`--flush` option when you rebuild:"
msgstr "Jika Anda membuat repositori bootstrap yang berisi saluran khusus, lalu mencoba membangunnya ulang menggunakan perintah `mgr-create-bootstrap-repo`, informasi saluran khusus akan tetap berada dalam repositori bootstrap.  Untuk menghapus informasi saluran khusus dari repositori bootstrap Anda, gunakan opsi `--flush` saat membangunnya ulang:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-bootstrap.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --flush\n"
msgstr "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --flush\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Management CLI Tools"
msgstr "Alat CLI Pengelolaan Saluran"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-channels.adoc:2
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:2
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:2
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:2
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To access a shell inside the Server container, run `mgrctl term` on the "
"container host. From there, one can run the CLI tools as usual."
msgstr "Untuk mengakses shell di dalam kontainer Server, jalankan `mgrctl term` pada host kontainer. Dari sana, Anda dapat menjalankan alat CLI seperti biasa."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-channels.adoc:3
msgid ""
"There are tools for managing channels on the server.  With "
"`spacewalk-remove-channel`, list and delete channels in various ways."
msgstr "Tersedia alat untuk mengelola saluran pada server.  Gunakan `spacewalk-remove-channel` untuk mencantumkan dan menghapus saluran dengan berbagai cara."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-channels.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Channels with `spacewalk-remove-channel`"
msgstr "Mengelola Saluran dengan `spacewalk-remove-channel`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-channels.adoc:5
msgid "Usage: spacewalk-remove-channel [options]"
msgstr "Penggunaan: spacewalk-remove-channel [options]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-channels.adoc:6
msgid "The use of `spacewalk-remove-channel` is to remove channels in various ways."
msgstr "`spacewalk-remove-channel` digunakan untuk menghapus saluran dengan berbagai cara."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-channels.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The available commands and arguments for `spacewalk-remove-channel` are "
"listed in this table.  Use this syntax for `spacewalk-remove-channel` "
"commands:"
msgstr "Perintah dan argumen yang tersedia untuk `spacewalk-remove-channel` dicantumkan dalam tabel ini.  Gunakan sintaks berikut untuk perintah `spacewalk-remove-channel`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-channels.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-remove-channel [options]\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-remove-channel [options]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-channels.adoc:9
msgid "The `spacewalk-remove-channel` tool has these primary commands:"
msgstr "Alat `spacewalk-remove-channel` memiliki perintah utama berikut:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-channels.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-remove-channel Options"
msgstr "Opsi spacewalk-remove-channel"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-channels.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option\n"
"| Description\n"
"| Example Use\n"
"\n"
"| list\n"
"| List defined channels and exit.\n"
"| `spacewalk-remove-channel --list`\n"
"\n"
"| channel\n"
"| Delete this channel (can be present multiple times).\n"
"| `spacewalk-remove-channel --channel=CHANNEL`\n"
"\n"
"| channel-with-children\n"
"| Delete this channel and its child channels (can be present multiple "
"times).\n"
"| `spacewalk-remove-channel --channel-with-children=CHANNEL_WITH_CHILDREN`\n"
"\n"
"| unsubscribe\n"
"| Unsubscribe systems registered to the specified channels. Note: "
"Credentials are needed\n"
"| `spacewalk-remove-channel --unsubscribe`\n"
"\n"
"| justdb\n"
"| Delete only from the database, do not remove files from disk.\n"
"| `spacewalk-remove-channel --justdb`\n"
"\n"
"| just-kickstart-trees\n"
"| Remove only the kickstart trees for the channels specified.\n"
"| `spacewalk-remove-channel --just-kickstart-trees`\n"
"\n"
"| skip-channels\n"
"| Remove only packages from channel not the channel itself.\n"
"| `spacewalk-remove-channel --skip-channels`\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| Opsi\n"
"| Deskripsi\n"
"| Contoh Penggunaan\n"
"\n"
"| list\n"
"| Mencantumkan saluran yang telah ditentukan, lalu keluar.\n"
"| `spacewalk-remove-channel --list`\n"
"\n"
"| channel\n"
"| Menghapus saluran ini (dapat ditentukan beberapa kali).\n"
"| `spacewalk-remove-channel --channel=CHANNEL`\n"
"\n"
"| channel-with-children\n"
"| Menghapus saluran ini beserta saluran turunannya (dapat ditentukan beberapa kali).\n"
"| `spacewalk-remove-channel --channel-with-children=CHANNEL_WITH_CHILDREN`\n"
"\n"
"| unsubscribe\n"
"| Membatalkan langganan sistem yang terdaftar ke saluran yang ditentukan. Catatan: Kredensial diperlukan\n"
"| `spacewalk-remove-channel --unsubscribe`\n"
"\n"
"| justdb\n"
"| Menghapus hanya dari basis data, tanpa menghapus berkas dari disk.\n"
"| `spacewalk-remove-channel --justdb`\n"
"\n"
"| just-kickstart-trees\n"
"| Menghapus hanya pohon kickstart untuk saluran yang ditentukan.\n"
"| `spacewalk-remove-channel --just-kickstart-trees`\n"
"\n"
"| skip-channels\n"
"| Menghapus hanya paket dari saluran, bukan saluran itu sendiri.\n"
"| `spacewalk-remove-channel --skip-channels`\n"
"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-channels.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For a complete list of options and abbreviated options, see the `--help` "
"output or the `spacewalk-remove-channel` manpage:"
msgstr "Untuk daftar lengkap opsi dan opsi singkat, lihat keluaran `--help` atau halaman manual `spacewalk-remove-channel`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-channels.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "man spacewalk-remove-channel\n"
msgstr "man spacewalk-remove-channel\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-channels.adoc:14
msgid "For more information, see xref:administration:removing-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:administration:removing-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronization CLI Tools"
msgstr "Alat CLI Sinkronisasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:3
msgid ""
"There are two tools for synchronizing clients to the server.  For clients "
"that are connected to the {scclongform}, use `mgr-sync`.  For all other "
"clients, use `spacewalk-repo-sync`."
msgstr "Tersedia dua alat untuk menyinkronkan klien ke server.  Untuk klien yang terhubung ke {scclongform}, gunakan `mgr-sync`.  Untuk semua klien lainnya, gunakan `spacewalk-repo-sync`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize {scc} Repositories With mgr-sync"
msgstr "Menyinkronkan Repositori {scc} dengan mgr-sync"

#. This content is the same as the content at modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc Perhaps we should snippet it? --LKB 2020-10-09
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The primary use of `mgr-sync` is to connect to the {scclongform}, retrieve "
"product and package information, and prepare channels for synchronization "
"with the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Kegunaan utama `mgr-sync` adalah untuk terhubung ke {scclongform}, mengambil informasi produk dan paket, serta menyiapkan saluran untuk sinkronisasi dengan Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:6
msgid ""
"This tool is designed for use with a {suse} support subscription.  It is not "
"required for open source distributions, including {opensuse}, {centos}, and "
"{ubuntu}."
msgstr "Alat ini dirancang untuk digunakan dengan langganan dukungan {suse}.  Alat ini tidak diperlukan untuk distribusi sumber terbuka, termasuk {opensuse}, {centos}, dan {ubuntu}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The available commands and arguments for `mgr-sync` are listed in this "
"table.  Use this syntax for `mgr-sync` commands:"
msgstr "Perintah dan argumen yang tersedia untuk `mgr-sync` dicantumkan dalam tabel ini.  Gunakan sintaks berikut untuk perintah `mgr-sync`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync [-h] [--version] [-v] [-s] [-d {1,2,3}] {list,add,refresh,delete}\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync [-h] [--version] [-v] [-s] [-d {1,2,3}] {list,add,refresh,delete}\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync Commands"
msgstr "Perintah mgr-sync"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command | Description | Example Use\n"
"| list | List channels, organization credentials, or products | `mgr-sync "
"list channels`\n"
"| add | Add channels, organization credentials, or products | `mgr-sync add "
"channel <channel_name>`\n"
"| refresh | Refresh the local copy of products, channels, and subscriptions "
"| `mgr-sync refresh`\n"
"| delete | Delete existing {scc} organization credentials from the local "
"system | `mgr-sync delete credentials`\n"
"| sync | Synchronize specified channel or ask for it when left blank| "
"`mgr-sync sync channel <channel_name>`\n"
msgstr ""
"| Perintah | Deskripsi | Contoh Penggunaan\n"
"| list | Mencantumkan saluran, kredensial organisasi, atau produk | `mgr-sync list channels`\n"
"| add | Menambahkan saluran, kredensial organisasi, atau produk | `mgr-sync add channel <channel_name>`\n"
"| refresh | Menyegarkan salinan lokal produk, saluran, dan langganan | `mgr-sync refresh`\n"
"| delete | Menghapus kredensial organisasi {scc} yang ada dari sistem lokal | `mgr-sync delete credentials`\n"
"| sync | Menyinkronkan saluran yang ditentukan atau meminta saluran jika tidak ditentukan| `mgr-sync sync channel <channel_name>`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:11
msgid "To see the full list of options specific to a command, use this command:"
msgstr "Untuk melihat daftar lengkap opsi khusus suatu perintah, gunakan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync <command> --help\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync <command> --help\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync Optional Arguments"
msgstr "Argumen Opsional mgr-sync"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option | Abbreviated option | Description | Example Use\n"
"| help | `h` | Display the command usage and options | `mgr-sync --help`\n"
"| version | N/A | Display the currently installed version of `mgr-sync` | "
"`mgr-sync --version`\n"
"| verbose | `v` | Provide verbose output | `mgr-sync --verbose refresh`\n"
"| store-credentials | `s` | Store credentials a local hidden file | "
"`mgr-sync --store-credentials`\n"
"| debug | `d` | Log additional debugging information. Requires a level of 1, "
"2, 3. 3 provides the highest amnount of debugging information | `mgr-sync -d "
"3 refresh`\n"
"| no-sync | N/A | Use with the `add` command to add products or channels "
"without beginning a synchronization | `mgr-sync --no-sync add "
"<channel_name>`\n"
msgstr ""
"| Opsi | Opsi singkat | Deskripsi | Contoh Penggunaan\n"
"| help | `h` | Menampilkan penggunaan dan opsi perintah | `mgr-sync --help`\n"
"| version | N/A | Menampilkan versi `mgr-sync` yang saat ini terinstal | `mgr-sync --version`\n"
"| verbose | `v` | Menyediakan keluaran terperinci | `mgr-sync --verbose refresh`\n"
"| store-credentials | `s` | Menyimpan kredensial dalam berkas tersembunyi lokal | `mgr-sync --store-credentials`\n"
"| debug | `d` | Mencatat informasi debugging tambahan. Memerlukan tingkat 1, 2, atau 3. Tingkat 3 menyediakan informasi debugging paling banyak | `mgr-sync -d 3 refresh`\n"
"| no-sync | N/A | Digunakan bersama perintah `add` untuk menambahkan produk atau saluran tanpa memulai sinkronisasi | `mgr-sync --no-sync add <channel_name>`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:15
msgid "Logs for `mgr-sync` are located in:"
msgstr "Log untuk `mgr-sync` berada di:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:16
msgid "`/var/log/rhn/mgr-sync.log`"
msgstr "`/var/log/rhn/mgr-sync.log`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:17
msgid "`/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_api.log`"
msgstr "`/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_api.log`"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize Repositories with spacewalk-repo-sync"
msgstr "Menyinkronkan Repositori dengan spacewalk-repo-sync"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The `spacewalk-repo-sync` tool synchronizes software repositories into "
"{productname} channels.  In most cases, this happens automatically, but you "
"can use the tool to run it manually if required."
msgstr "Alat `spacewalk-repo-sync` menyinkronkan repositori perangkat lunak ke dalam saluran {productname}.  Dalam kebanyakan kasus, proses ini berlangsung secara otomatis, tetapi Anda dapat menggunakan alat ini untuk menjalankannya secara manual jika diperlukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:20
msgid "The `spacewalk-repo-sync` tool has these primary commands:"
msgstr "Alat `spacewalk-repo-sync` memiliki perintah utama berikut:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-repo-sync Options"
msgstr "Opsi spacewalk-repo-sync"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option\n"
"| Description\n"
"| Example Use\n"
"\n"
"| list\n"
"| List all custom channels and the repositories assigned to them.\n"
"| `spacewalk-repo-sync --list`\n"
"\n"
"| channel\n"
"| Synchronize a single channel to all repositories assigned to it.\n"
"| `spacewalk-repo-sync  --channel <custom-channel>`\n"
"\n"
"| deep-verify\n"
"| ignore cached package checksums.\n"
"| `spacewalk-repo-sync --deep-verify`\n"
"\n"
"| force-all-errata\n"
"| force re-importing all the patches.\n"
"| `spacewalk-repo-sync --deep-verify`\n"
"\n"
"| no-packages\n"
"| excludes packages from the operation.\n"
"| `spacewalk-repo-sync --deep-verify --no-packages`\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| Opsi\n"
"| Deskripsi\n"
"| Contoh Penggunaan\n"
"\n"
"| list\n"
"| Mencantumkan semua saluran khusus dan repositori yang ditetapkan ke saluran tersebut.\n"
"| `spacewalk-repo-sync --list`\n"
"\n"
"| channel\n"
"| Menyinkronkan satu saluran dengan semua repositori yang ditetapkan ke saluran tersebut.\n"
"| `spacewalk-repo-sync  --channel <custom-channel>`\n"
"\n"
"| deep-verify\n"
"| Mengabaikan checksum paket yang tersimpan dalam cache.\n"
"| `spacewalk-repo-sync --deep-verify`\n"
"\n"
"| force-all-errata\n"
"| Memaksa impor ulang semua patch.\n"
"| `spacewalk-repo-sync --deep-verify`\n"
"\n"
"| no-packages\n"
"| Mengecualikan paket dari operasi.\n"
"| `spacewalk-repo-sync --deep-verify --no-packages`\n"
"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:23
msgid "For a complete list of options, see the `spacewalk-repo-sync` manpage:"
msgstr "Untuk daftar lengkap opsi, lihat halaman manual `spacewalk-repo-sync`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "man spacewalk-repo-sync\n"
msgstr "man spacewalk-repo-sync\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Synchronization"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Sinkronisasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:26
msgid ""
"If you are having trouble synchronizing with `spacewalk-repo-sync` you can "
"find out more by watching the HTTP log as the command runs."
msgstr "Jika Anda mengalami masalah saat menyinkronkan dengan `spacewalk-repo-sync`, Anda dapat memperoleh informasi lebih lanjut dengan memantau log HTTP saat perintah dijalankan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Troubleshooting Synchronization Problems"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memecahkan Masalah Sinkronisasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:28
msgid "Log the HTTP output into `/var/log/zypper.log`:"
msgstr "Catat keluaran HTTP ke dalam `/var/log/zypper.log`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "ZYPP_MEDIA_CURL_DEBUG=2 spacewalk-repo-sync --channel <channel-label>\n"
msgstr "ZYPP_MEDIA_CURL_DEBUG=2 spacewalk-repo-sync --channel <channel-label>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:30
msgid "Export the setting:"
msgstr "Ekspor pengaturan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "export URLGRABBER_DEBUG=DEBUG\n"
msgstr "export URLGRABBER_DEBUG=DEBUG\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:32
msgid "Start the synchronization:"
msgstr "Mulai sinkronisasi:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync --channel <channel-label> --type yum\n"
msgstr "/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync --channel <channel-label> --type yum\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  You can increase the debug level, by adding the `-vvv` option to the "
"command.\n"
msgstr "  Anda dapat meningkatkan tingkat debug dengan menambahkan opsi `-vvv` ke perintah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the complete completes, or fails, disable debug mode:\n"
msgstr "Setelah perintah selesai atau gagal, nonaktifkan mode debug:\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "unset URLGRABBER_DEBUG\n"
msgstr "unset URLGRABBER_DEBUG\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add Custom Extra HTTP Headers"
msgstr "Menambahkan Header HTTP Tambahan Khusus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:38
msgid ""
"You can add custom HTTP headers to the requests made by "
"`spacewalk-repo-sync` at the time of synchronization.  The custom HTTP "
"headers are defined in the `/etc/rhn/spacewalk-repo-sync/extra_headers.conf` "
"configuration file.  The headers can be defined by repository name or "
"channel label.  You can also define global headers by putting them in the "
"`main` section.  For example:"
msgstr "Anda dapat menambahkan header HTTP khusus ke permintaan yang dibuat oleh `spacewalk-repo-sync` saat sinkronisasi.  Header HTTP khusus ditentukan dalam berkas konfigurasi `/etc/rhn/spacewalk-repo-sync/extra_headers.conf`.  Header dapat ditentukan berdasarkan nama repositori atau label saluran.  Anda juga dapat menentukan header global dengan menempatkannya di bagian `main`. Misalnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[testchannel]\n"
"X-MY-HEADER-1=VALUE\n"
"X-MY-HEADER-2=VALUE\n"
msgstr ""
"[testchannel]\n"
"X-MY-HEADER-1=VALUE\n"
"X-MY-HEADER-2=VALUE\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[mychannel]\n"
"X-MY-HEADER-3=VALUE\n"
"X-MY-HEADER-4=VALUE\n"
msgstr ""
"[mychannel]\n"
"X-MY-HEADER-3=VALUE\n"
"X-MY-HEADER-4=VALUE\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[main]\n"
"X-MYGLOBAL-HEADER=VALUE\n"
msgstr ""
"[main]\n"
"X-MYGLOBAL-HEADER=VALUE\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/cli-sync.adoc:42
msgid ""
"This can be particularly useful when dealing with Red Hat Update "
"Infrastructure (RHUI) repositories in the public cloud."
msgstr "Hal ini sangat berguna saat menangani repositori Red Hat Update Infrastructure (RHUI) di cloud publik."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/clm/clm-filters.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filters"
msgstr "Filter"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/clm/clm-filters.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In the menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] section, you can create various types "
"of filters.  With the filters you control the content that is used when a "
"content lifecycle project is built."
msgstr "Di bagian menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters], Anda dapat membuat berbagai jenis filter.  Dengan filter tersebut, Anda mengontrol konten yang digunakan saat proyek siklus hidup konten dibangun."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/clm/clm-filters.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/clm/clm-menu.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/clm/clm-projects.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about content lifecycle management, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan siklus hidup konten, lihat xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/clm/clm-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Lifecycle Management Menu"
msgstr "Menu Pengelolaan Siklus Hidup Konten"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/clm/clm-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In the `Content Lifecycle` section, you can customize and test packages "
"before updating production clients."
msgstr "Di bagian `Content Lifecycle`, Anda dapat menyesuaikan dan menguji paket sebelum memperbarui klien produksi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/clm/clm-menu.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Content lifecycle management allows you to select software channels as "
"sources, adjust them as required for your environment, and thoroughly test "
"them before installing onto your production clients."
msgstr "Pengelolaan siklus hidup konten memungkinkan Anda memilih saluran perangkat lunak sebagai sumber, menyesuaikannya sesuai kebutuhan lingkungan Anda, dan mengujinya secara menyeluruh sebelum menginstalnya pada klien produksi Anda."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/clm/clm-projects.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Projects"
msgstr "Proyek"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/clm/clm-projects.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In the menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] section, you can create new content "
"lifecycle management projects, and edit existing projects."
msgstr "Di bagian menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], Anda dapat membuat proyek pengelolaan siklus hidup konten baru dan mengedit proyek yang sudah ada."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Command Line Tools"
msgstr "Alat Baris Perintah"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:3
msgid ""
"There are several command line tools available in {productname}.  Every "
"action that can be completed using the {webui} can be performed at a command "
"prompt instead.  Additionally, there are some actions that can only be "
"performed at the command prompt."
msgstr "Tersedia beberapa alat baris perintah di {productname}.  Setiap tindakan yang dapat diselesaikan menggunakan {webui} juga dapat dilakukan melalui prompt perintah.  Selain itu, ada beberapa tindakan yang hanya dapat dilakukan melalui prompt perintah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:4
msgid "Manage package and channel synchronization with:"
msgstr "Kelola sinkronisasi paket dan saluran dengan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:5
msgid "`spacewalk-repo-sync`"
msgstr "`spacewalk-repo-sync`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:6
msgid "`mgr-sync`"
msgstr "`mgr-sync`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:7
msgid "Manage bootstrapping with:"
msgstr "Kelola bootstrapping dengan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:8
msgid "`mgr-create-bootstrap-repo`"
msgstr "`mgr-create-bootstrap-repo`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Some of these command line tools are installed by default.  To install a "
"command line tool, you can use the {productname} {webui}, or use your "
"package manager at the command prompt."
msgstr "Beberapa alat baris perintah ini diinstal secara default.  Untuk menginstal alat baris perintah, Anda dapat menggunakan {webui} {productname}, atau menggunakan pengelola paket melalui prompt perintah."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Command Line Tools with the WebUI"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal Alat Baris Perintah melalui WebUI"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List], select "
"the client to install the tool on, and navigate to the "
"menu:Software[Packages > Install] sub-tab."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[System List], pilih klien tempat alat akan diinstal, lalu buka subtab menu:Software[Packages > Install]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:12
msgid "Use the search tool to search for the command line tool you want to install."
msgstr "Gunakan alat pencarian untuk mencari alat baris perintah yang ingin Anda instal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:13
msgid "Check the package to install, and click btn:[Install Selected Packages]."
msgstr "Centang paket yang akan diinstal, lalu klik btn:[Install Selected Packages]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:14
msgid "Click btn:[Confirm] to begin installation."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Confirm] untuk memulai instalasi."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Command Line Tools from the Command Prompt"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal Alat Baris Perintah melalui Prompt Perintah"

#.  I tried this on my test install, and it worked on the client, but not the server. What's the server version? --LKB 2020-10-08
#.  On the server, either api/spacewalk or salt probably can be used, I think --ke 2023-11-28
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:16
msgid ""
"On the client that you want to install the packages on, at the command "
"prompt, as root, use zypper to install the package:"
msgstr "Pada klien tempat Anda ingin menginstal paket, gunakan zypper melalui prompt perintah sebagai root untuk menginstal paket:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/command-line-tools.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in <CLI_TOOL_NAME>\n"
msgstr "zypper in <CLI_TOOL_NAME>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:1
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "Saluran"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} manages configuration files through two channel types: `Config "
"Channels` and `State Channels`.  Config Channels store managed configuration "
"files.  State Channels use Salt states and provide an editable `init.sls` "
"file.  For more information about custom states, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-custom-states.adoc[]."
msgstr "{productname} mengelola berkas konfigurasi melalui dua jenis saluran: `Config Channels` dan `State Channels`.  Config Channels menyimpan berkas konfigurasi yang dikelola.  State Channels menggunakan state Salt dan menyediakan berkas `init.sls` yang dapat diedit.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang state khusus, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-custom-states.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click the name of the configuration channel to see the details page for that "
"channel.  If you click the number of files in the channel, you are taken to "
"the `List/Remove Files` page of that channel.  If you click the number of "
"systems subscribed to the configuration channel, you are taken to the "
"menu:Configuration Channel Details[Systems > Subscribed Systems] page for "
"that channel."
msgstr "Klik nama saluran konfigurasi untuk melihat halaman detail saluran tersebut.  Jika Anda mengeklik jumlah berkas dalam saluran, Anda akan diarahkan ke halaman `List/Remove Files` saluran tersebut.  Jika Anda mengeklik jumlah sistem yang berlangganan saluran konfigurasi, Anda akan diarahkan ke halaman menu:Configuration Channel Details[Systems > Subscribed Systems] untuk saluran tersebut."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Channel Details"
msgstr "Detail Saluran Konfigurasi"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran Umum"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The `Overview` page of the `Configuration Channel Details` page is divided "
"into several panels:"
msgstr "Halaman `Overview` pada halaman `Configuration Channel Details` terbagi menjadi beberapa panel:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Properties [Management]"
msgstr "Properti Saluran [Pengelolaan]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Edit the name, label, and description of the channel by clicking btn:[Edit "
"Properties]."
msgstr "Edit nama, label, dan deskripsi saluran dengan mengeklik btn:[Edit Properties]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Information"
msgstr "Informasi Saluran"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:10
msgid "Provides status information for the contents of the channel."
msgstr "Menyediakan informasi status konten saluran."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:11
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:9
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Actions"
msgstr "Tindakan Konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Provides access to the most common configuration tasks.  For Salt clients, "
"there is a link to edit the `init.sls` file."
msgstr "Menyediakan akses ke tugas konfigurasi yang paling umum.  Untuk klien Salt, tersedia tautan untuk mengedit berkas `init.sls`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:13
msgid ""
"This panel allows you to deploy, compare, and add and create files.  Some "
"action are only availalble if you have files created and clients assigned to "
"configuration channels."
msgstr "Panel ini memungkinkan Anda menerapkan, membandingkan, menambahkan, dan membuat berkas.  Beberapa tindakan hanya tersedia jika Anda telah membuat berkas dan menetapkan klien ke saluran konfigurasi."

#
#. Complete(?) list of:
#. Configuration Actions
#.     Deploy Files
#.     Deploy all configuration files to all subscribed systems
#.     Deploy selected configuration files to all subscribed systems
#.     Deploy all configuration files to selected subscribed systems
#.     Deploy selected configuration files to selected subscribed systems
#.     Compare Files
#.     Compare all files in channel to files on all subscribed systems
#.     Add/Create Files
#.     Create Configuration File or Directory
#.     Upload Configuration Files
#.     Import a File from Another Channel or System
#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "List/Remove Files"
msgstr "Mencantumkan/Menghapus Berkas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:15
msgid ""
"This page only appears if there are files in the configuration channel.  You "
"can remove files or copy the latest versions into other configuration "
"channels.  Check the box next to files you want to manipulate, then click "
"the action button at the bottom."
msgstr "Halaman ini hanya muncul jika terdapat berkas dalam saluran konfigurasi.  Anda dapat menghapus berkas atau menyalin versi terbarunya ke saluran konfigurasi lain.  Centang kotak di samping berkas yang ingin Anda kelola, lalu klik tombol tindakan di bagian bawah."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add Files"
msgstr "Menambahkan Berkas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The `Add Files` page has three subtabs of its own, which allow you to "
"`Upload`, `Import`, or `Create` configuration files to be included in the "
"channel."
msgstr "Halaman `Add Files` memiliki tiga subtab tersendiri, yang memungkinkan Anda melakukan `Upload`, `Import`, atau `Create` berkas konfigurasi untuk disertakan dalam saluran."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload File"
msgstr "Mengunggah Berkas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:19
msgid ""
"To upload a file into the configuration channel, browse for the file on your "
"local system, populate all fields, and click the btn:[Upload Configuration "
"File] button.  The `Filename/Path` field is the absolute path where the file "
"will be deployed."
msgstr "Untuk mengunggah berkas ke saluran konfigurasi, cari berkas pada sistem lokal Anda, isi semua kolom, lalu klik tombol btn:[Upload Configuration File].  Kolom `Filename/Path` merupakan jalur absolut tempat berkas akan diterapkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:20
msgid ""
"You can set the `Ownership` via the `user name` and `group name` and the "
"`Permissions` of the file when it is deployed."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengatur `Ownership` melalui `user name` dan `group name`, serta `Permissions` berkas saat diterapkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:21
msgid ""
"If the client has SELinux enabled, you can configure `SELinux contexts` to "
"enable the required file attributes (such as user, role, and file type)."
msgstr "Jika SELinux diaktifkan pada klien, Anda dapat mengonfigurasi `SELinux contexts` untuk mengaktifkan atribut berkas yang diperlukan (seperti pengguna, peran, dan jenis berkas)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:22
msgid ""
"You can use Jinja templating with grains or pillar data instead of legacy "
"macro delimiters."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan templat Jinja dengan data grains atau pillar sebagai pengganti pembatas makro lama."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import Files"
msgstr "Mengimpor Berkas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:24
msgid ""
"To import files from other configuration channels, check the box to the left "
"of any file you want to import.  Then click btn:[Import Configuration "
"Files]."
msgstr "Untuk mengimpor berkas dari saluran konfigurasi lain, centang kotak di sebelah kiri setiap berkas yang ingin Anda impor.  Lalu klik btn:[Import Configuration Files]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create File"
msgstr "Membuat Berkas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Create a configuration file, directory, or symbolic link to be included in "
"the configuration channel."
msgstr "Buat berkas konfigurasi, direktori, atau tautan simbolis untuk disertakan dalam saluran konfigurasi."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:27
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy Files"
msgstr "Menerapkan Berkas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:28
msgid ""
"This page only appears when there are files in the channel and a system is "
"subscribed to the channel.  Deploy all files by clicking the btn:[Deploy All "
"Files] button or check selected files and click the btn:[Deploy Selected "
"Files] button.  Select to which systems the files should be applied.  All "
"systems subscribed to this channel are listed.  If you want to apply the "
"file to a different system, subscribe it to the channel first.  To deploy "
"the files, click btn:[Confirm & Deploy to Selected Systems]."
msgstr "Halaman ini hanya muncul jika terdapat berkas dalam saluran dan ada sistem yang berlangganan saluran tersebut.  Terapkan semua berkas dengan mengeklik tombol btn:[Deploy All Files], atau centang berkas yang dipilih lalu klik tombol btn:[Deploy Selected Files].  Pilih sistem tempat berkas akan diterapkan.  Semua sistem yang berlangganan saluran ini dicantumkan.  Jika Anda ingin menerapkan berkas ke sistem lain, daftarkan sistem tersebut ke saluran terlebih dahulu.  Untuk menerapkan berkas, klik btn:[Confirm & Deploy to Selected Systems]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:29
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:7
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Systems"
msgstr "Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:30
msgid "Manage systems subscribed to the configuration channel with two subtabs:"
msgstr "Kelola sistem yang berlangganan saluran konfigurasi melalui dua subtab:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:31
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subscribed Systems"
msgstr "Sistem yang Berlangganan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:32
msgid ""
"All systems subscribed to the current channel are displayed.  Click the name "
"of a system to see the `System Details` page.  To unsubscribe a system from "
"the configuration channel, check the box to the left of the system name and "
"click btn:[Unsubscribe systems]."
msgstr "Semua sistem yang berlangganan saluran saat ini ditampilkan.  Klik nama sistem untuk melihat halaman `System Details`.  Untuk membatalkan langganan sistem dari saluran konfigurasi, centang kotak di sebelah kiri nama sistem, lalu klik btn:[Unsubscribe systems]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:33
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-systems-target.adoc:1
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Target Systems"
msgstr "Sistem Target"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-channels.adoc:34
msgid ""
"This subtab displays a list of systems enabled for configuration management "
"but not yet subscribed to the channel.  To add a system to the configuration "
"channel, check the box to the left of the system name and click "
"btn:[Subscribe systems]."
msgstr "Subtab ini menampilkan daftar sistem yang telah diaktifkan untuk pengelolaan konfigurasi tetapi belum berlangganan saluran.  Untuk menambahkan sistem ke saluran konfigurasi, centang kotak di sebelah kiri nama sistem, lalu klik btn:[Subscribe systems]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-files.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Files"
msgstr "Berkas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-files.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This page lists the configuration files managed by {productname} through "
"configuration channels."
msgstr "Halaman ini mencantumkan berkas konfigurasi yang dikelola oleh {productname} melalui saluran konfigurasi."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-files.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Files Columns"
msgstr "Kolom Berkas"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-files.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column                | Description\n"
"| Path                  | Absolute filename of the configuration file.\n"
"| Configuration Channel | Name of the configuration channel that contains "
"the file.\n"
"| Systems Subscribed    | Number of systems subscribed to the channel.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom                 | Deskripsi\n"
"| Jalur                 | Nama berkas absolut dari berkas konfigurasi.\n"
"| Saluran Konfigurasi   | Nama saluran konfigurasi yang berisi berkas.\n"
"| Sistem yang Berlangganan | Jumlah sistem yang berlangganan saluran.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-files.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Click the `Path` of a file to see its `Details` tab.  Click the name of the "
"`Configuration Channel` to see the `Overview` tab of the channel.  Clicking "
"`Systems Subscribed` shows all systems currently subscribed to the channel "
"containing that file."
msgstr "Klik `Path` berkas untuk melihat tab `Details`.  Klik nama `Configuration Channel` untuk melihat tab `Overview` saluran.  Mengeklik `Systems Subscribed` akan menampilkan semua sistem yang saat ini berlangganan saluran yang berisi berkas tersebut."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-files.adoc:6
msgid ""
"By default, the maximum file size for configuration files is 128 KB "
"(131072 bytes).  {suse} supports a configuration file size up to 1 MB.  "
"Larger files are not guaranteed to work."
msgstr "Secara default, ukuran maksimum berkas konfigurasi adalah 128 KB (131072 byte).  {suse} mendukung ukuran berkas konfigurasi hingga 1 MB.  Berkas yang lebih besar tidak dijamin dapat berfungsi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-files.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# 2010-12-21 - ke: will \"rhn\" stay here? 2010-12-28 - kkaempf: \"rhn\" "
"will\n"
"    stay here. #\n"
msgstr ""
"# 2010-12-21 - ke: apakah \"rhn\" akan tetap di sini? 2010-12-28 - kkaempf: \"rhn\" akan\n"
"    tetap di sini. #\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-files.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The default maximum file size is set on the {productname} Server in these "
"files:"
msgstr "Ukuran maksimum default berkas ditetapkan pada Server {productname} dalam berkas berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-files.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# /usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_web.conf\n"
"web.maximum_config_file_size = 131072\n"
msgstr ""
"# /usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_web.conf\n"
"web.maximum_config_file_size = 131072\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-files.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# /usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_server.conf\n"
"maximum_config_file_size = 131072\n"
msgstr ""
"# /usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_server.conf\n"
"maximum_config_file_size = 131072\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-files.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Copy these variables to `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` and edit them.  Values are "
"specified in bytes, for example:"
msgstr "Salin variabel ini ke `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`, lalu edit nilainya.  Nilai ditentukan dalam byte, misalnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-files.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"web.maximum_config_file_size = 262144\n"
"server.maximum_config_file_size = 262144\n"
msgstr ""
"# /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"web.maximum_config_file_size = 262144\n"
"server.maximum_config_file_size = 262144\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-files.adoc:13
msgid "Then restart `spacewalk`:"
msgstr "Lalu mulai ulang `spacewalk`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-files.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-service restart\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-service restart\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Menu"
msgstr "Menu Konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The `Configuration` section provides access to features for managing the "
"configuration of {productname} clients."
msgstr "Bagian `Configuration` menyediakan akses ke fitur untuk mengelola konfigurasi klien {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-menu.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The `Configuration` menu is only available if you are signed in with a "
"configuration administrator or {productname} administrator account."
msgstr "Menu `Configuration` hanya tersedia jika Anda masuk menggunakan akun administrator konfigurasi atau administrator {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-menu.adoc:4
msgid "Within the configuration pages, you can:"
msgstr "Dalam halaman konfigurasi, Anda dapat:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-menu.adoc:5
msgid "manage clients using configuration files"
msgstr "mengelola klien menggunakan berkas konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-menu.adoc:6
msgid "configure channels offering configuration files"
msgstr "mengonfigurasi saluran yang menyediakan berkas konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-menu.adoc:7
msgid "manage configuration files themselves"
msgstr "mengelola berkas konfigurasi itu sendiri"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran Umum Konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Configuration[Overview] section is a dashboard that contains a "
"summary of the configuration files that are managed by your organization in "
"{productname}.  The overview summarizes managed systems, configuration "
"channels, and files stored in configuration channels."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Configuration[Overview] merupakan dasbor yang berisi ringkasan berkas konfigurasi yang dikelola oleh organisasi Anda di {productname}.  Gambaran umum ini merangkum sistem yang dikelola, saluran konfigurasi, dan berkas yang disimpan dalam saluran konfigurasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about managing configuration files, see "
"xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan berkas konfigurasi, lihat xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Summary"
msgstr "Ringkasan Konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Provides quick information about your configuration files.  Click the blue "
"text to the right to display:"
msgstr "Menyediakan informasi singkat tentang berkas konfigurasi Anda.  Klik teks biru di sebelah kanan untuk menampilkan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:6
msgid "Systems with managed configuration files"
msgstr "Sistem dengan berkas konfigurasi yang dikelola"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:7
msgid "Configuration channels"
msgstr "Saluran konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:8
msgid "Managed configuration files"
msgstr "Berkas konfigurasi yang dikelola"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:10
msgid ""
"`Configuration Actions` offers direct access to the most common "
"configuration management tasks:"
msgstr "`Configuration Actions` menyediakan akses langsung ke tugas pengelolaan konfigurasi yang paling umum:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:11
msgid "View clients with managed configuration files"
msgstr "Melihat klien dengan berkas konfigurasi yang dikelola"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:12
msgid "View all managed configuration files"
msgstr "Melihat semua berkas konfigurasi yang dikelola"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:13
msgid "View all managed configuration channels"
msgstr "Melihat semua saluran konfigurasi yang dikelola"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:14
msgid "Create a new configuration or state channel"
msgstr "Membuat saluran konfigurasi atau state baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:15
msgid "Enable configuration management on clients"
msgstr "Mengaktifkan pengelolaan konfigurasi pada klien"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recently Modified Configuration Files"
msgstr "Berkas Konfigurasi yang Baru Diubah"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The list shows which files have changed when and to which channel they "
"belong.  If no files have been changed, no list appears."
msgstr "Daftar ini menampilkan berkas yang telah diubah, waktu perubahannya, dan saluran tempat berkas tersebut berada.  Jika tidak ada berkas yang diubah, daftar tidak ditampilkan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recently Modified Configuration Files Columns"
msgstr "Kolom Berkas Konfigurasi yang Baru Diubah"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column               | Description\n"
"| Filename \t       | Absolute filename of the configuration file.\n"
"| Configuration Channel | Name of the configuration channel.\n"
"| Modified              | The time and date the file was modified.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom                 | Deskripsi\n"
"| Nama Berkas           | Nama berkas absolut dari berkas konfigurasi.\n"
"| Saluran Konfigurasi   | Nama saluran konfigurasi.\n"
"| Diubah                | Waktu dan tanggal berkas diubah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Click the name of a file to see its `Details` page.  Click the channel name "
"to see its `Channel Details` page."
msgstr "Klik nama berkas untuk melihat halaman `Details`.  Klik nama saluran untuk melihat halaman `Channel Details`."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recently Scheduled Configuration File Deployments"
msgstr "Penerapan Berkas Konfigurasi yang Baru Dijadwalkan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Each scheduled action is listed along with the status of the action.  Any "
"scheduled configuration task, from enabling configuration management on a "
"system to deploying a specific configuration file, is displayed.  Here you "
"can quickly assess if all tasks have been successfully carried out or fix "
"any problems."
msgstr "Setiap tindakan terjadwal dicantumkan beserta statusnya.  Semua tugas konfigurasi terjadwal ditampilkan, mulai dari mengaktifkan pengelolaan konfigurasi pada sistem hingga menerapkan berkas konfigurasi tertentu. Di sini Anda dapat dengan cepat menilai apakah semua tugas telah berhasil dilaksanakan atau memperbaiki masalah yang ada."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scheduled Configuration File Deployments Columns"
msgstr "Kolom Penerapan Berkas Konfigurasi Terjadwal"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column               | Description\n"
"| System\t       | Host name of the system where you want to deploy the "
"configuration file.\n"
"| Files to be Deployed | Number of files to be deployed.\n"
"| Scheduled By\t       | The user who scheduled the job.\n"
"| Scheduled For\t       | The time and date the file deployment will "
"happen.\n"
"| Status    \t       | Status of the deployment: `Queued`\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom                 | Deskripsi\n"
"| Sistem                | Nama host sistem tempat Anda ingin menerapkan berkas konfigurasi.\n"
"| Berkas yang Akan Diterapkan | Jumlah berkas yang akan diterapkan.\n"
"| Dijadwalkan Oleh      | Pengguna yang menjadwalkan tugas.\n"
"| Dijadwalkan Untuk     | Waktu dan tanggal penerapan berkas akan dilakukan.\n"
"| Status                | Status penerapan: `Queued`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-overview.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Clicking the blue status text displays the menu:System Details[Schedule] "
"page for the specified system."
msgstr "Mengeklik teks status berwarna biru akan menampilkan halaman menu:System Details[Schedule] untuk sistem yang ditentukan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-systems-managed.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed Systems"
msgstr "Sistem yang Dikelola"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-systems-managed.adoc:2
msgid ""
"By default the `Managed Systems` page is displayed.  The listed systems have "
"been fully prepared for configuration file deployment.  The page shows "
"systems with managed configuration files and channel subscriptions."
msgstr "Secara default, halaman `Managed Systems` ditampilkan.  Sistem yang tercantum telah sepenuhnya disiapkan untuk penerapan berkas konfigurasi.  Halaman ini menampilkan sistem dengan berkas konfigurasi yang dikelola dan langganan saluran."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-systems-managed.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click the name of a system to show the relevant menu:System "
"Details[Configuration > Overview] page."
msgstr "Klik nama sistem untuk menampilkan halaman menu:System Details[Configuration > Overview] yang terkait."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-systems-menu.adoc:1
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Systems Menu"
msgstr "Menu Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-systems-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Displays status information about your system in relation to configuration.  "
"There are two sub-pages: `Managed Systems` and `Target Systems`."
msgstr "Menampilkan informasi status sistem Anda terkait konfigurasi.  Terdapat dua subhalaman: `Managed Systems` dan `Target Systems`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-systems-target.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This page shows the systems that are not prepared for configuration file "
"deployment, or are not yet subscribed to a configuration channel."
msgstr "Halaman ini menampilkan sistem yang belum disiapkan untuk penerapan berkas konfigurasi, atau belum berlangganan saluran konfigurasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-systems-target.adoc:3
msgid "The table has three columns:"
msgstr "Tabel ini memiliki tiga kolom:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-systems-target.adoc:4
msgid "The system name"
msgstr "Nama sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-systems-target.adoc:5
msgid "If the system is prepared for configuration file deployment"
msgstr "Apakah sistem telah disiapkan untuk penerapan berkas konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-systems-target.adoc:6
msgid "The steps necessary to prepare the system."
msgstr "Langkah-langkah yang diperlukan untuk menyiapkan sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-systems-target.adoc:7
msgid ""
"To prepare a system, check the box to the left of the profile name then "
"click the btn:[Enable {productname} Configuration Management] button.  All "
"of the preparatory steps that can be automatically performed are scheduled "
"by {productname}."
msgstr "Untuk menyiapkan sistem, centang kotak di sebelah kiri nama profil, lalu klik tombol btn:[Enable {productname} Configuration Management].  Semua langkah persiapan yang dapat dilakukan secara otomatis akan dijadwalkan oleh {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/configuration/config-systems-target.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You will need to perform some manual tasks to enable configuration file "
"deployment.  Follow the on-screen instructions provided to assist with each "
"step."
msgstr "Anda perlu melakukan beberapa tugas manual untuk mengaktifkan penerapan berkas konfigurasi.  Ikuti petunjuk di layar yang disediakan untuk membantu setiap langkah."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/api-faq.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "API FAQ"
msgstr "FAQ API"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/api-faq.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Help[API > FAQ] section contains frequently asked questions related "
"to {productname} APIs."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Help[API > FAQ] berisi pertanyaan yang sering diajukan terkait API {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/api-faq.adoc:3
msgid ""
"See: "
"https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/{productnumber}/api/docs/api/faqs.html"
msgstr "Lihat: https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/{productnumber}/api/docs/api/faqs.html"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/api-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "API Menu"
msgstr "Menu API"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/api-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Help[API] section contains links to the available API calls, and "
"includes an API FAQ and sample scripts."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Help[API] berisi tautan ke panggilan API yang tersedia, serta mencakup FAQ API dan contoh skrip."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/api-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "API Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran Umum API"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/api-overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Help[API > Overview] section provides a list of available API "
"calls.  Click the name of an API call to see the relevant documentation."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Help[API > Overview] menyediakan daftar panggilan API yang tersedia.  Klik nama panggilan API untuk melihat dokumentasi terkait."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/api-overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For the full API documentation, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/{productnumber}/api/docs/index.html[API "
"Documentation]."
msgstr "Untuk dokumentasi API lengkap, lihat https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/{productnumber}/api/docs/index.html[Dokumentasi API]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/api-sample-scripts.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "API Sample Scripts"
msgstr "Contoh Skrip API"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/api-sample-scripts.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Help:[API > Sample Scripts] section contains example API calls for "
"you to copy.  The scripts are written in Ruby, Perl, and Python."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Help:[API > Sample Scripts] berisi contoh panggilan API yang dapat Anda salin.  Skrip ditulis dalam Ruby, Perl, dan Python."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/api-sample-scripts.adoc:3
msgid ""
"See: "
"https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/{productnumber}/api/docs/api/scripts.html"
msgstr "Lihat: https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/{productnumber}/api/docs/api/scripts.html"

#. type: Plain text
