#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/documentation-version.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "Dokumentasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/documentation-version.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Help[Documentation {productnumber}] section opens the current "
"version of the {productname} documentation in a new browser tab.  This is "
"the documentation installed locally on your {productname} Server."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Help[Documentation {productnumber}] membuka versi terkini dokumentasi {productname} di tab peramban baru.  Dokumentasi ini diinstal secara lokal pada Server {productname} Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/documentation-version.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For all versions and formats of the {susemgr} documentation, including API "
"documentation, see https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/."
msgstr "Untuk semua versi dan format dokumentasi {susemgr}, termasuk dokumentasi API, lihat https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/documentation-version.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For all versions and formats of the {uyuni} documentation, see "
"https://www.uyuni-project.org/uyuni-docs/index.html."
msgstr "Untuk semua versi dan format dokumentasi {uyuni}, lihat https://www.uyuni-project.org/uyuni-docs/index.html."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/help-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Help Menu"
msgstr "Menu Bantuan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/help-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The `Help` section opens the current version of the {productname} "
"documentation in a new browser tab.  This is the documentation installed "
"locally on your {productname} Server."
msgstr "Bagian `Help` membuka versi terkini dokumentasi {productname} di tab peramban baru.  Dokumentasi ini diinstal secara lokal pada Server {productname} Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/help-menu.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For all versions and formats of the {productname} documentation, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/"
msgstr "Untuk semua versi dan format dokumentasi {productname}, lihat https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/help-menu.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For all versions and formats of the {productname} documentation, see "
"https://www.uyuni-project.org/uyuni-docs/"
msgstr "Untuk semua versi dan format dokumentasi {productname}, lihat https://www.uyuni-project.org/uyuni-docs/"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/release-notes.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Release Notes"
msgstr "Catatan Rilis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/release-notes.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Help[Release Notes] section opens the current version of the "
"{productname} Release Notes in a new browser tab."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Help[Release Notes] membuka versi terkini Catatan Rilis {productname} di tab peramban baru."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Home Menu"
msgstr "Menu Beranda"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The `Home` section is a dashboard that contains a summary of your current "
"{productname} status, including tasks, client information, and critical "
"security updates."
msgstr "Bagian `Home` merupakan dasbor yang berisi ringkasan status {productname} Anda saat ini, termasuk tugas, informasi klien, dan pembaruan keamanan penting."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-my-preferences.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "My Preferences"
msgstr "Preferensi Saya"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-my-preferences.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[My Preferences] section allows you to configure {productname} "
"{webui} options."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Home[My Preferences] memungkinkan Anda mengonfigurasi opsi {webui} {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-my-preferences.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Home Preferences"
msgstr "Preferensi Beranda"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-my-preferences.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option                | Description   | Default\n"
"| Email Notification    | Receive email for client and Taskomatic "
"notifications, including a daily summary email. | Checked\n"
"| Beta Features         | Beta features are experimental and may not be "
"fully tested. Enable this option to access new functionality that is still "
"under development. Use with caution in production environments. | "
"Unchecked\n"
"| {productname} List Page Size | Maximum number of items that can appear in "
"a list on a single page. | 25 entries\n"
"| \"Overview\" Start Page | Select the information panes to display on the "
"menu:Home[Overview] page. | All checked\n"
"| Time Zone             | Set your local timezone. | System timezone\n"
"| Interface Language    | Set the language to use in the {webui}. | Default "
"language\n"
"| Style Theme           | Set the style theme to use in the {webui}. | "
"`susemanager-light`\n"
"| CSV Files             | Select whether to use comma or semi-colon "
"delimiters when producing downloadable CSV files. | Comma\n"
msgstr ""
"| Opsi                  | Deskripsi   | Default\n"
"| Notifikasi Email    | Menerima email notifikasi klien dan Taskomatic, termasuk email ringkasan harian. | Dicentang\n"
"| Fitur Beta            | Fitur beta bersifat eksperimental dan mungkin belum diuji sepenuhnya. Aktifkan opsi ini untuk mengakses fungsi baru yang masih dalam pengembangan. Gunakan dengan hati-hati di lingkungan produksi. | Tidak dicentang\n"
"| Ukuran Halaman Daftar {productname} | Jumlah maksimum item yang dapat ditampilkan dalam daftar pada satu halaman. | 25 entri\n"
"| Halaman Awal \"Gambaran Umum\" | Memilih panel informasi yang akan ditampilkan pada halaman menu:Home[Overview]. | Semua dicentang\n"
"| Zona Waktu           | Mengatur zona waktu lokal Anda. | Zona waktu sistem\n"
"| Bahasa Antarmuka      | Mengatur bahasa yang digunakan di {webui}. | Bahasa default\n"
"| Tema Tampilan         | Mengatur tema tampilan yang digunakan di {webui}. | `susemanager-light`\n"
"| Berkas CSV            | Memilih penggunaan pemisah koma atau titik koma saat menghasilkan berkas CSV yang dapat diunduh. | Koma\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-my-preferences.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For information about changing the default preferences, see "
"xref:administration:users.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang mengubah preferensi default, lihat xref:administration:users.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-notification-messages.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notification Messages"
msgstr "Pesan Notifikasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-notification-messages.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[Notification Messages] section shows all current messages "
"produced by {productname}.  By default, messages will remain current for "
"thirty days.  After this period, messages are deleted whether or not they "
"are marked as read."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Home[Notification Messages] menampilkan semua pesan terkini yang dihasilkan oleh {productname}.  Secara default, pesan akan disimpan selama tiga puluh hari.  Setelah periode ini, pesan dihapus, baik sudah ditandai sebagai dibaca maupun belum."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-notification-messages.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To see unread messages, navigate to the `Unread Messages` tab.  To see all "
"messages, navigate to the `All Messages` tab."
msgstr "Untuk melihat pesan yang belum dibaca, buka tab `Unread Messages`.  Untuk melihat semua pesan, buka tab `All Messages`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-notification-messages.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-image-list.adoc:4
msgid "Click btn:[Refresh] to update the list."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Refresh] untuk memperbarui daftar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-notification-messages.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Perform bulk actions by checking messages in the list.  Click btn:[Delete "
"selected messages] to bulk delete messages.  Click btn:[Mark selected as "
"read] to bulk read messages."
msgstr "Lakukan tindakan massal dengan mencentang pesan dalam daftar.  Klik btn:[Delete selected messages] untuk menghapus pesan secara massal.  Klik btn:[Mark selected as read] untuk menandai pesan sebagai dibaca secara massal."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-notification-messages.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notification Message Severity Statuses"
msgstr "Status Tingkat Keparahan Pesan Notifikasi"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-notification-messages.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Icon               | Description   | Example\n"
"| icon:info-circle[role=\"none\"] | Information | Client onboarding has "
"failed.\n"
"| icon:exclamation-triangle[role=\"orange\"] | Warning | Channel "
"synchronization has completed.\n"
"| icon:times-circle[role=\"red\"] | Error | Channel synchronization has "
"failed.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Ikon               | Deskripsi   | Contoh\n"
"| icon:info-circle[role=\"none\"] | Informasi | Proses onboarding klien gagal.\n"
"| icon:exclamation-triangle[role=\"orange\"] | Peringatan | Sinkronisasi saluran telah selesai.\n"
"| icon:times-circle[role=\"red\"] | Kesalahan | Sinkronisasi saluran gagal.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Home Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran Umum Beranda"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[Overview] section is a dashboard that contains a summary of "
"your current {productname} status, including tasks, client information, and "
"critical security updates."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Home[Overview] merupakan dasbor yang berisi ringkasan status {productname} Anda saat ini, termasuk tugas, informasi klien, dan pembaruan keamanan penting."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organization Configuration Channels"
msgstr "Saluran Konfigurasi Organisasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[My Organization > Configuration Channels] section shows the "
"configuration channels available within your organization.  Configuration "
"channels can be created in the {productname} {webui} by navigating to "
"menu:Configuration[Channels].  Apply configuration channels to your "
"organization using the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Home[My Organization > Configuration Channels] menampilkan saluran konfigurasi yang tersedia dalam organisasi Anda.  Saluran konfigurasi dapat dibuat di {webui} {productname} dengan membuka menu:Configuration[Channels].  Terapkan saluran konfigurasi ke organisasi Anda menggunakan {webui} {productname}."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organization Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi Organisasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[My Organization > Configuration] section allows you to "
"configure your current organization."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Home[My Organization > Configuration] memungkinkan Anda mengonfigurasi organisasi Anda saat ini."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organization Configuration Options"
msgstr "Opsi Konfigurasi Organisasi"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option                            | Description   | Default\n"
"| Enable staging contents | For clients in this organization, allow content "
"staging by default. | Unchecked\n"
"| Enable Errata E-mail Notifications | For users in this organization, send "
"email notifications when errata (patches) are available. | Checked\n"
"| Enable Upload of Detailed SCAP Files | Allow detailed SCAP content files "
"to be uploaded for auditing. | Unchecked\n"
"| Allow Deletion of SCAP Results | Allow SCAP results to be deleted after "
"the audit is complete. | Checked\n"
"| Allow Deletion After | The number of days after an SCAP audit is complete, "
"that results can be deleted. | 90 days\n"
"| Synchronize patches on Content Lifecycle Management build | Controls "
"whether the patch attributes and affected packages should be synchronized to "
"cloned patches when building a content Project | Checked\n"
msgstr ""
"| Opsi                            | Deskripsi   | Default\n"
"| Aktifkan staging konten | Mengizinkan staging konten secara default untuk klien dalam organisasi ini. | Tidak dicentang\n"
"| Aktifkan Notifikasi Email Errata | Mengirim notifikasi email kepada pengguna dalam organisasi ini saat errata (patch) tersedia. | Dicentang\n"
"| Aktifkan Pengunggahan Berkas SCAP Terperinci | Mengizinkan pengunggahan berkas konten SCAP terperinci untuk audit. | Tidak dicentang\n"
"| Izinkan Penghapusan Hasil SCAP  | Mengizinkan penghapusan hasil SCAP setelah audit selesai. | Dicentang\n"
"| Izinkan Penghapusan Setelah | Jumlah hari setelah audit SCAP selesai hingga hasilnya dapat dihapus. | 90 hari\n"
"| Sinkronkan patch saat proses build Pengelolaan Siklus Hidup Konten | Mengontrol apakah atribut patch dan paket yang terdampak harus disinkronkan ke patch hasil kloning saat membangun Proyek konten | Dicentang\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information about content staging, see "
"xref:administration:content-staging.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang staging konten, lihat xref:administration:content-staging.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about deleting SCAP scan results, see "
"xref:administration:openscap.adoc#removing-scap-scan-results[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penghapusan hasil pemindaian SCAP, lihat xref:administration:openscap.adoc#removing-scap-scan-results[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For more information about Content Lifecycle Management, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang Pengelolaan Siklus Hidup Konten, lihat xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "My Organization"
msgstr "Organisasi Saya"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[My Organization] section allows you to configure your current "
"organization."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Home[My Organization] memungkinkan Anda mengonfigurasi organisasi Anda saat ini."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-trusts.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organization Trusts"
msgstr "Hubungan Kepercayaan Organisasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-trusts.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[My Organization > Organization Trusts] section shows the "
"trusts that you have established within your organization.  This section "
"also shows the channels that are available to other users through trusts."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Home[My Organization > Organization Trusts] menampilkan hubungan kepercayaan yang telah Anda tetapkan dalam organisasi Anda.  Bagian ini juga menampilkan saluran yang tersedia bagi pengguna lain melalui hubungan kepercayaan tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-trusts.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about organization trusts, see "
"xref:administration:organizations.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang hubungan kepercayaan organisasi, lihat xref:administration:organizations.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-account-deactivation.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Account Deactivation"
msgstr "Penonaktifan Akun"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-account-deactivation.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[User Account > Account Deactivation] section allows you to "
"cancel your {productname} user account."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Home[User Account > Account Deactivation] memungkinkan Anda membatalkan akun pengguna {productname} Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-account-deactivation.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When you click btn:[Deactivate Account] your user account will be deleted, "
"you will be signed out, and you will not be able to sign back in."
msgstr "Saat Anda mengeklik btn:[Deactivate Account], akun pengguna Anda akan dihapus, Anda akan keluar, dan Anda tidak akan dapat masuk kembali."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-account-deactivation.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you do this by accident, you will need to contact your {productname} "
"Administrator to reactivate your user account."
msgstr "Jika Anda melakukannya secara tidak sengaja, Anda perlu menghubungi Administrator {productname} untuk mengaktifkan kembali akun pengguna Anda."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-account-deactivation.adoc:5
msgid ""
"If you are the only {productname} Administrator for your organization, you "
"can not deactivate your account."
msgstr "Jika Anda adalah satu-satunya Administrator {productname} di organisasi Anda, Anda tidak dapat menonaktifkan akun Anda."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-addresses.adoc:1
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Addresses"
msgstr "Alamat"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-addresses.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[User Account > Addresses] section allows you set your mailing, "
"billing, and shipping addresses, and associated phone numbers."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Home[User Account > Addresses] memungkinkan Anda mengatur alamat surat-menyurat, penagihan, dan pengiriman, serta nomor telepon terkait."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-addresses.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Fill in this address] or btn:[Edit this address] below the "
"address to be modified or added, make your changes, and click btn:[Update]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Fill in this address] atau btn:[Edit this address] di bawah alamat yang akan diubah atau ditambahkan, lakukan perubahan, lalu klik btn:[Update]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-change-email.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change Email"
msgstr "Ubah Email"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-change-email.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[User Account > Change Email] section allows you to set the "
"email {productname} sends notifications to."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Home[User Account > Change Email] memungkinkan Anda menetapkan alamat email tujuan pengiriman notifikasi dari {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-change-email.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Enter your new email address and click the btn:[Update] button.  Invalid "
"email addresses, including those ending in `@localhost` are filtered and "
"rejected."
msgstr "Masukkan alamat email baru Anda, lalu klik tombol btn:[Update].  Alamat email yang tidak valid, termasuk yang berakhiran `@localhost`, akan disaring dan ditolak."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-change-email.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you would like to receive email notifications about patch alerts or daily "
"summaries for your systems, ensure you have checked the `Receive email "
"notifications` option in menu:Home[My Preferences] section."
msgstr "Jika Anda ingin menerima notifikasi email tentang peringatan patch atau ringkasan harian untuk sistem Anda, pastikan Anda telah mencentang opsi `Receive email notifications` di bagian menu:Home[My Preferences]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Account Menu"
msgstr "Menu Akun Pengguna"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[User Account] section allows you to change user account "
"preferences."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Home[User Account] memungkinkan Anda mengubah preferensi akun pengguna."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-my-account.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "My Account"
msgstr "Akun Saya"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-my-account.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[User Account > My Account] section allows you to change user "
"account preferences."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Home[User Account > My Account] memungkinkan Anda mengubah preferensi akun pengguna."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-my-account.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Modify your personal information, such as name, password, and title from the "
"menu:Home[User Account > My Account] page.  To modify this information, make "
"the changes in the appropriate text fields and click the btn:[Update] button "
"at the bottom."
msgstr "Ubah informasi pribadi Anda, seperti nama, kata sandi, dan jabatan, melalui halaman menu:Home[User Account > My Account].  Untuk mengubah informasi ini, lakukan perubahan pada kolom teks yang sesuai, lalu klik tombol btn:[Update] di bagian bawah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-my-account.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you forget your password or username, navigate to {webui} sign in page, "
"click btn:[About], and click btn:[Lookup Login/Password].  Enter the "
"username or email address, and click btn:[Send Password] or btn:[Send Login] "
"to have the missing information sent to you."
msgstr "Jika Anda lupa kata sandi atau nama pengguna, buka halaman masuk {webui}, klik btn:[About], lalu klik btn:[Lookup Login/Password].  Masukkan nama pengguna atau alamat email, lalu klik btn:[Send Password] atau btn:[Send Login] agar informasi yang terlupa dikirimkan kepada Anda."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-build.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images Build"
msgstr "Pembuatan Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-build.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Images[Build] section allows you to build operating system images "
"for installing on clients."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Images[Build] memungkinkan Anda membuat image sistem operasi untuk diinstal pada klien."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-build.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image Build Options"
msgstr "Opsi Pembuatan Image"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-build.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option        | Description   | Default\n"
"| Image Profile | Select the image profile to use.\n"
"Manage image profiles at menu:Images[Profiles]. | Blank.\n"
"| Build Host    | Select the build host for the new image. | Blank.\n"
"| Earliest      | Schedule the time and date for the build to begin. | "
"Current system time and date.\n"
"| Add to        | Select which action chain to add the build task to. | New "
"action chain.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Opsi          | Deskripsi     | Nilai Bawaan\n"
"| Profil Image  | Pilih profil image yang akan digunakan.\n"
"Kelola profil image di menu:Images[Profiles]. | Kosong.\n"
"| Host Build    | Pilih host build untuk image baru. | Kosong.\n"
"| Paling Awal   | Jadwalkan waktu dan tanggal dimulainya proses build. | Waktu dan tanggal sistem saat ini.\n"
"| Tambahkan ke  | Pilih rantai tindakan tempat tugas build akan ditambahkan. | Rantai tindakan baru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-build.adoc:5
msgid "Built images are listed in menu:Images[Image List]."
msgstr "Image yang telah dibuat tercantum di menu:Images[Image List]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-build.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-image-list.adoc:8
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-menu.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-profiles.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-stores.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information about images, see "
"xref:administration:image-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang image, lihat xref:administration:image-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-image-list.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image List"
msgstr "Daftar Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-image-list.adoc:2
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Images[Image List] section displays your current operating system "
"images."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Images[Image List] menampilkan image sistem operasi Anda saat ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-image-list.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Import] to import a new Docker image.  You can only import new "
"images created from a Docker image using this mechanism.  To import images "
"based on Kiwi instead, see xref:administration:image-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Import] untuk mengimpor image Docker baru.  Melalui mekanisme ini, Anda hanya dapat mengimpor image baru yang dibuat dari image Docker.  Untuk mengimpor image berbasis Kiwi, lihat xref:administration:image-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-image-list.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Perform bulk actions by checking images in the list.  Click btn:[Delete] to "
"bulk delete images."
msgstr "Lakukan tindakan massal dengan mencentang image dalam daftar.  Klik btn:[Delete] untuk menghapus image secara massal."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-image-list.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image List Columns"
msgstr "Kolom Daftar Image"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-image-list.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column               | Description\n"
"| Name                 | Name of the image.\n"
"| Version and Revision | Version and revision of the image.\n"
"| Updates              | Any updates that are currently available for the "
"image.\n"
"| Patches and Packages | Any patches or packages that are currently "
"available for the image.\n"
"| Build                | The current status of the build: `Built`, "
"`Scheduled`, `Building` or `Failed`.\n"
"| Last Modified        | The time and date the image was last modified.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom                | Deskripsi\n"
"| Nama                 | Nama image.\n"
"| Versi dan Revisi     | Versi dan revisi image.\n"
"| Pembaruan  | Pembaruan yang saat ini tersedia untuk image.\n"
"| Patch dan Paket     | Patch atau paket yang saat ini tersedia untuk image.\n"
"| Build        | Status proses build saat ini: `Built`, `Scheduled`, `Building` atau `Failed`.\n"
"| Terakhir Diubah      | Waktu dan tanggal terakhir image diubah.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images Menu"
msgstr "Menu Image"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-profiles.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images Profiles"
msgstr "Profil Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-profiles.adoc:2
msgid "The menu:Images[Profiles] section displays your current image profiles."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Images[Profiles] menampilkan profil image Anda saat ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-profiles.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create] to create a new image profile.  Click btn:[Refresh] to "
"update the list."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create] untuk membuat profil image baru.  Klik btn:[Refresh] untuk memperbarui daftar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-profiles.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Perform bulk actions by checking profiles in the list.  Click btn:[Delete] "
"to bulk delete profiles."
msgstr "Lakukan tindakan massal dengan mencentang profil dalam daftar.  Klik btn:[Delete] untuk menghapus profil secara massal."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-stores.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images Stores"
msgstr "Penyimpanan Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-stores.adoc:2
msgid "The menu:Images[Stores] section displays your current image stores."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Images[Stores] menampilkan penyimpanan image Anda saat ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-stores.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create] to create a new image store.  Click btn:[Refresh] to "
"update the list."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create] untuk membuat penyimpanan image baru.  Klik btn:[Refresh] untuk memperbarui daftar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-stores.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Perform bulk actions by checking images in the list.  Click btn:[Delete] to "
"bulk delete image stores."
msgstr "Lakukan tindakan massal dengan mencentang image dalam daftar.  Klik btn:[Delete] untuk menghapus penyimpanan image secara massal."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/clone-patches.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone Patches"
msgstr "Kloning Patch"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/clone-patches.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Patches[Clone Patches] section allows you to create copies of "
"existing patches to distribute to your clients."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Patches[Clone Patches] memungkinkan Anda membuat salinan patch yang sudah ada untuk didistribusikan ke klien Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/clone-patches.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To clone a patch, the patch must apply to one of your existing software "
"channels.  If the patch was part of a software channel that was cloned, then "
"you can clone the patch from the cloned channel."
msgstr "Untuk mengkloning patch, patch tersebut harus berlaku untuk salah satu saluran perangkat lunak Anda yang sudah ada.  Jika patch tersebut merupakan bagian dari saluran perangkat lunak yang telah dikloning, Anda dapat mengkloning patch dari saluran hasil kloning tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/clone-patches.adoc:4
msgid ""
"See all patches that are available for cloning by selecting the channel name "
"in the `View patches potentially applicable to:` field, and click "
"btn:[View].  From the list, check the patch to clone, and click btn:[Clone "
"Patch].  You need to confirm the details to perform the clone."
msgstr "Lihat semua patch yang tersedia untuk dikloning dengan memilih nama saluran pada kolom `View patches potentially applicable to:`, lalu klik btn:[View].  Dalam daftar, centang patch yang akan dikloning, lalu klik btn:[Clone Patch].  Anda perlu mengonfirmasi detailnya untuk melakukan kloning."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/manage-patches.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Patches"
msgstr "Kelola Patch"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/manage-patches.adoc:2
msgid "The menu:Patches[Manage Patches] section shows you all custom patches."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Patches[Manage Patches] menampilkan semua patch kustom."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/manage-patches.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Each patch in the list shows a patch type, an advisory name, a short "
"description, and the date the patch was last updated.  Click the advisory "
"name to go to menu:Patches[Patch List > Patch Details] for the patch."
msgstr "Setiap patch dalam daftar menampilkan jenis patch, nama advisori, deskripsi singkat, dan tanggal terakhir patch diperbarui.  Klik nama advisori untuk membuka menu:Patches[Patch List > Patch Details] bagi patch tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/manage-patches.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To create a new patch, click btn:[Create Patch].  To delete a patch, select "
"it in the list, and click btn:[Delete Patches]."
msgstr "Untuk membuat patch baru, klik btn:[Create Patch].  Untuk menghapus patch, pilih patch dalam daftar, lalu klik btn:[Delete Patches]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/manage-patches.adoc:5
msgid ""
"If you use {productname} with a proxy, manage patches only on the "
"{productname} Server.  The {productname} Proxy will receive updates from the "
"server directly.  If you manage patches on a proxy, the servers will be "
"unable to synchronize correctly."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan {productname} dengan proxy, kelola patch hanya pada Server {productname}.  Proxy {productname} akan menerima pembaruan langsung dari server.  Jika Anda mengelola patch pada proxy, server tidak akan dapat melakukan sinkronisasi dengan benar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/manage-patches.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-all.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-advanced-search.adoc:7
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-menu.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-patches.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about patching, see "
"xref:client-configuration:patch-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penerapan patch, lihat xref:client-configuration:patch-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patch Details"
msgstr "Detail Patch"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Patches[Patch List > Patch Details] section displays the details of "
"a selected patch.  Click the advisory number of a patch in the `Patch List` "
"to see more information about the patch."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Patches[Patch List > Patch Details] menampilkan detail patch yang dipilih.  Klik nomor advisori patch dalam `Patch List` untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang patch tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:3
msgid "This section is divided into tabs."
msgstr "Bagian ini dibagi menjadi beberapa tab."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Details"
msgstr "Detail"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:5
msgid "The `Details` tab shows the patch report provided by {suse}."
msgstr "Tab `Details` menampilkan laporan patch yang disediakan oleh {suse}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the `Affected Channels` section, all channels that contain the affected "
"package are listed.  Click the channel name to go to menu:Software[Channel "
"Details]."
msgstr "Bagian `Affected Channels` mencantumkan semua saluran yang berisi paket terdampak.  Klik nama saluran untuk membuka menu:Software[Channel Details]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For security patches, additional information is shown about the "
"vulnerability, including the CVE and OVAL details."
msgstr "Untuk patch keamanan, informasi tambahan tentang kerentanan ditampilkan, termasuk detail CVE dan OVAL."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:8
msgid ""
"If available, the original advisory provided by the vendor of the patch is "
"shown in the section `Vendor Advisory`."
msgstr "Jika tersedia, advisori asli yang disediakan oleh vendor patch ditampilkan pada bagian `Vendor Advisory`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For more information about {suse} Update Advisories, see "
"link:https://www.suse.com/support/update/[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang Advisori Pembaruan {suse}, lihat link:https://www.suse.com/support/update/[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:10
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:13
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:12
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-packages.adoc:1
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Packages"
msgstr "Paket"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The `Packages` tab provides links to each of the updated packages by "
"channel.  Click the name of a package to go to menu:Software[Channel "
"Details]."
msgstr "Tab `Packages` menyediakan tautan ke setiap paket yang diperbarui berdasarkan saluran.  Klik nama paket untuk membuka menu:Software[Channel Details]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Affected Systems"
msgstr "Sistem Terdampak"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The `Affected Systems` tab provides a list of installed clients that the "
"patch affects.  You can install updates from this tab."
msgstr "Tab `Affected Systems` menyediakan daftar klien terinstal yang terdampak oleh patch.  Anda dapat menginstal pembaruan dari tab ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:14
msgid "Click the name of a client to go to menu:Systems[System Details]."
msgstr "Klik nama klien untuk membuka menu:Systems[System Details]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Each client in the list shows the current status of the patch on that "
"client.  This column identifies only the most recent action.  Click the name "
"of a status in the list to go to the `Action Details` page."
msgstr "Setiap klien dalam daftar menampilkan status terkini patch pada klien tersebut.  Kolom ini hanya menunjukkan tindakan terbaru.  Klik nama status dalam daftar untuk membuka halaman `Action Details`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Update Status Icons"
msgstr "Ikon Status Pembaruan Klien"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description | Action Required\n"
"| N/A | Check the status manually.\n"
"| Pending | The client will be updated at the next synchronization.\n"
"| Picked Up | The client is in the progress of updating.\n"
"| Completed | The client successfully installed the patch.\n"
"| Failed | The client attempted to install the patch, but encountered an "
"error.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Deskripsi | Tindakan yang Diperlukan\n"
"| N/A | Periksa status secara manual.\n"
"| Tertunda | Klien akan diperbarui pada sinkronisasi berikutnya.\n"
"| Diambil | Klien sedang dalam proses pembaruan.\n"
"| Selesai | Klien berhasil menginstal patch.\n"
"| Gagal | Klien mencoba menginstal patch, tetapi mengalami kesalahan.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-all.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "All Patches"
msgstr "Semua Patch"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-all.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Patches[Patch List > All] section displays a list of all patches "
"released by {suse}.  Not all of the patches will apply to your clients."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Patches[Patch List > All] menampilkan daftar semua patch yang dirilis oleh {suse}.  Tidak semua patch berlaku untuk klien Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-all.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Each patch in the list shows a patch type, an advisory number, a short "
"description, the number of clients in your network affected, and the date "
"the patch was last updated.  Click the advisory number to see more "
"information about the patch."
msgstr "Setiap patch dalam daftar menampilkan jenis patch, nomor advisori, deskripsi singkat, jumlah klien terdampak dalam jaringan Anda, dan tanggal terakhir patch diperbarui.  Klik nomor advisori untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang patch tersebut."

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-all.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-relevant.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Icon | Description | Action Required\n"
"| icon:bug[role=\"none\"] | Bug fix | Recommended\n"
"| image:spacewalk-icon-enhancement.svg[] | Product enhancement advisory | "
"Optional\n"
"| icon:shield-alt[role=\"yellow\"] | Security update | Essential\n"
"| icon:archive[role=\"none\"]| Affects package management stack | "
"Recommended\n"
msgstr ""
"| Ikon | Deskripsi | Tindakan yang Diperlukan\n"
"| icon:bug[role=\"none\"] | Perbaikan bug | Disarankan\n"
"| image:spacewalk-icon-enhancement.svg[] | Advisori peningkatan produk | Opsional\n"
"| icon:shield-alt[role=\"yellow\"] | Pembaruan keamanan | Wajib\n"
"| icon:archive[role=\"none\"]| Memengaruhi stack manajemen paket | Disarankan\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-relevant.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relevant Patches"
msgstr "Patch yang Relevan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-relevant.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Patches[Patch List > Relevant] section displays a list of all "
"patches released by {suse} that apply to your installed clients."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Patches[Patch List > Relevant] menampilkan daftar semua patch yang dirilis oleh {suse} dan berlaku untuk klien Anda yang terinstal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-relevant.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Each patch in the list shows a patch type, an advisory number, a short "
"description, the number of clients in your network affected, and the date "
"the patch was last updated.  Click the advisory number to see more "
"information about the patch.  For more information about the "
"menu:Patches[Patch List > Patch Details] section, see "
"xref:reference:patches/patch-details.adoc[]"
msgstr "Setiap patch dalam daftar menampilkan jenis patch, nomor advisori, deskripsi singkat, jumlah klien terdampak dalam jaringan Anda, dan tanggal terakhir patch diperbarui.  Klik nomor advisori untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang patch tersebut.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang bagian menu:Patches[Patch List > Patch Details], lihat xref:reference:patches/patch-details.adoc[]"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-relevant.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To receive email when new patches are available, navigate to menu:Home[My "
"Preferences] and check `Receive email notifications`."
msgstr "Untuk menerima email saat patch baru tersedia, buka menu:Home[My Preferences] dan centang `Receive email notifications`."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-advanced-search.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced Search for Patches"
msgstr "Pencarian Lanjutan untuk Patch"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-advanced-search.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Patches[Advanced Search] section allows you to use advanced "
"criteria to search for patches."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Patches[Advanced Search] memungkinkan Anda menggunakan kriteria lanjutan untuk mencari patch."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-advanced-search.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You can search for patches by looking for your search term in different "
"fields:"
msgstr "Anda dapat mencari patch dengan menelusuri istilah pencarian Anda pada berbagai kolom:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-advanced-search.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patch Advanced Search Options"
msgstr "Opsi Pencarian Lanjutan Patch"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-advanced-search.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option         | Description | Example\n"
"| All Fields     | Search in all fields | `glibc`\n"
"| Patch Advisory | Search within the name or label fields | "
"`slessp1-glibc`\n"
"| Package Name   | Search within the package name field only | `kernel`\n"
"| CVE            | Search within the CVE name or number field only | "
"`CVE-2006-4535`\n"
msgstr ""
"| Opsi           | Deskripsi | Contoh\n"
"| Semua Kolom    | Cari di semua kolom | `glibc`\n"
"| Advisori Patch | Cari dalam kolom nama atau label | `slessp1-glibc`\n"
"| Nama Paket     | Cari hanya dalam kolom nama paket | `kernel`\n"
"| CVE            | Cari hanya dalam kolom nama atau nomor CVE | `CVE-2006-4535`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-advanced-search.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You can also search within different types of patches, or within a range of "
"issue dates."
msgstr "Anda juga dapat mencari berdasarkan jenis patch atau rentang tanggal penerbitan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patches Menu"
msgstr "Menu Patch"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The `Patches` menu helps you find and manage available patches for your "
"clients."
msgstr "Menu `Patches` membantu Anda menemukan dan mengelola patch yang tersedia untuk klien Anda."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:1
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reference Guide"
msgstr "Panduan Referensi"

#.  PDF Publication
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:2
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:20
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:2
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Publication Date:** {docdate}\n"
msgstr "**Tanggal Publikasi:** {docdate}\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:14
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preface"
msgstr "Prakata"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:16
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:11
msgid "This document is divided into several sections:"
msgstr "Dokumen ini dibagi menjadi beberapa bagian:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:17
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**{webui} Reference:** Organized to mirror the structure of the "
"{productname} {webui}, this section allows you to quickly find relevant "
"information while navigating the interface.  \n"
msgstr "**Referensi {webui}:** Disusun mengikuti struktur {webui} {productname}, bagian ini memungkinkan Anda menemukan informasi yang relevan dengan cepat saat menavigasi antarmuka.  \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:18
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**spacecmd Reference:** A comprehensive guide to the `spacecmd` command-line "
"interface. It includes an **alphabetized list** of all available commands "
"along with their correct usage.  \n"
msgstr "**Referensi spacecmd:** Panduan lengkap untuk antarmuka baris perintah `spacecmd`. Bagian ini mencakup **daftar yang diurutkan berdasarkan abjad** dari semua perintah yang tersedia beserta cara penggunaannya yang benar.  \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:7
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:19
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:7
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Command Line Tools:** An overview of the various **command-line "
"utilities** available in {productname}, helping you streamline "
"administrative tasks. \n"
msgstr "**Alat Baris Perintah:** Gambaran umum berbagai **utilitas baris perintah** yang tersedia di {productname} untuk membantu Anda menyederhanakan tugas administratif. \n"

