#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:13
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:24
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:8
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:17
msgid "<<<"
msgstr "<<<"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:15
msgid "Reference | {productname} {productnumber}"
msgstr "Referensi | {productname} {productnumber}"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-formula-catalog.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Formula Catalog"
msgstr "Katalog Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-formula-catalog.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Salt[Formula Catalog] section allows you to see which formulas are "
"currently installed on your {productname} Server, and are available to be "
"used on your Salt clients.  Install and configure formulas by navigating to "
"menu:Systems[Details] for the client you want to configure, and navigate to "
"the guimenu`Formulas` tab."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Salt[Formula Catalog] memungkinkan Anda melihat formula yang saat ini terinstal pada Server {productname} Anda dan tersedia untuk digunakan pada klien Salt Anda.  Instal dan konfigurasikan formula dengan membuka menu:Systems[Details] untuk klien yang ingin Anda konfigurasikan, lalu buka tab guimenu`Formulas`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-formula-catalog.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about {productname} formulas, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang formula {productname}, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-keys.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keys"
msgstr "Kunci"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-keys.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Salt[Keys] section displays the key fingerprints of your current "
"Salt clients."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Salt[Keys] menampilkan sidik jari kunci klien Salt Anda saat ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-keys.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Key fingerprints are exchanged between the {productname} Server and Salt "
"clients to verify the identity of the server and the client.  This prevents "
"Salt clients from connecting to the wrong server."
msgstr "Sidik jari kunci dipertukarkan antara Server {productname} dan klien Salt untuk memverifikasi identitas server dan klien.  Hal ini mencegah klien Salt terhubung ke server yang salah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-keys.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Refresh] to update the list.  Click the name of a client to go to "
"menu:Systems[Details] for that client."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Refresh] untuk memperbarui daftar.  Klik nama klien untuk membuka menu:Systems[Details] bagi klien tersebut."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-keys.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Keys List Columns"
msgstr "Kolom Daftar Kunci Salt"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-keys.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column      | Description\n"
"| Name        | Name of the Salt client.\n"
"| Fingerprint | Key fingerprint of the Salt client.\n"
"| State       | The status of the key exchange: `accepted` indicates that "
"the client key has been verified by the {productname} Server.\n"
"| Actions     | Click the `Delete` icon to delete the client key from the "
"server.\n"
"Clients that have had their key deleted will need to be onboarded again.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom       | Deskripsi\n"
"| Nama        | Nama klien Salt.\n"
"| Sidik Jari  | Sidik jari kunci klien Salt.\n"
"| Status      | Status pertukaran kunci: `accepted` menunjukkan bahwa kunci klien telah diverifikasi oleh Server {productname}.\n"
"| Tindakan    | Klik ikon `Delete` untuk menghapus kunci klien dari server.\n"
"Klien yang kuncinya telah dihapus perlu didaftarkan kembali.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Menu"
msgstr "Menu Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The `Salt` section displays details of your Salt clients.  You can use this "
"menu to perform remote commands or define a state catalog for your Salt "
"clients."
msgstr "Bagian `Salt` menampilkan detail klien Salt Anda.  Anda dapat menggunakan menu ini untuk menjalankan perintah jarak jauh atau menentukan katalog state untuk klien Salt Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-menu.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about using Salt with {productname}, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggunaan Salt dengan {productname}, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-remote-commands.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote Commands"
msgstr "Perintah Jarak Jauh"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-remote-commands.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Salt[Remote Commands] section allows you to perform remote commands "
"on one or more of your Salt clients.  Remote commands allows you to issue "
"commands to individual Salt clients, or to all clients that match a search "
"term."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Salt[Remote Commands] memungkinkan Anda menjalankan perintah jarak jauh pada satu atau beberapa klien Salt Anda.  Perintah jarak jauh memungkinkan Anda mengirimkan perintah ke klien Salt tertentu atau ke semua klien yang cocok dengan istilah pencarian."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-remote-commands.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about remote commands, see "
"xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang perintah jarak jauh, lihat xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/action-chains.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Action Chains"
msgstr "Rantai Tindakan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/action-chains.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Schedule[Action Chains] If you need to perform a number of "
"sequential actions on your clients, you can create an action chain to "
"automate them."
msgstr "Di menu:Schedule[Action Chains], jika Anda perlu menjalankan sejumlah tindakan secara berurutan pada klien, Anda dapat membuat rantai tindakan untuk mengotomatiskannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/action-chains.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about action chains, see "
"xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang rantai tindakan, lihat xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/archived-actions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Archived Actions"
msgstr "Tindakan yang Diarsipkan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/archived-actions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Schedule[Archived Actions] section shows actions that you have "
"marked as archived.  Use the `Filter by Action` field to search the list.  "
"Completed or failed actions can be archived."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Schedule[Archived Actions] menampilkan tindakan yang telah Anda tandai sebagai diarsipkan.  Gunakan kolom `Filter by Action` untuk menelusuri daftar.  Tindakan yang selesai atau gagal dapat diarsipkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/archived-actions.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/completed-actions.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/failed-actions.adoc:8
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/pending-actions.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:13
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-events.adoc:3
msgid "For more information about actions, see xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang tindakan, lihat xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/completed-actions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Completed Actions"
msgstr "Tindakan yang Selesai"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/completed-actions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Schedule[Completed Actions] section shows actions that have been "
"successfully completed.  Use the `Filter by Action` field to search the "
"list.  Archive completed actions by checking the action in the list, and "
"clicking btn:[Archive Actions]."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Schedule[Completed Actions] menampilkan tindakan yang telah berhasil diselesaikan.  Gunakan kolom `Filter by Action` untuk menelusuri daftar.  Arsipkan tindakan yang selesai dengan mencentang tindakan dalam daftar, lalu mengeklik btn:[Archive Actions]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/completed-actions.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Completed Actions List Columns"
msgstr "Kolom Daftar Tindakan yang Selesai"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/completed-actions.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/failed-actions.adoc:7
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/pending-actions.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column         | Description\n"
"| Action         | Type of action to perform.\n"
"Click the action to go to `Action Details`.\n"
"| Scheduled Time | The earliest time to perform the action.\n"
"| Succeeded      | Number of clients on which this action was successful.\n"
"| Failed         | Number of clients on which this action has failed.\n"
"| Pending        | Number of clients on which this action is currently "
"running\n"
"| Total          | Total number of clients on which this action has been "
"scheduled.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom          | Deskripsi\n"
"| Tindakan       | Jenis tindakan yang akan dijalankan.\n"
"Klik tindakan untuk membuka `Action Details`.\n"
"| Waktu Terjadwal | Waktu paling awal untuk menjalankan tindakan.\n"
"| Berhasil       | Jumlah klien tempat tindakan ini berhasil dijalankan.\n"
"| Gagal          | Jumlah klien tempat tindakan ini gagal dijalankan.\n"
"| Tertunda       | Jumlah klien tempat tindakan ini sedang berjalan\n"
"| Total          | Jumlah total klien tempat tindakan ini telah dijadwalkan.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/failed-actions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Failed Actions"
msgstr "Tindakan yang Gagal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/failed-actions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Schedule[Failed Actions] section shows actions that have not been "
"completed, or that have returned an error.  Use the `Filter by Action` field "
"to search the list.  Archive failed actions by checking the action in the "
"list, and clicking btn:[Archive Actions]."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Schedule[Failed Actions] menampilkan tindakan yang belum selesai atau menghasilkan kesalahan.  Gunakan kolom `Filter by Action` untuk menelusuri daftar.  Arsipkan tindakan yang gagal dengan mencentang tindakan dalam daftar, lalu mengeklik btn:[Archive Actions]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/failed-actions.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Reschedule failed actions by checking the action in the list, and clicking "
"btn:[Reschedule].  Following the rescheduling, the action is:"
msgstr "Jadwalkan ulang tindakan yang gagal dengan mencentang tindakan dalam daftar, lalu mengeklik btn:[Reschedule].  Setelah penjadwalan ulang, tindakan tersebut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/failed-actions.adoc:4
msgid "removed from the `Event History`"
msgstr "dihapus dari `Event History`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/failed-actions.adoc:5
msgid "replaced by the rescheduled action."
msgstr "diganti dengan tindakan yang dijadwalkan ulang."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/failed-actions.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/pending-actions.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Actions List Columns"
msgstr "Kolom Daftar Tindakan"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/maintenance-windows.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maintenance Windows"
msgstr "Jendela Pemeliharaan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/maintenance-windows.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows] section allows you to manage your "
"maintenance window schedules.  To create a maintenance schedule, you need to "
"have an existing `.ical` file that contains the calendar.  Upload the "
"calendar, create a new schedule, and assign the schedule to a client.  When "
"a schedule is applied to a client, you are prevented from executing some "
"actions outside of the specified period."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows] memungkinkan Anda mengelola jadwal jendela pemeliharaan.  Untuk membuat jadwal pemeliharaan, Anda harus memiliki berkas `.ical` yang berisi kalender.  Unggah kalender, buat jadwal baru, lalu tetapkan jadwal tersebut ke klien.  Saat jadwal diterapkan ke klien, Anda tidak dapat menjalankan beberapa tindakan di luar periode yang ditentukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/maintenance-windows.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows > Schedules] to see a list of "
"all current schedules.  Click btn:[Create] to create a new schedule.  Click "
"btn:[Edit] to change the schedule."
msgstr "Buka menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows > Schedules] untuk melihat daftar semua jadwal yang ada saat ini.  Klik btn:[Create] untuk membuat jadwal baru.  Klik btn:[Edit] untuk mengubah jadwal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/maintenance-windows.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows > Calendars] to see a list of "
"all current calendars.  Click btn:[Create] to create a new calendar.  Click "
"btn:[Edit] to change the calendar."
msgstr "Buka menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows > Calendars] untuk melihat daftar semua kalender yang ada saat ini.  Klik btn:[Create] untuk membuat kalender baru.  Klik btn:[Edit] untuk mengubah kalender."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/maintenance-windows.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information about maintenance windows, see "
"xref:administration:maintenance-windows.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang jendela pemeliharaan, lihat xref:administration:maintenance-windows.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/pending-actions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pending Actions"
msgstr "Tindakan yang Tertunda"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/pending-actions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Schedule[Pending Actions] section shows actions that are in "
"progress, or that have not yet started.  Use the `Filter by Action` field to "
"search the list."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Schedule[Pending Actions] menampilkan tindakan yang sedang berlangsung atau belum dimulai.  Gunakan kolom `Filter by Action` untuk menelusuri daftar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/pending-actions.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Cancel pending actions by checking the action in the list, and clicking "
"btn:[Cancel Actions].  If you archive a pending action, it is not canceled, "
"but the action item moves from the `Pending Actions` list to the `Archived "
"Actions` list."
msgstr "Batalkan tindakan yang tertunda dengan mencentang tindakan dalam daftar, lalu mengeklik btn:[Cancel Actions].  Jika Anda mengarsipkan tindakan yang tertunda, tindakan tersebut tidak dibatalkan, tetapi item tindakan dipindahkan dari daftar `Pending Actions` ke daftar `Archived Actions`."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/recurring-actions.adoc:1
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recurring Actions"
msgstr "Tindakan Berulang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/recurring-actions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Schedule[Recurring Actions] section shows all recurring actions "
"that you have permissions for."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Schedule[Recurring Actions] menampilkan semua tindakan berulang yang dapat Anda akses sesuai izin Anda."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/recurring-actions.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The recurring actions list on this page is a read-only table.  To modify a "
"schedule, you can follow the links in the `Target Name` column and list the "
"schedules of an individual target."
msgstr "Daftar tindakan berulang pada halaman ini berupa tabel hanya-baca.  Untuk mengubah jadwal, Anda dapat mengikuti tautan pada kolom `Target Name` dan menampilkan daftar jadwal untuk target tertentu."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/recurring-actions.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recurring Action Details"
msgstr "Detail Tindakan Berulang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/recurring-actions.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:11
msgid ""
"View the details about an action from the action list.  In the `Actions` "
"column, click the btn:[Details] icon for the action you are interested in."
msgstr "Lihat detail tindakan dari daftar tindakan.  Pada kolom `Actions`, klik ikon btn:[Details] untuk tindakan yang ingin Anda lihat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/recurring-actions.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For more information about recurring actions, see "
"xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang tindakan berulang, lihat xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schedule Menu"
msgstr "Menu Jadwal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:2
msgid "The `Schedule` section allows you to view actions and action chains."
msgstr "Bagian `Schedule` memungkinkan Anda melihat tindakan dan rantai tindakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:3
msgid "Actions include:"
msgstr "Tindakan mencakup:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Package alterations, including installation, upgrade, removal, and rolling "
"back of packages"
msgstr "Perubahan paket, termasuk instalasi, peningkatan versi, penghapusan, dan pengembalian paket ke kondisi sebelumnya"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:5
msgid "Client reboots"
msgstr "Mulai ulang klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:6
msgid "Patch installation"
msgstr "Instalasi patch"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:7
msgid "Configuration file alterations, including deploy, upload, and diff"
msgstr "Perubahan berkas konfigurasi, termasuk penerapan, pengunggahan, dan perbandingan perbedaan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:8
msgid "Hardware profile updates"
msgstr "Pembaruan profil perangkat keras"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:9
msgid "Package list profile updates"
msgstr "Pembaruan profil daftar paket"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:10
msgid "Automated installation initiation"
msgstr "Memulai instalasi otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:11
msgid "Product migrations"
msgstr "Migrasi produk"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:12
msgid "Remote commands"
msgstr "Perintah jarak jauh"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Details"
msgstr "Detail Saluran"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Software[Channel List > Channel Details] section displays the "
"details of a selected channel.  Click the name of a channel in the `Channel "
"List` to see more information about the channel."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Software[Channel List > Channel Details] menampilkan detail saluran yang dipilih.  Klik nama saluran dalam `Channel List` untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang saluran tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The `Details` tab shows the basic channel details, including a description "
"of the channel, and the dates it was last modified and built.  This tab also "
"provides contact information for the maintainer of the product and the "
"GPG key details, where available."
msgstr "Tab `Details` menampilkan detail dasar saluran, termasuk deskripsi saluran serta tanggal terakhir saluran diubah dan dibuat.  Tab ini juga menyediakan informasi kontak pengelola produk dan detail kunci GPG, jika tersedia."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managers"
msgstr "Pengelola"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The `Managers` tab shows which users are authorized to manage the selected "
"channel.  The list shows the username, real name, and email address of the "
"channel manager, as well as the current status of the user."
msgstr "Tab `Managers` menampilkan pengguna yang berwenang mengelola saluran yang dipilih.  Daftar ini menampilkan nama pengguna, nama asli, dan alamat email pengelola saluran, serta status pengguna saat ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Organization and Channel administrators can manage any channel.  "
"{productname} Administrators can change roles for specific users by clicking "
"the username."
msgstr "Administrator Organisasi dan Saluran dapat mengelola saluran apa pun.  Administrator {productname} dapat mengubah peran pengguna tertentu dengan mengeklik nama pengguna."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For more information about user management, see "
"xref:administration:users.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan pengguna, lihat xref:administration:users.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:10
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:9
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-patches.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patches"
msgstr "Patch"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The `Patches` tab shows all available patches for packages in the selected "
"channel.  The list displays the advisory type, names, synopsis, and the date "
"the patch was last updated.  Click the advisory name to go to the `Patch "
"Details` page."
msgstr "Tab `Patches` menampilkan semua patch yang tersedia untuk paket dalam saluran yang dipilih.  Daftar ini menampilkan jenis advisori, nama, ringkasan, dan tanggal terakhir patch diperbarui.  Klik nama advisori untuk membuka halaman `Patch Details`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:12
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For more information about managing patches and packages, see "
"xref:client-configuration:patch-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan patch dan paket, lihat xref:client-configuration:patch-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The `Packages` tab shows all packages in the selected channel.  The list "
"shows the package name, summary, and the provider of the package.  Click the "
"package name to go to the `Package Details` page."
msgstr "Tab `Packages` menampilkan semua paket dalam saluran yang dipilih.  Daftar ini menampilkan nama paket, ringkasan, dan penyedia paket.  Klik nama paket untuk membuka halaman `Package Details`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The `Subscribed Systems` tab shows the clients currently subscribed to the "
"selected channel.  The list shows the client name and type.  Check a client "
"in the list to add it to the system set manager.  Click the client name to "
"go to the `System Details` page."
msgstr "Tab `Subscribed Systems` menampilkan klien yang saat ini berlangganan saluran yang dipilih.  Daftar ini menampilkan nama dan jenis klien.  Centang klien dalam daftar untuk menambahkannya ke pengelola kumpulan sistem.  Klik nama klien untuk membuka halaman `System Details`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:18
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-menu.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about the system set manager, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelola kumpulan sistem, lihat xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The `Target Systems` tab shows the clients eligible for subscription to the "
"selected channel.  This tab is only available if the selected channel is a "
"child channel.  The list shows the client name and type, and the associated "
"base channel."
msgstr "Tab `Target Systems` menampilkan klien yang memenuhi syarat untuk berlangganan saluran yang dipilih.  Tab ini hanya tersedia jika saluran yang dipilih merupakan saluran turunan.  Daftar ini menampilkan nama dan jenis klien, serta saluran dasar yang terkait."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To subscribe a client to the selected channel, check the client in the list, "
"and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "Untuk membuat klien berlangganan saluran yang dipilih, centang klien dalam daftar, lalu klik btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:22
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:9
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-distribution-channel-mapping.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-menu.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:12
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:23
msgid ""
"For more information about software channels, see "
"xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang saluran perangkat lunak, lihat xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:23
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-appstreams.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "AppStreams"
msgstr "AppStreams"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:24
msgid ""
"The `AppStreams` tab is only visible for modular channels and it shows all "
"the available modules in the channel.  The list shows the module name and "
"the streams available for the module.  The default stream for each module is "
"indicated with a highlighted color."
msgstr "Tab `AppStreams` hanya terlihat untuk saluran modular dan menampilkan semua modul yang tersedia dalam saluran tersebut.  Daftar ini menampilkan nama modul dan stream yang tersedia untuk modul tersebut.  Stream bawaan untuk setiap modul ditandai dengan warna sorotan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:25
msgid ""
"For more information about AppStreams and how to use them, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#appstream-filters[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang AppStreams dan cara menggunakannya, lihat xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#appstream-filters[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Channels"
msgstr "Kelola Saluran"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Software[Manage > Channels] section allows you to manage custom "
"channels."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Software[Manage > Channels] memungkinkan Anda mengelola saluran kustom."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-channels.adoc:3
msgid "Click btn:[Create Channel] to create a new custom channel."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Channel] untuk membuat saluran kustom baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-channels.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To clone an existing channel, click btn:[Clone Channel] and select the "
"channel to clone.  You can choose to clone channel with or without all "
"current patches, or select specific patches for inclusion."
msgstr "Untuk mengkloning saluran yang sudah ada, klik btn:[Clone Channel] dan pilih saluran yang akan dikloning.  Anda dapat memilih untuk mengkloning saluran dengan atau tanpa semua patch yang ada saat ini, atau memilih patch tertentu untuk disertakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-channels.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-packages.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-manage-menu.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang saluran kustom, lihat xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-packages.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Packages"
msgstr "Kelola Paket"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-packages.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Software[Manage > Packages] section allows you to manage packages "
"that are owned by your organization."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Software[Manage > Packages] memungkinkan Anda mengelola paket milik organisasi Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-packages.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Select a channel from the drop-down box to see all packages related to that "
"channel.  If you have administration privileges within your organization, "
"you can also delete packages."
msgstr "Pilih saluran dari kotak daftar menurun untuk melihat semua paket yang terkait dengan saluran tersebut.  Jika Anda memiliki hak akses administratif dalam organisasi, Anda juga dapat menghapus paket."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-packages.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Orphaned packages are packages that are synchronized by {productname}, but "
"not associated with a software channel.  For handling those packages, see "
"xref:client-configuration:package-management.adoc#package-management-orphaned-packages[]."
msgstr "Paket yatim adalah paket yang disinkronkan oleh {productname}, tetapi tidak terkait dengan saluran perangkat lunak.  Untuk menangani paket tersebut, lihat xref:client-configuration:package-management.adoc#package-management-orphaned-packages[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-repositories.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Repositories"
msgstr "Kelola Repositori"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-repositories.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Software[Manage > Repositories] section allows you to manage custom "
"or third-party package repositories and link the repositories to an existing "
"channel."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Software[Manage > Repositories] memungkinkan Anda mengelola repositori paket kustom atau pihak ketiga dan menautkan repositori tersebut ke saluran yang sudah ada."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-repositories.adoc:3
msgid "Click btn:[Create Repository] to create a new repository."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Repository] untuk membuat repositori baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-repositories.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about custom repositories and channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang repositori dan saluran kustom, lihat xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel List Menu"
msgstr "Menu Daftar Saluran"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Software[Channel List] section allows you to view and manage "
"software channels and packages on your clients."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Software[Channel List] memungkinkan Anda melihat dan mengelola saluran perangkat lunak serta paket pada klien Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The menu:Software[Channel List > All] section displays a list of all "
"software channels that are available to your organization."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Software[Channel List > All] menampilkan daftar semua saluran perangkat lunak yang tersedia untuk organisasi Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Each software channel in the list shows a channel name, a provider, the "
"number of packages and patches in the channel, and the number of clients "
"currently subscribed to the channel.  Click the plus sign next to the name "
"of a parent channel to expand the entry and see all the related child "
"channels.  Click the channel name to see more information about the channel."
msgstr "Setiap saluran perangkat lunak dalam daftar menampilkan nama saluran, penyedia, jumlah paket dan patch dalam saluran, serta jumlah klien yang saat ini berlangganan saluran tersebut.  Klik tanda tambah di samping nama saluran induk untuk memperluas entri dan melihat semua saluran turunan yang terkait.  Klik nama saluran untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang saluran tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Within the menu:Software[Channel List] section you can select which subset "
"of channels you would like to see by navigating to tabs, or the sub-menu "
"items."
msgstr "Di bagian menu:Software[Channel List], Anda dapat memilih kelompok saluran yang ingin ditampilkan dengan membuka tab atau item submenu."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel List Filters"
msgstr "Filter Daftar Saluran"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Filter      | Description\n"
"| All         | All channels available to your organization.\n"
"| SUSE        | Channels provided by {suse}.\n"
"| Popular     | Channels most subscribed to by clients in your "
"organization.\n"
"| My Channels | Software channels that belong to your organization, "
"including custom channels.\n"
"| Shared      | Channels shared with others in the organizational trust.\n"
"| Retired     | Channels that have reached end-of-life and no longer receive "
"updates.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Filter      | Deskripsi\n"
"| Semua       | Semua saluran yang tersedia untuk organisasi Anda.\n"
"| SUSE        | Saluran yang disediakan oleh {suse}.\n"
"| Populer     | Saluran yang paling banyak dilanggan oleh klien dalam organisasi Anda.\n"
"| Saluran Saya | Saluran perangkat lunak milik organisasi Anda, termasuk saluran kustom.\n"
"| Dibagikan   | Saluran yang dibagikan kepada organisasi lain dalam hubungan kepercayaan antarorganisasi.\n"
"| Dihentikan  | Saluran yang telah mencapai akhir masa pakai dan tidak lagi menerima pembaruan.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-distribution-channel-mapping.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distribution Channel Mapping"
msgstr "Pemetaan Saluran Distribusi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-distribution-channel-mapping.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Software[Distribution Channel Mapping] section lists your defined "
"default base channels.  When you register a client for the first time, they "
"will automatically be assigned to these software channels, in accordance "
"with their architecture and operating system.  Default channel mappings can "
"be edited, but not deleted."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Software[Distribution Channel Mapping] mencantumkan saluran dasar bawaan yang telah Anda tentukan.  Saat Anda mendaftarkan klien untuk pertama kalinya, klien tersebut akan secara otomatis ditetapkan ke saluran perangkat lunak ini sesuai dengan arsitektur dan sistem operasinya.  Pemetaan saluran bawaan dapat diedit, tetapi tidak dapat dihapus."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-distribution-channel-mapping.adoc:3
msgid "Click btn:[Create Distribution Channel Mapping] to create a new channel map."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Distribution Channel Mapping] untuk membuat pemetaan saluran baru."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-distribution-channel-mapping.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distribution Channel Mapping Columns"
msgstr "Kolom Pemetaan Saluran Distribusi"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-distribution-channel-mapping.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column                | Description\n"
"| Operating System      | The client operating system this mapping applies "
"to.\n"
"| Release               | The operating system release this mapping applies "
"to.\n"
"| Architecture          | The client system architecture this mapping "
"applies to.\n"
"| Channel Label         | The label of the channel.\n"
"| Organization Specific | Checked if this mapping applies only to the "
"current organization.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom                 | Deskripsi\n"
"| Sistem Operasi        | Sistem operasi klien yang menjadi sasaran pemetaan ini.\n"
"| Rilis              | Rilis sistem operasi yang menjadi sasaran pemetaan ini.\n"
"| Arsitektur            | Arsitektur sistem klien yang menjadi sasaran pemetaan ini.\n"
"| Label Saluran         | Label saluran.\n"
"| Khusus Organisasi     | Dicentang jika pemetaan ini hanya berlaku untuk organisasi saat ini.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-manage-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Menu"
msgstr "Menu Kelola"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-manage-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Software[Manage] section allows you to manage custom channels, "
"packages, and repositories."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Software[Manage] memungkinkan Anda mengelola saluran kustom, paket, dan repositori."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Software Menu"
msgstr "Menu Perangkat Lunak"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The `Software` section allows you to view and manage software channels, "
"repositories, and packages."
msgstr "Bagian `Software` memungkinkan Anda melihat dan mengelola saluran perangkat lunak, repositori, dan paket."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package Search"
msgstr "Pencarian Paket"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:2
msgid "The menu:Software[Package Search] section allows you to search all packages."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Software[Package Search] memungkinkan Anda mencari semua paket."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:3
msgid "Enter your search term in the `Search For` field."
msgstr "Masukkan istilah pencarian Anda pada kolom `Search For`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "What to Search Options"
msgstr "Opsi Cakupan Pencarian"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option               | Description\n"
"| Free form            | Performs a general search.\n"
"Use keywords with this option to perform more specific searches.\n"
"| Name only            | Searches only in the names of packages.\n"
"| Name and Summary     | Searches within the name and one-line summary of "
"packages.\n"
"| Name and Description | Searches within names and long descriptions of "
"packages.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Opsi                 | Deskripsi\n"
"| Bentuk bebas         | Melakukan pencarian umum.\n"
"Gunakan kata kunci dengan opsi ini untuk melakukan pencarian yang lebih spesifik.\n"
"| Hanya nama           | Mencari hanya dalam nama paket.\n"
"| Nama dan Ringkasan   | Mencari dalam nama dan ringkasan satu baris paket.\n"
"| Nama dan Deskripsi   | Mencari dalam nama dan deskripsi panjang paket.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Check the `Channels relevant to your systems` option to search only channels "
"available for your existing clients.  Check the `Specific channel you have "
"access to` option to search within a specific channel.  Check the `Packages "
"of a specific architecture` to search only for a particular hardware "
"architecture."
msgstr "Centang opsi `Channels relevant to your systems` untuk mencari hanya pada saluran yang tersedia bagi klien Anda yang sudah ada.  Centang opsi `Specific channel you have access to` untuk mencari dalam saluran tertentu.  Centang `Packages of a specific architecture` untuk mencari hanya paket bagi arsitektur perangkat keras tertentu."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You can perform more specific searches by using keywords in the `Search For` "
"field and selecting the `Free Form` option."
msgstr "Anda dapat melakukan pencarian yang lebih spesifik dengan menggunakan kata kunci pada kolom `Search For` dan memilih opsi `Free Form`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keyword Search Options"
msgstr "Opsi Pencarian Kata Kunci"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Keyword     | Description | Example\n"
"| name        | Search package names | `name:SUSE`\n"
"| version     | Search for a package version | `version:15`\n"
"| filename    | Search within package file names | `filename:sles`\n"
"| description | Search within the long description | `description:java`\n"
"| summary     | Search within the one-line summary | `summary:java`\n"
"| arch        | Search for a package architecture | `arch:x86_64`\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kata Kunci  | Deskripsi | Contoh\n"
"| name        | Mencari nama paket | `name:SUSE`\n"
"| version     | Mencari versi paket | `version:15`\n"
"| filename    | Mencari dalam nama berkas paket | `filename:sles`\n"
"| description | Mencari dalam deskripsi panjang | `description:java`\n"
"| summary     | Mencari dalam ringkasan satu baris | `summary:java`\n"
"| arch        | Mencari arsitektur paket | `arch:x86_64`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For example, if you want to search all {sle} packages that include `java` in "
"the description and the summary, use this search:"
msgstr "Misalnya, jika Anda ingin mencari semua paket {sle} yang memuat `java` dalam deskripsi dan ringkasannya, gunakan pencarian berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "summary:java and description:java\n"
msgstr "summary:java and description:java\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd Reference"
msgstr "Referensi spacecmd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The following section will help you become more familiar with the `spacecmd` "
"command-line interface.  This interface is available for {productname}, "
"Satellite and Spacewalk servers.  spacecmd is written in Python and uses the "
"XML-RPC API provided by the server."
msgstr "Bagian berikut akan membantu Anda lebih mengenal antarmuka baris perintah `spacecmd`.  Antarmuka ini tersedia untuk server {productname}, Satellite, dan Spacewalk.  spacecmd ditulis dalam Python dan menggunakan API XML-RPC yang disediakan oleh server."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "What can spacecmd do for me?"
msgstr "Apa yang dapat dilakukan spacecmd untuk saya?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Manage almost all aspects of {productname} from the command line with "
"spacecmd"
msgstr "Mengelola hampir semua aspek {productname} dari baris perintah dengan spacecmd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:6
msgid "Tab completion is available for all commands"
msgstr "Pelengkapan otomatis dengan tombol Tab tersedia untuk semua perintah"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Single commands can be passed to spacecmd without entering the interactive "
"shell (excellent for shell scripts)"
msgstr "Perintah tunggal dapat diteruskan ke spacecmd tanpa masuk ke shell interaktif (sangat cocok untuk skrip shell)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:8
msgid "May also be accessed and used as an interactive shell"
msgstr "Juga dapat diakses dan digunakan sebagai shell interaktif"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Advanced search methods are available for finding specific systems, thus "
"removing the need to create system groups (nevertheless groups are still "
"recommended)"
msgstr "Metode pencarian lanjutan tersedia untuk menemukan sistem tertentu sehingga tidak perlu membuat grup sistem (meskipun demikian, penggunaan grup tetap disarankan)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Complete functionality through the Spacewalk API. Almost all commands that "
"can be executed from the {webui} can be performed via the spacecmd "
"command-line"
msgstr "Fungsionalitas lengkap melalui API Spacewalk. Hampir semua perintah yang dapat dijalankan dari {webui} dapat dijalankan melalui baris perintah spacecmd"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "activationkey"
msgstr "activationkey"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:2
msgid "The following spacecmd commands are available for use with activation keys."
msgstr "Perintah spacecmd berikut tersedia untuk digunakan dengan kunci aktivasi."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "activationkey_addchildchannels"
msgstr "activationkey_addchildchannels"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:4
