"channel:CHANNEL"
msgstr "<SYSTEMS> dapat diganti dengan salah satu target berikut: name ssm (lihat 'help ssm')  search:QUERY (lihat 'help system_search')  group:GROUP channel:CHANNEL"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring spacecmd"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi spacecmd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:3
msgid "The following section provides configuration tips for spacecmd."
msgstr "Bagian berikut menyediakan kiat konfigurasi untuk spacecmd."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup `spacecmd` credentials"
msgstr "Menyiapkan kredensial `spacecmd`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Normally spacecmd prompts you for a username and password each time you "
"attempt to login to the interactive shell.  Alternatively you can configure "
"spacecmd with a credentials file to avoid this requirement."
msgstr "Secara bawaan, spacecmd meminta nama pengguna dan kata sandi setiap kali Anda mencoba masuk ke shell interaktif.  Sebagai alternatif, Anda dapat mengonfigurasi spacecmd dengan berkas kredensial agar tidak perlu memasukkannya setiap kali masuk."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a `spacecmd` credentials file"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat berkas kredensial `spacecmd`"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Create a hidden spacecmd directory in your home directory and set "
"permissions:"
msgstr "Buat direktori spacecmd tersembunyi di direktori home Anda dan tetapkan izin aksesnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir ~/.spacecmd\n"
"chmod 700 ~/.spacecmd\n"
msgstr ""
"mkdir ~/.spacecmd\n"
"chmod 700 ~/.spacecmd\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:9
msgid "Create a `config` file in `~/.spacecmd/` and provide proper permissions:"
msgstr "Buat berkas `config` di `~/.spacecmd/` dan tetapkan izin akses yang sesuai:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"touch ~/.spacecmd/config\n"
"chmod 600 ~/.spacecmd/config\n"
msgstr ""
"touch ~/.spacecmd/config\n"
"chmod 600 ~/.spacecmd/config\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Edit the `config` file and add the following configuration lines. (You can "
"use either localhost, when running spacecmd from your {productname} server "
"container, or the FQDN of your {productname} server):"
msgstr "Edit berkas `config` dan tambahkan baris konfigurasi berikut. (Anda dapat menggunakan localhost saat menjalankan spacecmd dari container server {productname}, atau FQDN server {productname} Anda):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "[spacecmd]\n"
msgstr "[spacecmd]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "server=FQDN-here\n"
msgstr "server=FQDN-here\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"username=username-here\n"
"password=password-here\n"
msgstr ""
"username=username-here\n"
"password=password-here\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:15
msgid "Check connectivity by entering `spacecmd` as root:"
msgstr "Periksa konektivitas dengan menjalankan `spacecmd` sebagai root:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "# spacecmd\n"
msgstr "# spacecmd\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "`spacecmd` quiet mode"
msgstr "Mode senyap `spacecmd`"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:18
msgid ""
"By default spacecmd prints server status messages during connection "
"attempts.  These messages can cause a lot of clutter when parsing system "
"lists.  The following alias will force spacecmd to use quiet mode thus "
"preventing this behavior.  Add the following line to your `~/.bashrc` file:"
msgstr "Secara bawaan, spacecmd menampilkan pesan status server selama upaya koneksi.  Pesan-pesan ini dapat menghasilkan banyak keluaran yang mengganggu saat mengurai daftar sistem.  Alias berikut akan memaksa spacecmd menggunakan mode senyap untuk mencegah hal tersebut.  Tambahkan baris berikut ke berkas `~/.bashrc` Anda:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "alias spacecmd='spacecmd -q'\n"
msgstr "alias spacecmd='spacecmd -q'\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "`spacecmd` help"
msgstr "Bantuan `spacecmd`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:21
msgid "spacecmd help can be accessed by typing spacecmd `-h --help`"
msgstr "Bantuan spacecmd dapat diakses dengan mengetik spacecmd `-h --help`"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage: spacecmd [options] [command]\n"
msgstr "Usage: spacecmd [options] [command]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Options:\n"
"  -c CONFIG, --config CONFIG\n"
"                        config file to use [default: ~/.spacecmd/config]\n"
"  -u USERNAME, --username=USERNAME\n"
"                        use this username to connect to the server\n"
"  -p PASSWORD, --password=PASSWORD\n"
"                        use this password to connect to the server\n"
"  -s SERVER, --server=SERVER\n"
"                        connect to this server [default: local hostname]\n"
"  --nossl               use HTTP instead of HTTPS\n"
"  --nohistory           do not store command history\n"
"  -y, --yes             answer yes for all questions\n"
"  -q, --quiet           print only error messages\n"
"  -d, --debug           print debug messages (can be passed multiple "
"times)\n"
"  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n"
msgstr ""
"Opsi:\n"
"  -c CONFIG, --config CONFIG\n"
"                        berkas konfigurasi yang digunakan [default: ~/.spacecmd/config]\n"
"  -u USERNAME, --username=USERNAME\n"
"                        gunakan nama pengguna ini untuk terhubung ke server\n"
"  -p PASSWORD, --password=PASSWORD\n"
"                        gunakan kata sandi ini untuk terhubung ke server\n"
"  -s SERVER, --server=SERVER\n"
"              hubungkan ke server ini [default: nama host lokal]\n"
"  --nossl          gunakan HTTP sebagai pengganti HTTPS\n"
"  --nohistory           jangan simpan riwayat perintah\n"
"  -y, --yes             jawab ya untuk semua pertanyaan\n"
"  -q, --quiet           tampilkan hanya pesan kesalahan\n"
"  -d, --debug           tampilkan pesan debug (dapat diberikan beberapa kali)\n"
"  -h, --help            tampilkan pesan bantuan ini lalu keluar\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/configuring-spacecmd.adoc:24
msgid ""
