#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/misc-help-topics.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Miscellaneous Help Topics"
msgstr "Topik Bantuan Lainnya"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/misc-help-topics.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The following help topics are printed with all functions requiring the "
"relevant information."
msgstr "Topik bantuan berikut ditampilkan bersama semua fungsi yang memerlukan informasi terkait."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/misc-help-topics.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "time "
msgstr "time "

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/misc-help-topics.adoc:4
msgid "Dates can be any of the following:"
msgstr "Tanggal dapat dinyatakan dalam salah satu bentuk berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/misc-help-topics.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Explicit Dates:\n"
"Dates can be expressed as explicit date strings in the YYYYMMDD[HHMM] "
"format.\n"
"The year, month and day are required, while the hours and minutes are not; "
"the hours and minutes will default to 0000 if no values are provided.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tanggal Eksplisit:\n"
"Tanggal dapat dinyatakan sebagai string tanggal eksplisit dalam format YYYYMMDD[HHMM].\n"
"Tahun, bulan, dan hari wajib diisi, sedangkan jam dan menit tidak; nilai bawaan jam dan menit adalah 0000 jika tidak diisi.\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/misc-help-topics.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Deltas:\n"
"Dates can be expressed as delta values.\n"
"For example, '2h' would mean 2 hours in the future.\n"
"You can also use negative values to express times in the past (e.g., -7d "
"would be one week ago).\n"
msgstr ""
"Delta:\n"
"Tanggal dapat dinyatakan sebagai nilai delta.\n"
"Misalnya, '2h' berarti 2 jam dari sekarang.\n"
"Anda juga dapat menggunakan nilai negatif untuk menyatakan waktu di masa lalu (misalnya, -7d berarti satu minggu yang lalu).\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/misc-help-topics.adoc:7
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:17
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:23
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:28
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:34
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:40
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/system.adoc:169
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Units:\n"
"s -> seconds\n"
"m -> minutes\n"
"h -> hours\n"
"d -> days\n"
msgstr ""
"Satuan:\n"
"s -> detik\n"
"m -> menit\n"
"h -> jam\n"
"d -> hari\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/misc-help-topics.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "systems"
msgstr "systems"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/misc-help-topics.adoc:9
msgid "<SYSTEMS> can be any of the following:"
msgstr "<SYSTEMS> dapat berupa salah satu dari berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/misc-help-topics.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"name\n"
"ssm (see 'help ssm')\n"
"search:QUERY (see 'help system_search')\n"
"group:GROUP\n"
"channel:CHANNEL\n"
msgstr ""
"name\n"
"ssm (lihat 'help ssm')\n"
"search:QUERY (lihat 'help system_search')\n"
"group:GROUP\n"
"channel:CHANNEL\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/misc-help-topics.adoc:11
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/ssm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssm"
msgstr "ssm"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/misc-help-topics.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The System Set Manager (SSM) is a group of systems that you can perform "
"tasks on as a group."
msgstr "System Set Manager (SSM) adalah kumpulan sistem yang dapat Anda gunakan untuk menjalankan tugas secara berkelompok."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/misc-help-topics.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Adding Systems:\n"
"> ssm_add group:rhel5-x86_64\n"
"> ssm_add channel:rhel-x86_64-server-5\n"
"> ssm_add search:device:vmware\n"
"> ssm_add host.example.com\n"
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan Sistem:\n"
"> ssm_add group:rhel5-x86_64\n"
"> ssm_add channel:rhel-x86_64-server-5\n"
"> ssm_add search:device:vmware\n"
"> ssm_add host.example.com\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/misc-help-topics.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Intersections:\n"
"> ssm_add group:rhel5-x86_64\n"
"> ssm_intersect group:web-servers\n"
msgstr ""
"Irisan:\n"
"> ssm_add group:rhel5-x86_64\n"
"> ssm_intersect group:web-servers\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/misc-help-topics.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Using the SSM:\n"
"> system_installpackage ssm zsh\n"
"> system_runscript ssm\n"
msgstr ""
"Menggunakan SSM:\n"
"> system_installpackage ssm zsh\n"
"> system_runscript ssm\n"

