#, no-wrap
msgid "system_runscript"
msgstr "system_runscript"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/system.adoc:163
msgid "Schedule a script to run on the list of systems provided."
msgstr "Jadwalkan skrip untuk dijalankan pada daftar sistem yang diberikan."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/system.adoc:164
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: system_runscript <SYSTEMS> [options]\n"
msgstr "penggunaan: system_runscript <SYSTEMS> [options]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/system.adoc:165
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"options:\n"
"  -u USER\n"
"  -g GROUP\n"
"  -t TIMEOUT\n"
"  -s START_TIME\n"
"  -l LABEL\n"
"  -f FILE\n"
msgstr ""
"opsi:\n"
"  -u USER\n"
"  -g GROUP\n"
"  -t TIMEOUT\n"
"  -s START_TIME\n"
"  -l LABEL\n"
"  -f FILE\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/system.adoc:167
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Dates can be any of the following:\n"
"Explicit Dates:\n"
"Dates can be expressed as explicit date strings in the YYYYMMDD[HHMM]\n"
"format.  The year, month and day are required, while the hours and\n"
"minutes are not; the hours and minutes will default to 0000 if no\n"
"values are provided.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tanggal dapat dinyatakan dalam salah satu bentuk berikut:\n"
"Tanggal Eksplisit:\n"
"Tanggal dapat dinyatakan sebagai string tanggal eksplisit dalam format YYYYMMDD[HHMM]\n"
".  Tahun, bulan, dan hari wajib diisi, sedangkan jam dan\n"
"menit tidak; nilai bawaan jam dan menit adalah 0000 jika tidak\n"
"diisi.\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/system.adoc:168
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Deltas:\n"
"Dates can be expressed as delta values.  For example, '2h' would\n"
"mean 2 hours in the future.  You can also use negative values to\n"
"express times in the past (e.g., -7d would be one week ago).\n"
msgstr ""
"Delta:\n"
"Tanggal dapat dinyatakan sebagai nilai delta.  Misalnya, '2h'\n"
"berarti 2 jam dari sekarang.  Anda juga dapat menggunakan nilai negatif untuk\n"
"menyatakan waktu di masa lalu (misalnya, -7d berarti satu minggu yang lalu).\n"

