#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:2
msgid "This section provides troubleshooting solutions when working with spacecmd"
msgstr "Bagian ini menyediakan solusi pemecahan masalah saat menggunakan spacecmd"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating a distribution where `spacecmd` sets `localhost` instead of FQDN"
msgstr "Pembuatan distribusi saat `spacecmd` menetapkan `localhost` alih-alih FQDN"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Situation"
msgstr "Situasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:5
msgid ""
"When creating a distribution with spacecmd it will automatically set "
"`localhost` as the server name instead of the FQDN of {productname}.  This "
"will result in the following kernel option being written:"
msgstr "Saat membuat distribusi dengan spacecmd, nama server secara otomatis ditetapkan ke `localhost`, bukan FQDN {productname}.  Hal ini menyebabkan opsi kernel berikut dituliskan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:6
msgid "install=http://localhost/ks/dist/<distributionname>"
msgstr "install=http://localhost/ks/dist/<distributionname>"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "Solusi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:8
msgid "Set the FQDN in `$HOME/.spacecmd/config` like the following:"
msgstr "Tetapkan FQDN dalam `$HOME/.spacecmd/config` seperti berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:9
msgid "test:~/.spacecmd # cat config"
msgstr "test:~/.spacecmd # cat config"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:10
msgid "server=test.mytest.env username=admin password=password nossl=0"
msgstr "server=test.mytest.env username=admin password=password nossl=0"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cause"
msgstr "Penyebab"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:12
msgid ""
"This problem may be experienced if `$HOME/.spacecmd/config` has been created "
"and the server name option was set to `localhost`."
msgstr "Masalah ini dapat terjadi jika `$HOME/.spacecmd/config` telah dibuat dan opsi nama server ditetapkan ke `localhost`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "`spacecmd` not accepting commands or options"
msgstr "`spacecmd` tidak menerima perintah atau opsi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:14
msgid "When running `spacecmd` non-interactively:"
msgstr "Saat menjalankan `spacecmd` secara noninteraktif:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:15
msgid "you must escape arguments passed to the command."
msgstr "Anda harus melakukan escape pada argumen yang diteruskan ke perintah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:16
msgid ""
"always put `--` before arguments, to avoid them being treated as global "
"arguments."
msgstr "selalu tempatkan `--` sebelum argumen agar tidak diperlakukan sebagai argumen global."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:17
msgid ""
"make sure you escape any quotes that you pass to the functions so that they "
"are not interpreted."
msgstr "pastikan Anda melakukan escape pada setiap tanda kutip yang diteruskan ke fungsi agar tanda kutip tersebut tidak diinterpretasikan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:18
msgid "An example of a well-formed `spacecmd` command:"
msgstr "Contoh perintah `spacecmd` dengan format yang benar:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:19
msgid ""
"spacecmd -s server1 -- softwarechannel_create -n \\'My Channel\\' -l "
"channel1 -a x86_64"
msgstr "spacecmd -s server1 -- softwarechannel_create -n 'My Channel' -l channel1 -a x86_64"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "`spacecmd` caching problems"
msgstr "Masalah cache `spacecmd`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The `spacecmd` command keeps a cache of the various systems and packages "
"that you have installed.  Sometimes, this can result in a mismatch between "
"the system name and the system ID."
msgstr "Perintah `spacecmd` menyimpan cache berbagai sistem dan paket yang telah Anda instal.  Terkadang, hal ini dapat menyebabkan ketidakcocokan antara nama sistem dan ID sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:22
msgid "To clear the `spacecmd` cache, use this command:"
msgstr "Untuk membersihkan cache `spacecmd`, gunakan perintah ini:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:23
msgid "spacecmd clear_caches"
msgstr "spacecmd clear_caches"

