"spacecmd {SSM:0}> whoamitalkingto\n"
"MGR_SERVER_HOSTNAME\n"
msgstr ""
"spacecmd {SSM:0}> whoamitalkingto\n"
"MGR_SERVER_HOSTNAME\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/activation-keys.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activation Keys"
msgstr "Kunci Aktivasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/activation-keys.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Activation Keys] section lists the current activation keys "
"for your organization."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Activation Keys] mencantumkan kunci aktivasi yang saat ini tersedia untuk organisasi Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/activation-keys.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The universal default activation key, if set, is automatically used for all "
"clients registered to your organization, unless you specify a different "
"activation key."
msgstr "Kunci aktivasi bawaan universal, jika ditetapkan, secara otomatis digunakan untuk semua klien yang terdaftar pada organisasi Anda, kecuali Anda menentukan kunci aktivasi lain."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/activation-keys.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The list of activation keys shows the name and description for each key, and "
"how many times the key has been used.  It also shows if the key is currently "
"enabled for your organization.  Click the key description to see more "
"information about the activation key."
msgstr "Daftar kunci aktivasi menampilkan nama dan deskripsi setiap kunci, serta jumlah penggunaan kunci tersebut.  Daftar ini juga menunjukkan apakah kunci saat ini diaktifkan untuk organisasi Anda.  Klik deskripsi kunci untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang kunci aktivasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/activation-keys.adoc:5
msgid "Click btn:[Update Activation Keys] to refresh the list with recent changes."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Update Activation Keys] untuk memperbarui daftar dengan perubahan terbaru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/activation-keys.adoc:6
msgid "Click btn:[Create Key] to create a new activation key."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Key] untuk membuat kunci aktivasi baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/activation-keys.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about activation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang kunci aktivasi, lihat xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/advanced-search.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Advanced Search] section allows you to perform global "
"searches within your {productname} environment.  Searches can include "
"network information, hardware devices, location, activity, packages, "
"details, DMI information, and hardware."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Advanced Search] memungkinkan Anda melakukan pencarian global dalam lingkungan {productname} Anda.  Pencarian dapat mencakup informasi jaringan, perangkat keras, lokasi, aktivitas, paket, detail, informasi DMI, dan perangkat keras."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/advanced-search.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Type your search term in the `Search For` field.  Select the criterion to "
"search by, use the radio buttons to specify whether you want to query all "
"systems or only those in the `System Set Manager`, and click the "
"btn:[Search] button.  Check `Invert Result` to list only results that do not "
"match the specified criteria."
msgstr "Ketik istilah pencarian Anda pada kolom `Search For`.  Pilih kriteria pencarian, gunakan tombol radio untuk menentukan apakah Anda ingin menelusuri semua sistem atau hanya sistem dalam `System Set Manager`, lalu klik tombol btn:[Search].  Centang `Invert Result` untuk menampilkan hanya hasil yang tidak cocok dengan kriteria yang ditentukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/advanced-search.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When you add a distribution, synchronize channels, or register a client, it "
"can take several minutes for it to be indexed and appear in search results.  "
"To force a rebuild of the search index, use this command at the command "
"prompt:"
msgstr "Saat Anda menambahkan distribusi, menyinkronkan saluran, atau mendaftarkan klien, proses pengindeksan hingga data muncul dalam hasil pencarian dapat memerlukan beberapa menit.  Untuk memaksa pembuatan ulang indeks pencarian, gunakan perintah ini pada prompt perintah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/advanced-search.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "rhn-search cleanindex\n"
msgstr "rhn-search cleanindex\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-distributions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distributions"
msgstr "Distribusi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-distributions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Distributions] section lists the "
"available autoinstallable distributions."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Distributions] mencantumkan distribusi yang tersedia untuk instalasi otomatis."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-distributions.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click the distribution name to see more information.  Click btn:[Create "
"Distribution] to create a new autoinstallable distribution."
msgstr "Klik nama distribusi untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya.  Klik btn:[Create Distribution] untuk membuat distribusi baru yang dapat diinstal secara otomatis."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-distributions.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about autoinstallable distributions, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang distribusi yang dapat diinstal secara otomatis, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-file-preservation.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "File Preservation"
msgstr "Pemertahanan Berkas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-file-preservation.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > File Preservation] section allows you to "
"store lists of files, to use them in {kickstart} profiles later on."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > File Preservation] memungkinkan Anda menyimpan daftar berkas untuk digunakan dalam profil {kickstart} di kemudian hari."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-file-preservation.adoc:3
msgid "Click btn:[Create File Preservation List] to create a new list."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create File Preservation List] untuk membuat daftar baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-file-preservation.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about {kickstart} file preservation, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pemertahanan berkas {kickstart}, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-gpg-and-ssl-keys.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG and SSL Keys"
msgstr "Kunci GPG dan SSL"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-gpg-and-ssl-keys.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > GPG and SSL Keys] section lists all "
"GPG public keys and SSL certificates currently available.  Click the name of "
"a key to see more information."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > GPG and SSL Keys] mencantumkan semua kunci publik GPG dan sertifikat SSL yang saat ini tersedia.  Klik nama kunci untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-gpg-and-ssl-keys.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create Stored Key/Cert] to store a new GPG key or SSL "
"certificate."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Stored Key/Cert] untuk menyimpan kunci GPG atau sertifikat SSL baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-gpg-and-ssl-keys.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about GPG keys and SSL certificates, see "
"xref:client-configuration:gpg-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang kunci GPG dan sertifikat SSL, lihat xref:client-configuration:gpg-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Autoinstallation Menu"
msgstr "Menu Instalasi Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Autoinstallation] section allows you to manage clients for "
"autoinstallation."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Autoinstallation] memungkinkan Anda mengelola klien untuk instalasi otomatis."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-menu.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-overview.adoc:13
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:38
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For more information about autoinstallation, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang instalasi otomatis, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Autoinstallation Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran Umum Instalasi Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Overview] section displays an overview "
"of your autoinstallation settings, including clients that are "
"autoinstalling, or scheduled to be autoinstalled."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Overview] menampilkan gambaran umum pengaturan instalasi otomatis Anda, termasuk klien yang sedang menjalani instalasi otomatis atau dijadwalkan untuk diinstal secara otomatis."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-overview.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:4
msgid "The menu:Systems[Details > Overview] subtab is split into sections:"
msgstr "Subtab menu:Systems[Details > Overview] dibagi menjadi beberapa bagian:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-overview.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Autoinstallation Summary"
msgstr "Ringkasan Instalasi Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-overview.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This section lists the {ay} and {kickstart} profiles currently available, "
"and the number of clients installed with each profile."
msgstr "Bagian ini mencantumkan profil {ay} dan {kickstart} yang saat ini tersedia, serta jumlah klien yang diinstal menggunakan setiap profil."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-overview.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Autoinstallation Actions"
msgstr "Tindakan Instalasi Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-overview.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This section provides links to actions related to autoinstallation.  You can "
"also access these using the menu:Systems[Autoinstallation] menu."
msgstr "Bagian ini menyediakan tautan ke tindakan yang terkait dengan instalasi otomatis.  Anda juga dapat mengaksesnya melalui menu menu:Systems[Autoinstallation]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-overview.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Systems Currently Autoinstalling"
msgstr "Sistem yang Sedang Menjalani Instalasi Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-overview.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This section lists all clients that are currently autoinstalling, along with "
"their status."
msgstr "Bagian ini mencantumkan semua klien yang sedang menjalani instalasi otomatis beserta statusnya."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-overview.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Systems Scheduled to be Autoinstalled"
msgstr "Sistem yang Dijadwalkan untuk Diinstal Secara Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-overview.adoc:11
msgid ""
"This section lists all clients that are scheduled for autoinstallation, "
"along with their status."
msgstr "Bagian ini mencantumkan semua klien yang dijadwalkan untuk menjalani instalasi otomatis beserta statusnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-overview.adoc:12
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-profiles.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create Kickstart Profile] to create a new {kickstart} profile.  "
"Click btn:[Upload Kickstart/{ay} File] to upload a new autoinstallation "
"file."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Kickstart Profile] untuk membuat profil {kickstart} baru.  Klik btn:[Upload Kickstart/{ay} File] untuk mengunggah berkas instalasi otomatis baru."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-profiles.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Autoinstallation Profiles"
msgstr "Profil Instalasi Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-profiles.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles] section lists all profiles "
"currently available.  The list includes information about if the profile is "
"active, the distribution it is based on, and if it being managed with "
"{productname}."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles] mencantumkan semua profil yang saat ini tersedia.  Daftar ini mencakup informasi tentang apakah profil aktif, distribusi yang menjadi dasarnya, dan apakah profil dikelola dengan {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-profiles.adoc:3
msgid "Click the name of a profile to see more information."
msgstr "Klik nama profil untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-profiles.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information about autoinstallation profiles, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang profil instalasi otomatis, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-snippets.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Autoinstallation Snippets"
msgstr "Cuplikan Instalasi Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-snippets.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Autoinstallation Snippets] section "
"allows you to store code snippets, to use them in autoinstallation profiles "
"later on."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Autoinstallation Snippets] memungkinkan Anda menyimpan cuplikan kode untuk digunakan dalam profil instalasi otomatis di kemudian hari."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-snippets.adoc:3
msgid "Click btn:[Create Snippet] to create a new code snippet."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Snippet] untuk membuat cuplikan kode baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/autoinst-snippets.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about autoinstallation profiles using these code "
"snippets, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang profil instalasi otomatis yang menggunakan cuplikan kode ini, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/bootstrapping.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrapping"
msgstr "Bootstrapping"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/bootstrapping.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Bootstrapping] section allows you to register a single Salt "
"client."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Bootstrapping] memungkinkan Anda mendaftarkan satu klien Salt."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/bootstrapping.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap Options"
msgstr "Opsi Bootstrap"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/bootstrapping.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option\n"
"| Description\n"
"| Default\n"
"\n"
"| Host\n"
"| The hostname of the client to be registered\n"
"| -\n"
"\n"
"| SSH port\n"
"| The port on the client that allows SSH access\n"
"| 22\n"
"\n"
"| User\n"
"| The user name to use to log in to the client\n"
"| root\n"
"\n"
"| Authentication Method\n"
"| Choose `Password` for simple authentication, or `SSH Private Key` to use "
"SSH authentication.\n"
"| Password\n"
"\n"
"| Password\n"
"| The password to use to log in to the client\n"
"| -\n"
"\n"
"| SSH Private Key\n"
"| Upload the SSH Private Key to use to log in to the client\n"
"| -\n"
"\n"
"| SSH Private Key Passphrase\n"
"| The passphrase for the SSH Private Key, or leave blank for no password.\n"
"| -\n"
"\n"
"| Activation Key\n"
"| The activation key to use to register the client.\n"
"Leave blank to use the universal default activation key, or select `None` "
"for no activation key.\n"
"| None\n"
"\n"
"| Proxy\n"
"| The proxy to which the client should be registered.\n"
"Leave blank if you are not using a proxy.\n"
"| None\n"
"\n"
"| Disable SSH strict host key checking\n"
"| Automatically adds the host key to the known hosts file\n"
"| Checked\n"
"\n"
"| Manage system completely via SSH\n"
"| Uses only the SSH contact method\n"
"| Unchecked\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| Opsi\n"
"| Deskripsi\n"
"| Nilai Bawaan\n"
"\n"
"| Host\n"
"| Nama host klien yang akan didaftarkan\n"
"| -\n"
"\n"
"| Port SSH\n"
"| Port pada klien yang memungkinkan akses SSH\n"
"| 22\n"
"\n"
"| Pengguna\n"
"| Nama pengguna yang digunakan untuk masuk ke klien\n"
"| root\n"
"\n"
"| Metode Autentikasi\n"
"| Pilih `Password` untuk autentikasi sederhana, atau `SSH Private Key` untuk menggunakan autentikasi SSH.\n"
"| Kata sandi\n"
"\n"
"| Kata Sandi\n"
"| Kata sandi yang digunakan untuk masuk ke klien\n"
"| -\n"
"\n"
"| Kunci Privat SSH\n"
"| Unggah Kunci Privat SSH yang akan digunakan untuk masuk ke klien\n"
"| -\n"
"\n"
"| Frasa Sandi Kunci Privat SSH\n"
"| Frasa sandi untuk Kunci Privat SSH, atau biarkan kosong jika tidak menggunakan kata sandi.\n"
"| -\n"
"\n"
"| Kunci Aktivasi\n"
"| Kunci aktivasi yang digunakan untuk mendaftarkan klien.\n"
"Biarkan kosong untuk menggunakan kunci aktivasi bawaan universal, atau pilih `None` jika tidak menggunakan kunci aktivasi.\n"
"| Tidak ada\n"
"\n"
"| Proxy\n"
"| Proxy tempat klien akan didaftarkan.\n"
"Biarkan kosong jika Anda tidak menggunakan proxy.\n"
"| Tidak ada\n"
"\n"
"| Nonaktifkan pemeriksaan ketat kunci host SSH\n"
"| Secara otomatis menambahkan kunci host ke berkas host yang dikenal\n"
"| Dicentang\n"
"\n"
"| Kelola sistem sepenuhnya melalui SSH\n"
"| Hanya menggunakan metode kontak SSH\n"
"| Tidak dicentang\n"
"\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/bootstrapping.adoc:5
msgid ""
"SSH private keys are stored only for the duration of the bootstrapping "
"process.  They are deleted from the {productname} Server as soon as "
"bootstrapping is complete."
msgstr "Kunci privat SSH hanya disimpan selama proses bootstrapping berlangsung.  Kunci tersebut dihapus dari Server {productname} segera setelah bootstrapping selesai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/bootstrapping.adoc:6
msgid ""
"When you have completed the details of the client you want to register, "
"click btn:[Bootstrap].  When the client has completed registering, navigate "
"to menu:Systems[System List] to see details."
msgstr "Setelah Anda melengkapi detail klien yang ingin didaftarkan, klik btn:[Bootstrap].  Setelah pendaftaran klien selesai, buka menu:Systems[System List] untuk melihat detailnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/bootstrapping.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about bootstrapping, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang bootstrapping, lihat xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/custom-system-info.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom System Information"
msgstr "Informasi Sistem Kustom"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/custom-system-info.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Custom System Info] section lists the custom system "
"information available to clients in your organization."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Custom System Info] mencantumkan informasi sistem kustom yang tersedia bagi klien dalam organisasi Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/custom-system-info.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create Key] to create a new custom system key.  Click the key "
"label to see more information, and to edit the value."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Key] untuk membuat kunci sistem kustom baru.  Klik label kunci untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya dan mengedit nilainya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/custom-system-info.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-custom-info.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about custom system information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:custom-info.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang informasi sistem kustom, lihat xref:client-configuration:custom-info.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/proxy-configuration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi Proxy"

#.  **FIXME: add details!**
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/proxy-configuration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] section allows you to configure proxy "
"clients."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Proxy Configuration] memungkinkan Anda mengonfigurasi klien proxy."

#.  manage clients that you have added to the system set manager.
#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Set Manager"
msgstr "Pengelola Kumpulan Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System Set Manager] section allows you to manage clients "
"that you have added to the system set manager."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System Set Manager] memungkinkan Anda mengelola klien yang telah ditambahkan ke pengelola kumpulan sistem."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Set Manager Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran Umum Pengelola Kumpulan Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Overview] section allows you to manage "
"clients that you have added to the system set manager (SSM).  You can also "
"access this page by clicking the `systems selected` icon in the top menu "
"bar."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Overview] memungkinkan Anda mengelola klien yang telah ditambahkan ke pengelola kumpulan sistem (SSM).  Anda juga dapat mengakses halaman ini dengan mengeklik ikon `systems selected` pada bilah menu atas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-task-log.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information about SSM, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang SSM, lihat xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:4
msgid "The menu:Systems[Systems Set Manager] menu is split into tabs:"
msgstr "Menu menu:Systems[Systems Set Manager] dibagi menjadi beberapa tab:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:6
msgid "This section provides quick access to all the of the SSM tabs."
msgstr "Bagian ini menyediakan akses cepat ke semua tab SSM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This section lists all clients currently in the SSM.  It provides "
"information about the updates available, when thew client last checked in, "
"the registered base channel, and system type.  Click the client name to see "
"more information."
msgstr "Bagian ini mencantumkan semua klien yang saat ini berada dalam SSM.  Bagian ini menyediakan informasi tentang pembaruan yang tersedia, waktu terakhir klien melapor, saluran dasar yang terdaftar, dan jenis sistem.  Klik nama klien untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:10
msgid ""
"This section lists all patches available for upgrade on clients currently in "
"the SSM.  Click the number in the `Affected` column to see which clients a "
"patch applies to.  To perform upgrades, check the patches to apply and click "
"btn:[Apply Patches]."
msgstr "Bagian ini mencantumkan semua patch yang tersedia untuk peningkatan pada klien yang saat ini berada dalam SSM.  Klik angka pada kolom `Affected` untuk melihat klien yang dapat menerapkan patch tersebut.  Untuk melakukan peningkatan, centang patch yang akan diterapkan, lalu klik btn:[Apply Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about patch management, see "
"xref:client-configuration:patch-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan patch, lihat xref:client-configuration:patch-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:13
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:26
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:34
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:44
msgid "This section is split into subtabs."
msgstr "Bagian ini dibagi menjadi beberapa subtab."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The menu:Packages[Upgrade] subtab lists all packages available for upgrade "
"on clients currently in the SSM.  To perform upgrades, check the packages to "
"upgrade and click btn:[Upgrade Selected Packages]."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Packages[Upgrade] mencantumkan semua paket yang tersedia untuk peningkatan versi pada klien yang saat ini berada dalam SSM.  Untuk melakukan peningkatan versi, centang paket yang akan ditingkatkan, lalu klik btn:[Upgrade Selected Packages]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The menu:Packages[Install] subtab allows you to install new packages on all "
"clients currently in the SSM.  To install packages, click the base channel "
"that contains the package, check the packages to install, and click "
"btn:[Install Selected Packages]."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Packages[Install] memungkinkan Anda menginstal paket baru pada semua klien yang saat ini berada dalam SSM.  Untuk menginstal paket, klik saluran dasar yang berisi paket tersebut, centang paket yang akan diinstal, lalu klik btn:[Install Selected Packages]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The menu:Packages[Remove] subtab allows you to remove packages from all "
"clients currently in the SSM.  If clients in the SSM have different versions "
"of a package installed, multiple versions are available in the list.  To "
"remove packages, select the packages to remove, and click btn:[Remove "
"Selected Packages]."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Packages[Remove] memungkinkan Anda menghapus paket dari semua klien yang saat ini berada dalam SSM.  Jika klien dalam SSM memiliki versi paket terinstal yang berbeda, beberapa versi akan tersedia dalam daftar.  Untuk menghapus paket, pilih paket yang akan dihapus, lalu klik btn:[Remove Selected Packages]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information about package management, see "
"xref:client-configuration:package-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan paket, lihat xref:client-configuration:package-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:18
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-groups.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Groups"
msgstr "Grup"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:19
msgid ""
"This section lists all system groups clients currently available in your "
"organization.  Click btn:[Create Group] to create a new system group.  For "
"each group in the list, check `Add` to add all clients in the SSM to the "
"group, check `Remove` to remove all clients in the SSM from the group, or "
"check `No Change` to leave group assignments as they are.  Click btn:[Alter "
"Membership] to change group assignments."
msgstr "Bagian ini mencantumkan semua grup sistem yang saat ini tersedia dalam organisasi Anda.  Klik btn:[Create Group] untuk membuat grup sistem baru.  Untuk setiap grup dalam daftar, centang `Add` untuk menambahkan semua klien dalam SSM ke grup tersebut, centang `Remove` untuk menghapus semua klien dalam SSM dari grup tersebut, atau centang `No Change` untuk membiarkan keanggotaan grup tetap seperti semula.  Klik btn:[Alter Membership] untuk mengubah keanggotaan grup."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:20
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-groups.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-groups.adoc:7
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:25
msgid ""
"For more information about system groups, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-groups.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang grup sistem, lihat xref:client-configuration:system-groups.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:22
msgid ""
"This section lists all base channels clients currently subscribed to by "
"clients currently in the SSM.  You can change all clients subscribed to a "
"current base channel to a new base channel, by selecting the new base "
"channel and following the prompts."
msgstr "Bagian ini mencantumkan semua saluran dasar yang saat ini dilanggan oleh klien dalam SSM.  Anda dapat mengalihkan semua klien yang berlangganan saluran dasar saat ini ke saluran dasar baru dengan memilih saluran dasar baru dan mengikuti petunjuk."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For more information about using the SSM to change base channels, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggunaan SSM untuk mengubah saluran dasar, lihat xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:25
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The menu:Configuration[Deploy Files] subtab lists all configuration files "
"available for deployment.  Click the number in the `Systems` column to see "
"which clients are currently subscribed to the configuration file.  To assign "
"a configuration file to the clients currently in the SSM, check the "
"configuration file, and click btn:[Schedule File Deploy]."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Configuration[Deploy Files] mencantumkan semua berkas konfigurasi yang tersedia untuk diterapkan.  Klik angka pada kolom `Systems` untuk melihat klien yang saat ini berlangganan berkas konfigurasi tersebut.  Untuk menetapkan berkas konfigurasi ke klien yang saat ini berada dalam SSM, centang berkas konfigurasi, lalu klik btn:[Schedule File Deploy]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The menu:Configuration[Compare Files] subtab lists all configuration files "
"available for comparison.  This compares the configuration file deployed on "
"a client with the configuration file stored on the {productname} Server.  "
"Click the number in the `Systems` column to see which clients are currently "
"subscribed to the configuration file.  To compare configuration files, check "
"the configuration files to compare, and click btn:[Schedule File "
"Comparison]."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Configuration[Compare Files] mencantumkan semua berkas konfigurasi yang tersedia untuk dibandingkan.  Perbandingan ini membandingkan berkas konfigurasi yang diterapkan pada klien dengan berkas konfigurasi yang disimpan pada Server {productname}.  Klik angka pada kolom `Systems` untuk melihat klien yang saat ini berlangganan berkas konfigurasi tersebut.  Untuk membandingkan berkas konfigurasi, centang berkas konfigurasi yang akan dibandingkan, lalu klik btn:[Schedule File Comparison]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The menu:Configuration[Subscribe to Channels] subtab lists all configuration "
"channels available for subscription.  To subscribe the clients in the SSM to "
"a new configuration channel, check the configuration channel, click "
"btn:[Continue], and follow the prompts."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Configuration[Subscribe to Channels] mencantumkan semua saluran konfigurasi yang tersedia untuk dilanggan.  Untuk membuat klien dalam SSM berlangganan saluran konfigurasi baru, centang saluran konfigurasi, klik btn:[Continue], lalu ikuti petunjuk."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:30
msgid ""
"The menu:Configuration[Unsubscribe from Channels] subtab lists all "
"configuration channels clients in the SSM are currently subscribed to.  To "
"unsubscribe the clients in the SSM from a configuration channel, check the "
"configuration channel and click btn:[Unsubscribe Systems]."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Configuration[Unsubscribe from Channels] mencantumkan semua saluran konfigurasi yang saat ini dilanggan oleh klien dalam SSM.  Untuk menghentikan langganan klien dalam SSM dari saluran konfigurasi, centang saluran konfigurasi, lalu klik btn:[Unsubscribe Systems]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The menu:Configuration[Enable Configuration] subtab lists clients in the SSM "
"that are capable of using configuration management, but have not yet been "
"enabled.  To enable clients in the SSM to use configuration management, "
"check the client and click btn:[Enable Configuration Management]."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Configuration[Enable Configuration] mencantumkan klien dalam SSM yang mendukung pengelolaan konfigurasi, tetapi fitur tersebut belum diaktifkan.  Untuk mengaktifkan penggunaan pengelolaan konfigurasi pada klien dalam SSM, centang klien, lalu klik btn:[Enable Configuration Management]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:32
msgid ""
"For more information about configuration management, see "
"xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan konfigurasi, lihat xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:33
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Provisioning"
msgstr "Provisioning"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:35
msgid ""
"The menu:Provisioning[Autoinstallation] subtab lists all clients in the SSM "
"available for autoinstallation, with their base channel.  To schedule "
"autoinstallation, select an autoinstallable type, click btn:[Continue] and "
"follow the prompts."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Provisioning[Autoinstallation] mencantumkan semua klien dalam SSM yang tersedia untuk instalasi otomatis beserta saluran dasarnya.  Untuk menjadwalkan instalasi otomatis, pilih jenis instalasi otomatis, klik btn:[Continue], lalu ikuti petunjuk."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:36
msgid ""
"The menu:Provisioning[Power Management Configuration] subtab allows you to "
"configure power management for the clients in the SSM.  For more information "
"about power management, see "
"xref:client-configuration:power-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Provisioning[Power Management Configuration] memungkinkan Anda mengonfigurasi pengelolaan daya untuk klien dalam SSM.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan daya, lihat xref:client-configuration:power-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:37
msgid ""
"The menu:Provisioning[Power Operations] subtab allows you to power on, power "
"off, or reboot the clients in the SSM.  For more information about power "
"management, see xref:client-configuration:power-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Provisioning[Power Operations] memungkinkan Anda menyalakan, mematikan, atau memulai ulang klien dalam SSM.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan daya, lihat xref:client-configuration:power-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:39
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "States"
msgstr "State"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For Salt clients, the menu:States[Highstate] subtab allows you to apply the "
"highstate to all clients in the SSM."
msgstr "Untuk klien Salt, subtab menu:States[Highstate] memungkinkan Anda menerapkan highstate ke semua klien dalam SSM."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:41
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Audit"
msgstr "Audit"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:42
msgid ""
"For more information about auditing, see "
"xref:administration:auditing.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang audit, lihat xref:administration:auditing.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Misc"
msgstr "Lainnya"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:45
msgid ""
"The menu:Misc[Preferences] subtab allows you to configure the custom "
"information, system types, and system preferences for the clients in the "
"SSM."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Misc[Preferences] memungkinkan Anda mengonfigurasi informasi kustom, jenis sistem, dan preferensi sistem untuk klien dalam SSM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:46
msgid ""
"The menu:Misc[Hardware] subtab allows you to schedule a hardware profile "
"refresh for the clients in the SSM."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Misc[Hardware] memungkinkan Anda menjadwalkan penyegaran profil perangkat keras untuk klien dalam SSM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:47
msgid ""
"The menu:Misc[Software] subtab allows you to schedule a package profile "
"refresh for the clients in the SSM."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Misc[Software] memungkinkan Anda menjadwalkan penyegaran profil paket untuk klien dalam SSM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:48
msgid ""
"The menu:Misc[Remote Command] subtab allows you to schedule a remote command "
"to be executed on the clients in the SSM."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Misc[Remote Command] memungkinkan Anda menjadwalkan perintah jarak jauh untuk dijalankan pada klien dalam SSM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:49
msgid ""
"The menu:Misc[Custom Values] subtab allows you to set or remove custom key "
"values for the clients in the SSM."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Misc[Custom Values] memungkinkan Anda menetapkan atau menghapus nilai kunci kustom untuk klien dalam SSM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:50
msgid ""
"The menu:Misc[Reboot] subtab allows you to schedule a reboot for the clients "
"in the SSM."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Misc[Reboot] memungkinkan Anda menjadwalkan mulai ulang untuk klien dalam SSM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:51
msgid ""
"The menu:Misc[Transfer] subtab allows you to move clients in the SSM to a "
"new organization."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Misc[Transfer] memungkinkan Anda memindahkan klien dalam SSM ke organisasi baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:52
msgid ""
"The menu:Misc[Delete] subtab allows you to delete the system profiles of "
"clients in the SSM."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Misc[Delete] memungkinkan Anda menghapus profil sistem klien dalam SSM."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-task-log.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Set Manager Task Log"
msgstr "Log Tugas Pengelola Kumpulan Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-task-log.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Task Log] section shows all actions "
"applied to clients that you have added to the system set manager (SSM).  The "
"SSM Task Log lists all actions performed against clients currently in SSM.  "
"Click an entry to see more information about the action."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Task Log] menampilkan semua tindakan yang diterapkan pada klien yang telah Anda tambahkan ke pengelola kumpulan sistem (SSM).  Log Tugas SSM mencantumkan semua tindakan yang dijalankan pada klien yang saat ini berada dalam SSM.  Klik entri untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang tindakan tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-task-log.adoc:3
msgid "This section is divided into tabs:"
msgstr "Bagian ini dibagi menjadi beberapa tab:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-task-log.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The `All` tab lists all actions that have been performed.  The `In Progress` "
"tab lists all actions that are currently in progress.  The `Completed` tab "
"lists all actions that have been completed."
msgstr "Tab `All` mencantumkan semua tindakan yang telah dijalankan.  Tab `In Progress` mencantumkan semua tindakan yang sedang berlangsung.  Tab `Completed` mencantumkan semua tindakan yang telah selesai."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/stored-profiles.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Stored Profiles"
msgstr "Profil Tersimpan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/stored-profiles.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Stored Profiles] section lists the stored profiles for your "
"organization.  Profiles can be used to compare packages installed on "
"clients."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Stored Profiles] mencantumkan profil yang disimpan untuk organisasi Anda.  Profil dapat digunakan untuk membandingkan paket yang terinstal pada klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/stored-profiles.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click the name of a profile to see more information about the packages in "
"the profile, or to edit the name or description."
msgstr "Klik nama profil untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang paket dalam profil tersebut, atau untuk mengedit nama atau deskripsinya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/stored-profiles.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about using profiles to compare packages, see "
"xref:client-configuration:package-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggunaan profil untuk membandingkan paket, lihat xref:client-configuration:package-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-ansible.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ansible"
msgstr "Ansible"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-ansible.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:System Details[Ansible] tab allows you to use the Ansible features "
"on the Control Node system."
msgstr "Tab menu:System Details[Ansible] memungkinkan Anda menggunakan fitur Ansible pada sistem Control Node."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-ansible.adoc:3
msgid "The tab is split into the following subtabs:"
msgstr "Tab ini dibagi menjadi subtab berikut:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-ansible.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Control Node"
msgstr "Control Node"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-ansible.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Fields for defining playbook directories and paths to inventory files on "
"your Ansible Control Node."
msgstr "Kolom untuk menentukan direktori playbook dan path ke berkas inventaris pada Ansible Control Node Anda."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-ansible.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Playbooks"
msgstr "Playbook"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-ansible.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Lists all playbooks in the defined paths.  You can click a playbook to "
"display its details or to schedule its execution."
msgstr "Mencantumkan semua playbook dalam path yang telah ditentukan.  Anda dapat mengeklik playbook untuk menampilkan detailnya atau menjadwalkan pelaksanaannya."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-ansible.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inventories"
msgstr "Inventaris"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-ansible.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Lists all inventory files in the defined paths.  Clicking an inventory file "
"in the list introspects its contents."
msgstr "Mencantumkan semua berkas inventaris dalam path yang telah ditentukan. Mengeklik berkas inventaris dalam daftar akan memeriksa isinya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-ansible.adoc:10
msgid "For more information, see xref:administration:ansible-integration.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:administration:ansible-integration.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-appstreams.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Software > AppStreams] section allows you to manage the "
"list of enabled AppStream modules on the selected client."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Software > AppStreams] memungkinkan Anda mengelola daftar modul AppStream yang diaktifkan pada klien yang dipilih."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-appstreams.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Software > AppStreams] tab is only available if the client "
"has any AppStream channels assigned."
msgstr "Tab menu:Systems[Software > AppStreams] hanya tersedia jika klien telah ditetapkan ke setidaknya satu saluran AppStream."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-appstreams.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The page lists all the AppStream modules that are currently available to the "
"client.  After modifying the selection of enabled modules, click btn:[Apply "
"Changes] to schedule an action to update the selection on the client."
msgstr "Halaman ini mencantumkan semua modul AppStream yang saat ini tersedia untuk klien.  Setelah mengubah pilihan modul yang diaktifkan, klik btn:[Apply Changes] untuk menjadwalkan tindakan guna memperbarui pilihan tersebut pada klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-appstreams.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information about managing AppStreams on a client, see "
"xref:client-configuration:appstreams.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan AppStreams pada klien, lihat xref:client-configuration:appstreams.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Audit] section displays the results of OpenSCAP scans that "
"you have performed on the selected client."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Audit] menampilkan hasil pemindaian OpenSCAP yang telah Anda lakukan pada klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:5
msgid "The menu:Systems[Audit] subtab is split into sections:"
msgstr "Subtab menu:Systems[Audit] dibagi menjadi beberapa bagian:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "List scans"
msgstr "Daftar pemindaian"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This section displays ther results of openSCAP scans that have been "
"performed on the selected client."
msgstr "Bagian ini menampilkan hasil pemindaian OpenSCAP yang telah dilakukan pada klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:8
msgid "The table columns on this page are:"
msgstr "Kolom tabel pada halaman ini adalah:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenSCAP Scan Results"
msgstr "Hasil Pemindaian OpenSCAP"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Name              | Description\n"
"| Xccdf Test Result | The name of the test result\n"
"| Diff              | FIXME\n"
"| Completed         | The time that the scan was completed\n"
"| Compliance        | The unweighted pass/fail ratio\n"
"| P                 | The number of checks that passed\n"
"| F                 | The number of checks that failed\n"
"| E                 | The number of errors that occurred\n"
"| U                 | The number of checks with an unknown status\n"
"| N                 | The number of checks that were not applicable to the "
"selected client\n"
"| K                 | The number of checks not run\n"
"| S                 | The number of checks that were not selected\n"
"| I                 | The number of checks that have information available "
"for review\n"
"| X                 | The number of checks that reported a status of fixed\n"
"| Total             | The total number of checks run\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nama              | Deskripsi\n"
"| Hasil Uji Xccdf    | Nama hasil pengujian\n"
"| Perbedaan         | FIXME\n"
"| Selesai           | Waktu pemindaian selesai\n"
"| Kepatuhan         | Rasio lulus/gagal tanpa pembobotan\n"
"| P                 | Jumlah pemeriksaan yang lulus\n"
"| F   | Jumlah pemeriksaan yang gagal\n"
"| E                 | Jumlah kesalahan yang terjadi\n"
"| U                 | Jumlah pemeriksaan dengan status tidak diketahui\n"
"| N                 | Jumlah pemeriksaan yang tidak berlaku untuk klien yang dipilih\n"
"| K           | Jumlah pemeriksaan yang tidak dijalankan\n"
"| S                 | Jumlah pemeriksaan yang tidak dipilih\n"
"| I                 | Jumlah pemeriksaan yang memiliki informasi untuk ditinjau\n"
"| X                | Jumlah pemeriksaan yang melaporkan status telah diperbaiki\n"
"| Total  | Jumlah total pemeriksaan yang dijalankan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:11
msgid "Click the name of a scan test result to see details about the result."
msgstr "Klik nama hasil pengujian pemindaian untuk melihat detail hasil tersebut."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rule result detail"
msgstr "Detail hasil aturan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The `Details of Rule Result` page displays detailed information about a "
"specific XCCDF rule evaluation result and provides remediation "
"capabilities.  This page is accessed by clicking a rule in the XCCDF scan "
"results."
msgstr "Halaman `Details of Rule Result` menampilkan informasi terperinci tentang hasil evaluasi aturan XCCDF tertentu dan menyediakan kemampuan remediasi.  Halaman ini diakses dengan mengeklik aturan dalam hasil pemindaian XCCDF."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rule information"
msgstr "Informasi aturan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:15
msgid "The top of the page displays the following details about the rule result:"
msgstr "Bagian atas halaman menampilkan detail berikut tentang hasil aturan:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rule Result Details"
msgstr "Detail Hasil Aturan"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field                      | Description\n"
"| Reference within Document  | The unique identifier of the rule within the "
"SCAP document.\n"
"| Evaluation Result          | The outcome of the rule evaluation (for "
"example: `pass`, `fail`, `notselected`).\n"
"| Parent Scan                | A link back to the parent XCCDF scan result "
"that contains this rule.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom                      | Deskripsi\n"
"| Referensi dalam Dokumen    | Pengidentifikasi unik aturan dalam dokumen SCAP.\n"
"| Hasil Evaluasi   | Hasil evaluasi aturan (misalnya: `pass`, `fail`, `notselected`).\n"
"| Pemindaian Induk           | Tautan kembali ke hasil pemindaian XCCDF induk yang memuat aturan ini.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remediation"
msgstr "Remediasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:19
msgid "The remediation panel provides two tabs for managing remediation scripts:"
msgstr "Panel remediasi menyediakan dua tab untuk mengelola skrip remediasi:"

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Original tab"
msgstr "Tab Asli"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Displays the original remediation script from the SCAP datastream in a "
"read-only code editor.  This is the remediation provided by the benchmark "
"author and cannot be modified."
msgstr "Menampilkan skrip remediasi asli dari datastream SCAP dalam editor kode hanya-baca.  Remediasi ini disediakan oleh penulis benchmark dan tidak dapat diubah."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom tab"
msgstr "Tab Kustom"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Allows you to write and save custom remediation scripts for this rule.  "
"Custom remediations can be written in two script types:"
msgstr "Memungkinkan Anda menulis dan menyimpan skrip remediasi kustom untuk aturan ini.  Remediasi kustom dapat ditulis dalam dua jenis skrip:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Script Types"
msgstr "Jenis Skrip"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Script Type  | Description\n"
"| Bash Script  | A shell script to remediate the rule.\n"
"| Salt State   | A Salt state in YAML format to remediate the rule.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Jenis Skrip  | Deskripsi\n"
"| Skrip Bash   | Skrip shell untuk meremediasi aturan.\n"
"| State Salt   | State Salt dalam format YAML untuk meremediasi aturan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:26
msgid ""
"You can maintain separate Bash and Salt remediations for the same rule by "
"switching between script types using the btn:[Script Type] dropdown."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengelola remediasi Bash dan Salt secara terpisah untuk aturan yang sama dengan beralih jenis skrip menggunakan daftar menurun btn:[Script Type]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:27
msgid "The following actions are available in the Custom tab:"
msgstr "Tindakan berikut tersedia pada tab Kustom:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:28
msgid "Click btn:[Save Custom Remediation] to save the custom remediation script."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Save Custom Remediation] untuk menyimpan skrip remediasi kustom."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Delete Custom Remediation] to remove the saved custom remediation "
"for the current script type.  A confirmation dialog is displayed before "
"deletion."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Delete Custom Remediation] untuk menghapus remediasi kustom yang tersimpan untuk jenis skrip saat ini.  Dialog konfirmasi ditampilkan sebelum penghapusan."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Applying remediation"
msgstr "Menerapkan remediasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:31
msgid "To apply a remediation:"
msgstr "Untuk menerapkan remediasi:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:32
msgid "Select the appropriate tab (`Original` or `Custom`)."
msgstr "Pilih tab yang sesuai (`Original` atau `Custom`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Use the `Schedule` section to select the date and time for the remediation "
"action."
msgstr "Gunakan bagian `Schedule` untuk memilih tanggal dan waktu tindakan remediasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Apply Remediation] to schedule the remediation.  A confirmation "
"dialog is displayed before the action is scheduled."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Apply Remediation] untuk menjadwalkan remediasi.  Dialog konfirmasi ditampilkan sebelum tindakan dijadwalkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:35
msgid ""
"After scheduling, a link to the scheduled action is displayed at the top of "
"the page."
msgstr "Setelah penjadwalan, tautan ke tindakan terjadwal ditampilkan di bagian atas halaman."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schedule"
msgstr "Jadwal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:37
msgid ""
"The `Schedule New XCCDF Scan` panel allows you to schedule a compliance scan "
"on one or more systems.  You can either select a predefined SCAP policy or "
"manually configure the scan parameters."
msgstr "Panel `Schedule New XCCDF Scan` memungkinkan Anda menjadwalkan pemindaian kepatuhan pada satu atau beberapa sistem.  Anda dapat memilih kebijakan SCAP yang telah ditentukan atau mengonfigurasi parameter pemindaian secara manual."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:38
msgid "This form is available from:"
msgstr "Formulir ini tersedia dari:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:39
msgid "A single system: menu:Systems[System Details > Audit > Schedule]"
msgstr "Satu sistem: menu:Systems[System Details > Audit > Schedule]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Multiple systems via SSM: menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Audit > "
"Schedule]"
msgstr "Beberapa sistem melalui SSM: menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Audit > Schedule]"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using a SCAP policy"
msgstr "Menggunakan kebijakan SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Select a policy from the btn:[SCAP Policy] dropdown to automatically "
"populate the scan configuration from the policy definition.  When a policy "
"is selected, the SCAP Content, XCCDF Profile, Tailoring File, Tailoring "
"Profile, and Fetch Remote Content fields are disabled and pre-filled with "
"the policy values."
msgstr "Pilih kebijakan dari daftar menurun btn:[SCAP Policy] untuk mengisi konfigurasi pemindaian secara otomatis berdasarkan definisi kebijakan. Saat kebijakan dipilih, kolom SCAP Content, XCCDF Profile, Tailoring File, Tailoring Profile, dan Fetch Remote Content dinonaktifkan dan diisi dengan nilai dari kebijakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:43
msgid ""
"To clear the policy selection and configure the scan manually, clear the "
"btn:[SCAP Policy] dropdown."
msgstr "Untuk menghapus pilihan kebijakan dan mengonfigurasi pemindaian secara manual, kosongkan pilihan pada daftar menurun btn:[SCAP Policy]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manual configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi manual"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:45
msgid ""
"If no policy is selected, you can manually configure the scan using the "
"fields below."
msgstr "Jika tidak ada kebijakan yang dipilih, Anda dapat mengonfigurasi pemindaian secara manual menggunakan kolom di bawah ini."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schedule SCAP Scan Fields"
msgstr "Kolom Penjadwalan Pemindaian SCAP"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field                      | Required | Description\n"
"| SCAP Policy                | No       | Optionally select a predefined "
"compliance policy to auto-populate the scan configuration.\n"
"| SCAP Content               | Yes      | Select a SCAP content file "
"containing the security benchmarks.\n"
"| XCCDF Profile              | Yes      | Select an XCCDF profile from the "
"chosen SCAP content.\n"
"| Tailoring File             | No       | Optionally select a tailoring file "
"to customize the profile.\n"
"| Profile from Tailoring File | No       | Select a profile from the chosen "
"tailoring file.\n"
"| Advanced Arguments         | No       | Additional command-line arguments, "
"for example: `--rule <rule_id> --remediate`.\n"
"| OVAL Files                 | No       | Paths to local OVAL definitions on "
"the target system, comma separated.\n"
"| Fetch Remote Content       | No       | Enable fetching of remote "
"resources during the scan. This requires internet access and significant "
"memory on the target system.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kolom                      | Wajib | Deskripsi\n"
"| Kebijakan SCAP     | Tidak | Secara opsional, pilih kebijakan kepatuhan yang telah ditentukan untuk mengisi konfigurasi pemindaian secara otomatis.\n"
"| Konten SCAP                | Ya    | Pilih berkas konten SCAP yang berisi benchmark keamanan.\n"
"| Profil XCCDF               | Ya    | Pilih profil XCCDF dari konten SCAP yang dipilih.\n"
"| Berkas Penyesuaian         | Tidak | Secara opsional, pilih berkas penyesuaian untuk menyesuaikan profil.\n"
"| Profil dari Berkas Penyesuaian | Tidak | Pilih profil dari berkas penyesuaian yang dipilih.\n"
"| Argumen Lanjutan           | Tidak | Argumen baris perintah tambahan, misalnya: `--rule <rule_id> --remediate`.\n"
"| Berkas OVAL                | Tidak | Path ke definisi OVAL lokal pada sistem target, dipisahkan dengan koma.\n"
"| Ambil Konten Jarak Jauh    | Tidak | Aktifkan pengambilan sumber daya jarak jauh selama pemindaian. Fitur ini memerlukan akses internet dan memori dalam jumlah besar pada sistem target.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Enabling btn:[Fetch Remote Content] requires internet access and a large "
"amount of available memory on the target minion.  Ensure the target system "
"has sufficient resources before enabling this option."
msgstr "Mengaktifkan btn:[Fetch Remote Content] memerlukan akses internet dan memori tersedia dalam jumlah besar pada minion target.  Pastikan sistem target memiliki sumber daya yang memadai sebelum mengaktifkan opsi ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:49
msgid "Use the `Schedule` section to select the date and time for the scan."
msgstr "Gunakan bagian `Schedule` untuk memilih tanggal dan waktu pemindaian."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:50
msgid "Click btn:[Schedule] to schedule the scan."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Schedule] untuk menjadwalkan pemindaian."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Single system scheduling"
msgstr "Penjadwalan satu sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:52
msgid ""
"When scheduling a scan from a single system's audit page, a btn:[Create "
"Recurring] button is also available.  Click btn:[Create Recurring] to "
"navigate to the recurring actions page for the system, where you can set up "
"a recurring schedule for SCAP scans."
msgstr "Saat menjadwalkan pemindaian dari halaman audit satu sistem, tombol btn:[Create Recurring] juga tersedia.  Klik btn:[Create Recurring] untuk membuka halaman tindakan berulang sistem tersebut, tempat Anda dapat mengatur jadwal pemindaian SCAP berulang."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSM bulk scheduling"
msgstr "Penjadwalan massal SSM"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc:54
msgid ""
"When scheduling from the System Set Manager (SSM), the scan is applied to "
"all systems currently in the system set.  The btn:[Create Recurring] option "
"is not available in SSM mode."
msgstr "Saat menjadwalkan dari Pengelola Kumpulan Sistem (SSM), pemindaian diterapkan ke semua sistem yang saat ini berada dalam kumpulan sistem. Opsi btn:[Create Recurring] tidak tersedia dalam mode SSM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Configuration] section allows you to manage the "
"configuration files for the selected client.  Configuration files are "
"distributed with a configuration channel."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Configuration] memungkinkan Anda mengelola berkas konfigurasi untuk klien yang dipilih.  Berkas konfigurasi didistribusikan melalui saluran konfigurasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about configuration channels, see "
"xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang saluran konfigurasi, lihat xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:4
msgid "The menu:Systems[Configuration] tab is split into subtabs:"
msgstr "Tab menu:Systems[Configuration] dibagi menjadi beberapa subtab:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:6
msgid "The menu:Systems[Configuration > Overview] subtab is split into sections:"
msgstr "Subtab menu:Systems[Configuration > Overview] dibagi menjadi beberapa bagian:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran Umum Konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This section contained the total number of available configuration files, "
"and channel subscriptions.  Click the name of a configuration file or "
"channel to see more information.  Click btn:[Subscribe to channels] to "
"subscribe to additional configuration channels."
msgstr "Bagian ini memuat jumlah total berkas konfigurasi yang tersedia dan langganan saluran.  Klik nama berkas konfigurasi atau saluran untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya.  Klik btn:[Subscribe to channels] untuk berlangganan saluran konfigurasi tambahan."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recent Events"
msgstr "Peristiwa Terbaru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:10
msgid ""
"This section shows when the configuration channels was most recently "
"deployed on the selected client.  It also shows the most recent time that a "
"comparison was performed."
msgstr "Bagian ini menampilkan waktu terakhir saluran konfigurasi diterapkan pada klien yang dipilih.  Bagian ini juga menampilkan waktu terakhir perbandingan dilakukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:12
msgid ""
"This section allows you to deploy or to compare configuration channels on "
"the selected client."
msgstr "Bagian ini memungkinkan Anda menerapkan atau membandingkan saluran konfigurasi pada klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "View Files"
msgstr "Lihat Berkas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Configuration > View Files] subtab shows the configuration "
"files available through the system's subscribed configuration channels."
msgstr "Subtab menu:Systems[Configuration > View Files] menampilkan berkas konfigurasi yang tersedia melalui saluran konfigurasi yang dilanggan oleh sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The page shows a list of all available configuration files.  Click "
"btn:[View] to see details about the configuration file.  Click btn:[Compare] "
"to compare the configuration file to other files, or to various revisions of "
"itself.  Click the configuration channel name to see more information about "
"the channel that contains this configuration file.  Click the revision "
"number to see additional details about the configuration file."
msgstr "Halaman ini menampilkan daftar semua berkas konfigurasi yang tersedia. Klik btn:[View] untuk melihat detail berkas konfigurasi.  Klik btn:[Compare] untuk membandingkan berkas konfigurasi dengan berkas lain atau dengan berbagai revisi berkas itu sendiri.  Klik nama saluran konfigurasi untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang saluran yang memuat berkas konfigurasi ini.  Klik nomor revisi untuk melihat detail tambahan tentang berkas konfigurasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Configuration > Deploy Files] shows a list of available "
"configuration files that can be deployed on the selected client."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Configuration > Deploy Files] menampilkan daftar berkas konfigurasi yang tersedia untuk diterapkan pada klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare Files"
msgstr "Bandingkan Berkas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Configuration > Compare Files] shows a list of available "
"configuration files that can be compared to {productname} managed "
"configuration files.  Check the configuration file to compare and click "
"btn:[Compare Files] to schedule a comparison.  Click the revision number to "
"see additional details about the configuration file.  Click the "
"configuration channel name to see more information about the channel that "
"contains this configuration file."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Configuration > Compare Files] menampilkan daftar berkas konfigurasi yang tersedia untuk dibandingkan dengan berkas konfigurasi yang dikelola oleh {productname}.  Centang berkas konfigurasi yang akan dibandingkan, lalu klik btn:[Compare Files] untuk menjadwalkan perbandingan.  Klik nomor revisi untuk melihat detail tambahan tentang berkas konfigurasi.  Klik nama saluran konfigurasi untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang saluran yang memuat berkas konfigurasi ini."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Configuration Channels"
msgstr "Kelola Saluran Konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Configuration > Manage Configuration] subtab is split into "
"subtabs:"
msgstr "Subtab menu:Systems[Configuration > Manage Configuration] dibagi menjadi beberapa subtab:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "List/Unsubscribe from Channels"
msgstr "Daftar/Berhenti Berlangganan Saluran"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:23
msgid ""
"This section shows the list of currently subscribed channels.  To "
"unsubscribe the selected client from a configuration channel, check the "
"channel, and click btn:[Unsubscribe].  Click the configuration channel name "
"to see more information about the channel that contains this configuration "
"file."
msgstr "Bagian ini menampilkan daftar saluran yang saat ini dilanggan.  Untuk menghentikan langganan klien yang dipilih dari saluran konfigurasi, centang saluran, lalu klik btn:[Unsubscribe].  Klik nama saluran konfigurasi untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang saluran yang memuat berkas konfigurasi ini."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subscribe to Channels"
msgstr "Berlangganan Saluran"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:25
msgid ""
"This section shows the list of configuration channels that are available for "
"the selected client to subscribe to.  To subscribe the selected client to a "
"configuration channel, check the channel, and click btn:[Continue]."
msgstr "Bagian ini menampilkan daftar saluran konfigurasi yang tersedia untuk dilanggan oleh klien yang dipilih.  Untuk membuat klien yang dipilih berlangganan saluran konfigurasi, centang saluran, lalu klik btn:[Continue]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "View/Modify Rankings"
msgstr "Lihat/Ubah Peringkat"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc:27
msgid ""
"This section shows the currently subscribed configuration channels, in "
"ranked order.  Where settings conflicts occur between configuration "
"channels, channels closer to the top of the list take precedence.  To "
"complete subscription to a configuration channel, review the rankings, "
"adjust as necessary using the up and down arrows, and click btn:[Update "
"Channel Rankings]."
msgstr "Bagian ini menampilkan saluran konfigurasi yang saat ini dilanggan berdasarkan urutan peringkat.  Jika terjadi konflik pengaturan antar saluran konfigurasi, saluran yang posisinya lebih dekat ke bagian atas daftar akan diprioritaskan.  Untuk menyelesaikan proses berlangganan saluran konfigurasi, tinjau peringkatnya, sesuaikan jika perlu menggunakan panah atas dan bawah, lalu klik btn:[Update Channel Rankings]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-connection.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Koneksi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-connection.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Details > Connection] section allows configure proxy "
"connections for this system."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Details > Connection] memungkinkan Anda mengonfigurasi koneksi proxy untuk sistem ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-connection.adoc:3
msgid "These connections are used to reach the primary server."
msgstr "Koneksi ini digunakan untuk menjangkau server utama."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-custom-info.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom Info"
msgstr "Informasi Kustom"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-custom-info.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Details > Custom Info] section lists the custom system "
"information that has been applied to the selected client."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Details > Custom Info] mencantumkan informasi sistem kustom yang telah diterapkan pada klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-custom-info.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create Value] to apply a new custom system key to the client.  "
"Click the key label to see more information, and to edit the value."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Value] untuk menerapkan kunci sistem kustom baru pada klien.  Klik label kunci untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya dan mengedit nilainya."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Details"
msgstr "Detail Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The `System Details` section allows you to manage the details for a chosen "
"client.  To get to this section, click the name of a client anywhere "
"throughout the {webui} to see the relevant `System Details` page for the "
"client."
msgstr "Bagian `System Details` memungkinkan Anda mengelola detail klien yang dipilih.  Untuk membuka bagian ini, klik nama klien di bagian mana pun dalam {webui} untuk melihat halaman `System Details` yang sesuai bagi klien tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The `System Details` section is divided into tabs and subtabs.  Each tab and "
"some subtabs have own sections in this document."
msgstr "Bagian `System Details` dibagi menjadi beberapa tab dan subtab.  Setiap tab dan beberapa subtab memiliki bagian tersendiri dalam dokumen ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Details > Overview] subtab is displayed by default.  Which "
"tabs are available is dependent on the `system type` of the client you have "
"selected.  Most often, the flollowing are available:"
msgstr "Subtab menu:Systems[Details > Overview] ditampilkan secara bawaan.  Tab yang tersedia bergantung pada `system type` klien yang Anda pilih. Biasanya, tab berikut tersedia:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Details`           - "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Details`           - xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Software`\t\t - xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-software.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Software` - xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-software.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Btrfs Snapshots`      - "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-snapshots.adoc[] (transactional "
"systems only)\n"
msgstr "`Btrfs Snapshots`      - xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-snapshots.adoc[] (hanya sistem transaksional)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Configuration`\t - "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Configuration` - xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Provisioning`\t - "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Provisioning` - xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Groups`\t\t - xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-groups.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Groups` - xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-groups.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Audit`\t\t - xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Audit` - xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-audit.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "`States`\t\t - xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`States` - xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Formulas`\t\t - xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-formulas.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Formulas` - xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-formulas.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Recurring Actions` - "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Recurring Actions` - xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Events`            - "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-events.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Events`            - xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-events.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:16
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For more information about managing clients, see "
"xref:client-configuration:client-config-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan klien, lihat xref:client-configuration:client-config-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc:17
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For more information about managing clients, see "
"xref:client-configuration:uyuni-client-config-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan klien, lihat xref:client-configuration:uyuni-client-config-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-events.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Events"
msgstr "Peristiwa"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-events.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Events] section shows past, current, and scheduled actions "
"for the selected client."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Events] menampilkan tindakan sebelumnya, tindakan yang sedang berlangsung, dan tindakan terjadwal untuk klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-events.adoc:4
msgid "The menu:Systems[Event] tab is split into subtabs:"
msgstr "Tab menu:Systems[Event] dibagi menjadi beberapa subtab:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-events.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pending"
msgstr "Tertunda"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-events.adoc:6
msgid "This section shows actions that are scheduled, but have not yet started."
msgstr "Bagian ini menampilkan tindakan yang telah dijadwalkan, tetapi belum dimulai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-events.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Click the name of an action to see more information.  To cancel an action, "
"check the action and click btn:[Cancel Selected Events]."
msgstr "Klik nama tindakan untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya.  Untuk membatalkan tindakan, centang tindakan, lalu klik btn:[Cancel Selected Events]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-events.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "History"
msgstr "Riwayat"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-events.adoc:9
msgid "This section shows actions that have been completed on the selected client."
msgstr "Bagian ini menampilkan tindakan yang telah diselesaikan pada klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-events.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Click the summary of an action to see more information.  Transactional "
"action details show the progress of each phase.  For the meaning of a "
"pending reboot and when transactional changes become active, see "
"xref:client-configuration:transactional-systems.adoc[]."
msgstr "Klik ringkasan tindakan untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya.  Detail tindakan transaksional menampilkan kemajuan setiap tahap.  Untuk memahami arti mulai ulang yang tertunda dan kapan perubahan transaksional mulai berlaku, lihat xref:client-configuration:transactional-systems.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-formulas.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Formulas"
msgstr "Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-formulas.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Formulas] section allows you to manage Salt formulas on the "
"selected client.  This is only available for Salt clients."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Formulas] memungkinkan Anda mengelola formula Salt pada klien yang dipilih.  Bagian ini hanya tersedia untuk klien Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-formulas.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This section lists all currently installed formulas.  Check the formulas you "
"want to apply, and click btn:[Save].  When a formula is applied, it will "
"create a new subtab.  Navigate to the subtab to configure the formula on the "
"selected client.  After most formula actions, you will need to apply the "
"highstate to pick up the changes."
msgstr "Bagian ini mencantumkan semua formula yang saat ini terinstal.  Centang formula yang ingin Anda terapkan, lalu klik btn:[Save].  Saat formula diterapkan, subtab baru akan dibuat.  Buka subtab tersebut untuk mengonfigurasi formula pada klien yang dipilih.  Setelah sebagian besar tindakan formula, Anda perlu menerapkan highstate agar perubahan diterapkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-formulas.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On transactional systems, formulas follow their own execution policies.  For "
"built-in formula policies, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc#transactional-formula-policies[].  "
"For custom formula policies, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc#transactional-formulas[]."
msgstr "Pada sistem transaksional, formula mengikuti kebijakan eksekusinya masing-masing.  Untuk kebijakan formula bawaan, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc#transactional-formula-policies[]. Untuk kebijakan formula kustom, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc#transactional-formulas[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-formulas.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information about formulas, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang formula, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-groups.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Groups] section shows the system groups the selected client "
"is assigned to."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Groups] menampilkan grup sistem tempat klien yang dipilih menjadi anggota."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-groups.adoc:3
msgid "The menu:Systems[Groups] subtab is split into sections:"
msgstr "Subtab menu:Systems[Groups] dibagi menjadi beberapa bagian:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-groups.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "List/Leave"
msgstr "Daftar/Keluar"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-groups.adoc:6
msgid "This section lists all groups that the selected client belongs to."
msgstr "Bagian ini mencantumkan semua grup tempat klien yang dipilih menjadi anggota."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-groups.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Click the group name to see more information about the system group.  To "
"remove the selected client from a system group, check the group, and click "
"btn:[Leave Selected Groups]."
msgstr "Klik nama grup untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang grup sistem tersebut.  Untuk menghapus klien yang dipilih dari grup sistem, centang grup, lalu klik btn:[Leave Selected Groups]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-groups.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Join"
msgstr "Bergabung"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-groups.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This section lists all groups that are available for the selected client to "
"subscribe to."
msgstr "Bagian ini mencantumkan semua grup yang tersedia untuk diikuti oleh klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-groups.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Click the group name to see more information about the system group.  To "
"join a system group, check the group, and click btn:[Join Selected Groups]."
msgstr "Klik nama grup untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang grup sistem tersebut.  Untuk bergabung dengan grup sistem, centang grup, lalu klik btn:[Join Selected Groups]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-hardware.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware"
msgstr "Perangkat Keras"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-hardware.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Details > Hardware] section shows detailed hardware "
"information about the selected client, including architecture, networking, "
"and memory."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Details > Hardware] menampilkan informasi perangkat keras terperinci tentang klien yang dipilih, termasuk arsitektur, jaringan, dan memori."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-hardware.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Schedule Hardware Refresh] to update this page with the latest "
"hardware information.  To change the primary network interface on the "
"client, select the correct interface in the `Primary Network Interface` "
"field in the `Networking` section.  For clients with multiple fully "
"qualified domain names (FQDNs) configured, change the primary FQDN by "
"selecting it in the `Primary FQDN` field in the `Networking` section.  Click "
"btn:[Update Properties] to save your changes."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Schedule Hardware Refresh] untuk memperbarui halaman ini dengan informasi perangkat keras terbaru.  Untuk mengubah antarmuka jaringan utama pada klien, pilih antarmuka yang sesuai pada kolom `Primary Network Interface` di bagian `Networking`.  Untuk klien yang dikonfigurasi dengan beberapa nama domain lengkap (FQDN), ubah FQDN utama dengan memilihnya pada kolom `Primary FQDN` di bagian `Networking`.  Klik btn:[Update Properties] untuk menyimpan perubahan Anda."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-hardware.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Refreshing hardware information happens once a month automatically when the "
"`system-profile-refresh` taskomatic job runs."
msgstr "Penyegaran informasi perangkat keras dilakukan secara otomatis sebulan sekali saat tugas taskomatic `system-profile-refresh` dijalankan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-notes.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Catatan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-notes.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Details > Notes] section lists notes about the selected "
"client."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Details > Notes] mencantumkan catatan tentang klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-notes.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create Note] to create a new note.  Give your note a subject, and "
"add any details you require.  Click btn:[Create] to save the note."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Note] untuk membuat catatan baru.  Beri subjek pada catatan Anda dan tambahkan detail yang diperlukan.  Klik btn:[Create] untuk menyimpan catatan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-notes.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Notes are listed in the table with a time stamp of when they were last "
"edited.  Click the subject of a note to edit or delete it."
msgstr "Catatan dicantumkan dalam tabel beserta stempel waktu terakhir diedit. Klik subjek catatan untuk mengedit atau menghapusnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Details > Overview] section shows a summary of information "
"about the selected client, including the current system status.  This subtab "
"is displayed by default when you click the name of a client anywhere "
"throughout the {webui}."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Details > Overview] menampilkan ringkasan informasi tentang klien yang dipilih, termasuk status sistem saat ini. Subtab ini ditampilkan secara bawaan saat Anda mengeklik nama klien di bagian mana pun dalam {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Delete System] to delete the system profile.  Deleting a system "
"profile will not destroy or remove the client, but you will no longer be "
"able to manage it with {productname}.  If you delete a system profile by "
"mistake, you can re-register the client using bootstrap."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Delete System] untuk menghapus profil sistem.  Menghapus profil sistem tidak akan merusak atau menghapus klien, tetapi Anda tidak lagi dapat mengelolanya dengan {productname}.  Jika Anda tidak sengaja menghapus profil sistem, Anda dapat mendaftarkan ulang klien menggunakan bootstrap."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Status"
msgstr "Status Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The section shows the current status of the client.  If no action is "
"required for this client, the status is `System is up to date`."
msgstr "Bagian ini menampilkan status klien saat ini.  Jika tidak ada tindakan yang diperlukan untuk klien ini, statusnya adalah `System is up to date`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:7
msgid ""
"If the client has new software ready for installation, the status is "
"`Software Updates Available`, along with details of updates.  Apply updates "
"by navigating to menu:System Details[Packages]."
msgstr "Jika klien memiliki perangkat lunak baru yang siap diinstal, statusnya adalah `Software Updates Available`, disertai detail pembaruan.  Terapkan pembaruan dengan membuka menu:System Details[Packages]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Info"
msgstr "Informasi Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:9
msgid "This section shows general information about the client."
msgstr "Bagian ini menampilkan informasi umum tentang klien."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Info Columns"
msgstr "Kolom Informasi Sistem"

#. ?? --LKB 2020-07-14
#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column Name\n"
"| Description\n"
"| Conditions\n"
"\n"
"| Hostname\n"
"| The hostname used by the client with the {productname} Server.\n"
"| -\n"
"\n"
"| FQDN\n"
"| The fully qualified domain name of the client.\n"
"| Shown only if it differs from the host name.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nama Kolom\n"
"| Deskripsi\n"
"| Kondisi\n"
"\n"
"| Nama Host\n"
"| Nama host yang digunakan klien untuk berkomunikasi dengan Server {productname}.\n"
"| -\n"
"\n"
"| FQDN\n"
"| Nama domain lengkap klien.\n"
"| Hanya ditampilkan jika berbeda dari nama host.\n"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:12
msgid ""
"| IP address | The IPv4 IP address of the client.  | - | IPv6 address | The "
"IPv6 IP address of the client.  | - | Minion ID | The minion ID of the "
"client.  | Salt clients only.  | Virtualization | The type of virtualization "
"used by the client.  | Virtualized clients only.  | UUID | The universally "
"unique identifier.  | - | Kernel | The kernel currently in use on the "
"client.  | - | {productname} System ID | A unique identifier generated by "
"{productname} when the client is registered.  | - | Activation key | The "
"activation key used to register the client.  | Remains blank if the client "
"has not been activated.  | Installed products | Software products currently "
"installed on the client.  | -"
msgstr "| Alamat IP | Alamat IP IPv4 klien.  | - | Alamat IPv6 | Alamat IP IPv6 klien.  | - | ID Minion | ID minion klien.  | Hanya klien Salt.  | Virtualisasi | Jenis virtualisasi yang digunakan klien.  | Hanya klien tervirtualisasi.  | UUID | Pengidentifikasi unik universal.  | - | ID Sistem {productname} | Pengidentifikasi unik yang dihasilkan oleh {productname} saat klien didaftarkan.  | - | Kunci aktivasi | Kunci aktivasi yang digunakan untuk mendaftarkan klien.  | Tetap kosong jika klien belum diaktifkan.  | Produk terinstal | Produk perangkat lunak yang saat ini terinstal pada klien.  | -"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For more information about system locks, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-locking.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penguncian sistem, lihat xref:client-configuration:system-locking.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subscribed Channels"
msgstr "Saluran yang Dilanggan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:15
msgid ""
"This section shows the base and child software channels this client is "
"subscribed to."
msgstr "Bagian ini menampilkan saluran perangkat lunak dasar dan turunan yang dilanggan oleh klien ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Alter Channel Subscriptions] to change the channel subscriptions "
"for this client.  Click a channel name to go to the `Channel Details` tab."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Alter Channel Subscriptions] untuk mengubah langganan saluran klien ini.  Klik nama saluran untuk membuka tab `Channel Details`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information about channels, see "
"xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang saluran, lihat xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Events"
msgstr "Peristiwa Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:19
msgid "This section shows the most recent system events for this client."
msgstr "Bagian ini menampilkan peristiwa sistem terbaru untuk klien ini."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Events Columns"
msgstr "Kolom Peristiwa Sistem"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column Name\n"
"| Description\n"
"\n"
"| Checked in\n"
"| The time that the client last successfully checked in with the "
"{productname} Server.\n"
"\n"
"| Registered\n"
"| The time that the client registered with {productname}.\n"
"\n"
"| Last booted\n"
"| The time that the client was most recently started or rebooted.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nama Kolom\n"
"| Deskripsi\n"
"\n"
"| Terakhir melapor\n"
"| Waktu terakhir klien berhasil melapor ke Server {productname}.\n"
"\n"
"| Terdaftar\n"
"| Waktu klien didaftarkan pada {productname}.\n"
"\n"
"| Terakhir dimulai\n"
"| Waktu terakhir klien dinyalakan atau dimulai ulang.\n"
"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Schedule system reboot] to set a time for the client to reboot.  "
"The reboot will occur when the client next checks in with the {productname} "
"Server after the scheduled time.  For more on task scheduling, see "
"xref:administration:task-schedules.adoc[]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Schedule system reboot] untuk menetapkan waktu mulai ulang klien.  Mulai ulang akan dilakukan saat klien berikutnya melapor ke Server {productname} setelah waktu yang dijadwalkan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penjadwalan tugas, lihat xref:administration:task-schedules.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Properties"
msgstr "Properti Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:24
msgid "This section shows further information about the client."
msgstr "Bagian ini menampilkan informasi lebih lanjut tentang klien."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Properties Columns"
msgstr "Kolom Properti Sistem"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column Name\n"
"| Description\n"
"\n"
"| System types\n"
"| Lists the system type applied to the client.\n"
"Client type is {salt}\n"
"\n"
"| Notifications\n"
"| Lists the current notification options for this client.\n"
"\n"
"| Contact method\n"
"| The method used by this client to communicate with the {productname} "
"Server.\n"
"\n"
"| Auto patch update\n"
"| Indicates if the client is receiving patches automatically.\n"
"\n"
"| Maintenance Schedule\n"
"| Specifies which maintenance schedule is assigned to this client.\n"
"\n"
"| System name\n"
"| The system name of the client.\n"
"By default, this is the host name, but it can be changed.\n"
"\n"
"| Description\n"
"| General information about the client.\n"
"By default, this is automatically gathered when the client is registered, "
"but it can be changed.\n"
"\n"
"| Location\n"
"| The physical location of the client.\n"
"By default, this is not set, but it can be added.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nama Kolom\n"
"| Deskripsi\n"
"\n"
"| Jenis sistem\n"
"| Mencantumkan jenis sistem yang diterapkan pada klien.\n"
"Jenis klien adalah {salt}\n"
"\n"
"| Notifikasi\n"
"| Mencantumkan opsi notifikasi saat ini untuk klien ini.\n"
"\n"
"| Metode kontak\n"
"| Metode yang digunakan klien ini untuk berkomunikasi dengan Server {productname}.\n"
"\n"
"| Pembaruan patch otomatis\n"
"| Menunjukkan apakah klien menerima patch secara otomatis.\n"
"\n"
"| Jadwal Pemeliharaan\n"
"| Menentukan jadwal pemeliharaan yang ditetapkan untuk klien ini.\n"
"\n"
"| Nama sistem\n"
"| Nama sistem klien.\n"
"Secara bawaan, nama ini adalah nama host, tetapi dapat diubah.\n"
"\n"
"| Deskripsi\n"
"| Informasi umum tentang klien.\n"
"Secara bawaan, informasi ini dikumpulkan secara otomatis saat klien didaftarkan, tetapi dapat diubah.\n"
"\n"
"| Lokasi\n"
"| Lokasi fisik klien.\n"
"Secara bawaan, lokasi ini tidak ditetapkan, tetapi dapat ditambahkan.\n"
"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For more information about contact methods, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang metode kontak, lihat xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-overview.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Edit These Properties] to go to menu:System Details[Details > "
"Properties] subtab."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Edit These Properties] untuk membuka subtab menu:System Details[Details > Properties]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-packages.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Software > Packages] section allows you to manage packages "
"on the selected client."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Software > Packages] memungkinkan Anda mengelola paket pada klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-packages.adoc:3
msgid "Click btn:[Update Package List] to refresh the list of available packages."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Update Package List] untuk memperbarui daftar paket yang tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-packages.adoc:4
msgid "The menu:Systems[Software > Packages] tab is split into subtabs:"
msgstr "Tab menu:Systems[Software > Packages] dibagi menjadi beberapa subtab:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-packages.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "List/Remove"
msgstr "Daftar/Hapus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-packages.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Lists all packages currently installed on the selected client.  Click the "
"name of a package to see more information.  To uninstall packages, check the "
"package in the list and click btn:[Remove Packages]."
msgstr "Mencantumkan semua paket yang saat ini terinstal pada klien yang dipilih.  Klik nama paket untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya.  Untuk menghapus instalasi paket, centang paket dalam daftar, lalu klik btn:[Remove Packages]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-packages.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Peningkatan Versi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-packages.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Lists packages that have newer versions available.  Click the name of a "
"package to see more information.  To upgrade packages, check the package in "
"the list and click btn:[Upgrade Packages].  Any EULAs will be accepted "
"automatically."
msgstr "Mencantumkan paket yang memiliki versi lebih baru.  Klik nama paket untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya.  Untuk meningkatkan versi paket, centang paket dalam daftar, lalu klik btn:[Upgrade Packages].  Semua EULA akan diterima secara otomatis."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-packages.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Instal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-packages.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Lists packages that are available for installation on the selected client.  "
"Click the name of a package to see more information.  To install packages, "
"check the package in the list and click btn:[Install Selected Packages].  "
"Any EULAs will be accepted automatically."
msgstr "Mencantumkan paket yang tersedia untuk diinstal pada klien yang dipilih.  Klik nama paket untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya.  Untuk menginstal paket, centang paket dalam daftar, lalu klik btn:[Install Selected Packages].  Semua EULA akan diterima secara otomatis."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-packages.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Profiles"
msgstr "Profil"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-packages.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Compare packages installed on the selected client with a stored profile, or "
"with packages installed on another client.  When the comparison is made, you "
"can choose to modify the selected client to match.  To compare with a stored "
"profile, select the profile and click btn:[Compare].  To compare with "
"another client, select the client name and click btn:[Compare]."
msgstr "Bandingkan paket yang terinstal pada klien yang dipilih dengan profil tersimpan atau dengan paket yang terinstal pada klien lain.  Setelah perbandingan dilakukan, Anda dapat memilih untuk mengubah klien yang dipilih agar sesuai.  Untuk membandingkan dengan profil tersimpan, pilih profil, lalu klik btn:[Compare].  Untuk membandingkan dengan klien lain, pilih nama klien, lalu klik btn:[Compare]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-packages.adoc:13
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Non Compliant"
msgstr "Tidak Sesuai"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-packages.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Lists packages that are installed on the selected client, but are not "
"available in any of the subscribed software channels."
msgstr "Mencantumkan paket yang terinstal pada klien yang dipilih, tetapi tidak tersedia dalam saluran perangkat lunak mana pun yang dilanggan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-packages.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For more information about packages, see "
"xref:client-configuration:package-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang paket, lihat xref:client-configuration:package-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-patches.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Software > Patches] section displays a list of all patches "
"currently available to the selected client."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Software > Patches] menampilkan daftar semua patch yang saat ini tersedia untuk klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-patches.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To apply a patch, check it in the list and click btn:[Apply Patches] to "
"schedule the installation.  The `Status` column in the list shows whether an "
"update has been scheduled.  Click the status for more information about the "
"action."
msgstr "Untuk menerapkan patch, centang patch dalam daftar, lalu klik btn:[Apply Patches] untuk menjadwalkan instalasi.  Kolom `Status` dalam daftar menunjukkan apakah pembaruan telah dijadwalkan.  Klik status untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang tindakan tersebut."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-product-migration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Product Migration"
msgstr "Migrasi Produk"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-product-migration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Software > Product Migration] section allows you to upgrade "
"clients to the latest service pack of their underlying operating system.  "
"Product migration also allows you to migrate openSUSE Leap to the "
"corresponding SLE SP level or clients such as {rhel}, or {centos} to {sll}.  "
"Check the product version you want to upgrade the client to, and click "
"btn:[Select Channels]."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Software > Product Migration] memungkinkan Anda meningkatkan klien ke service pack terbaru dari sistem operasi yang digunakannya.  Migrasi produk juga memungkinkan Anda memigrasikan openSUSE Leap ke tingkat SLE SP yang sesuai, atau klien seperti {rhel} atau {centos} ke {sll}.  Centang versi produk yang ingin Anda jadikan tujuan peningkatan klien, lalu klik btn:[Select Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-product-migration.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about service pack upgrades, see "
"xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang peningkatan service pack, lihat xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-properties.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Properties"
msgstr "Properti"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-properties.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Details > Properties] section allows you to edit details "
"about the selected client, including the system name and details."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Details > Properties] memungkinkan Anda mengedit detail klien yang dipilih, termasuk nama dan detail sistem."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-properties.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit System Details Settings"
msgstr "Edit Pengaturan Detail Sistem"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-properties.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Setting Name\n"
"| Description\n"
"| Default Setting\n"
"\n"
"| System Name\n"
"| The name of the system to use within the {productname} {webui}.\n"
"| The hostname of the client.\n"
"\n"
"| Base System Type\n"
"| The type of base system used by the client.\n"
"| Shown for information only, you cannot edit this.\n"
"\n"
"| Add-on System Types\n"
"| Check additional system types to add features such as build hosts, or "
"monitoring.\n"
"| Only available system types for this client are shown.\n"
"\n"
"| Notifications\n"
"| Check to receive notifications of updates or patches, and to include this "
"client in the daily summary.\n"
"| Checked.\n"
"\n"
"| Auto Patch Update\n"
"| Check to have available patches automatically applied.\n"
"| Unchecked.\n"
"\n"
"| Description\n"
"| This field can contain any text you want.\n"
"| The operating system, release, and architecture of the system when it "
"first registered to {productname}.\n"
"\n"
"| Facility Address\n"
"| The physical location of the client.\n"
"| Blank\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nama Pengaturan\n"
"| Deskripsi\n"
"| Pengaturan Bawaan\n"
"\n"
"| Nama Sistem\n"
"| Nama sistem yang digunakan dalam {webui} {productname}.\n"
"| Nama host klien.\n"
"\n"
"| Jenis Sistem Dasar\n"
"| Jenis sistem dasar yang digunakan oleh klien.\n"
"| Ditampilkan hanya sebagai informasi, Anda tidak dapat mengeditnya.\n"
"\n"
"| Jenis Sistem Tambahan\n"
"| Centang jenis sistem tambahan untuk menambahkan fitur seperti host build atau pemantauan.\n"
"| Hanya jenis sistem yang tersedia untuk klien ini yang ditampilkan.\n"
"\n"
"| Notifikasi\n"
"| Centang untuk menerima notifikasi pembaruan atau patch, serta menyertakan klien ini dalam ringkasan harian.\n"
"| Dicentang.\n"
"\n"
"| Pembaruan Patch Otomatis\n"
"| Centang agar patch yang tersedia diterapkan secara otomatis.\n"
"| Tidak dicentang.\n"
"\n"
"| Deskripsi\n"
"| Kolom ini dapat berisi teks apa pun yang Anda inginkan.\n"
"| Sistem operasi, rilis, dan arsitektur sistem saat pertama kali didaftarkan pada {productname}.\n"
"\n"
"| Alamat Fasilitas\n"
"| Lokasi fisik klien.\n"
"| Kosong\n"
"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Provisioning] section allows you to manage provisioning for "
"the selected client.  This includes managing and scheduling autoinstallation "
"and booting the selected client."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Provisioning] memungkinkan Anda mengelola provisioning untuk klien yang dipilih.  Hal ini mencakup pengelolaan dan penjadwalan instalasi otomatis serta proses boot klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc:3
msgid "The menu:Systems[Provisioning] tab is split into subtabs:"
msgstr "Tab menu:Systems[Provisioning] dibagi menjadi beberapa subtab:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Autoinstallation"
msgstr "Instalasi Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This section displays a list of the available autoinstallation profiles for "
"the selected client.  Select a time and date for autoinstallation to "
"re-install the client."
msgstr "Bagian ini menampilkan daftar profil instalasi otomatis yang tersedia untuk klien yang dipilih.  Pilih waktu dan tanggal instalasi otomatis untuk menginstal ulang klien."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Power Management"
msgstr "Pengelolaan Daya"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This section allows you to power on, power off, and reboot the selected "
"client."
msgstr "Bagian ini memungkinkan Anda menyalakan, mematikan, dan memulai ulang klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This feature uses either the IPMI or Redfish protocol and is managed using a "
"{cobbler} profile.  The selected client must have a power management "
"controller supporting one of these protocols.  For Redfish, ensure you can "
"establish a valid SSL connection between the client and the {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr "Fitur ini menggunakan protokol IPMI atau Redfish dan dikelola melalui profil {cobbler}.  Klien yang dipilih harus memiliki pengontrol pengelolaan daya yang mendukung salah satu protokol tersebut.  Untuk Redfish, pastikan Anda dapat membangun koneksi SSL yang valid antara klien dan Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Complete the details for the power management server, and click the "
"appropriate button for the action to take.  Click btn:[Get status] to "
"determine if the client is currently running.  Click btn:[Save only] to save "
"the details without taking any action."
msgstr "Lengkapi detail server pengelolaan daya, lalu klik tombol yang sesuai dengan tindakan yang akan dilakukan.  Klik btn:[Get status] untuk mengetahui apakah klien sedang berjalan.  Klik btn:[Save only] untuk menyimpan detail tanpa melakukan tindakan apa pun."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Remove Cobbler System Profile] to remove the current client's "
"system profile from {cobbler}.  For more information about unattended "
"provisioning with {cobbler}, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-unattended.adoc[]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Remove Cobbler System Profile] untuk menghapus profil sistem klien saat ini dari {cobbler}.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang provisioning tanpa pengawasan dengan {cobbler}, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-unattended.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For more information about power management, see "
"xref:client-configuration:power-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan daya, lihat xref:client-configuration:power-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-proxy.adoc:1
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy"
msgstr "Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-proxy.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System List > Proxy] section shows all clients connected to "
"the selected client as a proxy.  This is only available when the selected "
"client is registered to {productname} as a proxy."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List > Proxy] menampilkan semua klien yang terhubung ke klien yang dipilih sebagai proxy.  Bagian ini hanya tersedia jika klien yang dipilih terdaftar pada {productname} sebagai proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-proxy.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about setting up a proxy, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penyiapan proxy, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-reactivation.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reactivation"
msgstr "Pengaktifan Kembali"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-reactivation.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Details > Reactivation] section allows you to generate "
"reactivation keys for the selected client.  Reactivation keys can be used "
"once only to re-register the client and regain all {productname} settings."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Details > Reactivation] memungkinkan Anda menghasilkan kunci pengaktifan kembali untuk klien yang dipilih.  Kunci pengaktifan kembali hanya dapat digunakan sekali untuk mendaftarkan ulang klien dan memulihkan semua pengaturan {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-reactivation.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about reactivation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang kunci pengaktifan kembali, lihat xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Recurring Actions] section allows you to manage recurring "
"actions on the selected client.  You can schedule an arbitrary set of Salt "
"states or the highstate to be executed at desired intervals.  This is only "
"available for Salt clients."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Recurring Actions] memungkinkan Anda mengelola tindakan berulang pada klien yang dipilih.  Anda dapat menjadwalkan sekumpulan state Salt sesuai kebutuhan atau highstate untuk dijalankan pada interval yang diinginkan.  Bagian ini hanya tersedia untuk klien Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about Salt states, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang state Salt, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Currently, {productname} supports the following action types as recurring "
"actions:"
msgstr "Saat ini, {productname} mendukung jenis tindakan berikut sebagai tindakan berulang:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:5
msgid "`Highstate:` Execute the highstate."
msgstr "`Highstate:` Jalankan highstate."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:6
msgid ""
"`Custom state:` Execute a set of custom states. A custom state can be either "
"an internal state provided by {productname}, or a configuration channel "
"created by a user."
msgstr "`Custom state:` Jalankan sekumpulan state kustom. State kustom dapat berupa state internal yang disediakan oleh {productname} atau saluran konfigurasi yang dibuat oleh pengguna."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating Recurring Actions"
msgstr "Membuat Tindakan Berulang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:9
msgid ""
"To create new schedules, click the btn:[Create] icon on the top right "
"corner.  Choose a supported action type, give your recurring schedule a "
"name, select a time and day for it to recur, and click btn:[Create "
"Schedule].  Toggle the btn:[Test mode] switch to test the highstate before "
"you apply it.  For a recurring custom-state action on transactional systems, "
"select `Use transactional update` to apply its explicit states "
"transactionally.  Leave the option unselected to apply those states live.  "
"For more information about transactional operations, see "
"xref:client-configuration:transactional-systems.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk membuat jadwal baru, klik ikon btn:[Create] di sudut kanan atas. Pilih jenis tindakan yang didukung, beri nama jadwal berulang Anda, pilih waktu dan hari pengulangannya, lalu klik btn:[Create Schedule].  Aktifkan sakelar btn:[Test mode] untuk menguji highstate sebelum menerapkannya.  Untuk tindakan state kustom berulang pada sistem transaksional, pilih `Use transactional update` untuk menerapkan state yang ditentukan secara eksplisit dalam tindakan tersebut secara transaksional.  Biarkan opsi ini tidak dipilih untuk menerapkan state tersebut langsung pada sistem yang sedang berjalan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang operasi transaksional, lihat xref:client-configuration:transactional-systems.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disabling Recurring Actions"
msgstr "Menonaktifkan Tindakan Berulang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Disabling an action stops the action recurring, but does not delete it.  To "
"disable a recurring action toggle the `Active` switch off.  Enable them "
"again by toggling the `Active` switch on.  Disabled recurring actions remain "
"in the list, but are not executed."
msgstr "Menonaktifkan tindakan akan menghentikan pengulangannya, tetapi tidak menghapusnya.  Untuk menonaktifkan tindakan berulang, nonaktifkan sakelar `Active`.  Aktifkan kembali tindakan dengan mengaktifkan sakelar `Active`.  Tindakan berulang yang dinonaktifkan tetap tercantum dalam daftar, tetapi tidak dijalankan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Editing Recurring Actions"
msgstr "Mengedit Tindakan Berulang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the `Actions` column, click the btn:[Edit] icon for the action you want "
"to change.  On the `Schedule Recurring Action` page, the existing properties "
"are pre-filled.  Make your changes, and click btn:[Update Schedule]."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Actions`, klik ikon btn:[Edit] untuk tindakan yang ingin Anda ubah.  Pada halaman `Schedule Recurring Action`, properti yang ada telah terisi.  Lakukan perubahan, lalu klik btn:[Update Schedule]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deleting Recurring Actions"
msgstr "Menghapus Tindakan Berulang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Deleting an action permanently removes it.  To start using the action again, "
"you will need to create a new action.  In the `Actions` column, click the "
"btn:[Delete] icon for the action you want to delete, and confirm the "
"deletion."
msgstr "Menghapus tindakan akan menghilangkannya secara permanen.  Untuk menggunakan tindakan tersebut kembali, Anda perlu membuat tindakan baru.  Pada kolom `Actions`, klik ikon btn:[Delete] untuk tindakan yang ingin Anda hapus, lalu konfirmasikan penghapusan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-remote-command.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote Command"
msgstr "Perintah Jarak Jauh"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-remote-command.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Details > Remote Command] section allows you to run "
"commands remotely on the selected client."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Details > Remote Command] memungkinkan Anda menjalankan perintah dari jarak jauh pada klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-remote-command.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Before doing so, you must first configure the system to accept such "
"commands.  For more information about using remote commands, see "
"xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."
msgstr "Sebelum melakukannya, Anda harus terlebih dahulu mengonfigurasi sistem agar menerima perintah tersebut.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggunaan perintah jarak jauh, lihat xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-remote-command.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On transactional systems, select `Use transactional update` to run a command "
"transactionally.  Leave the option unselected to run the command on the live "
"system.  For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:transactional-systems.adoc[]."
msgstr "Pada sistem transaksional, pilih `Use transactional update` untuk menjalankan perintah secara transaksional.  Biarkan opsi ini tidak dipilih untuk menjalankan perintah pada sistem yang sedang berjalan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:transactional-systems.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-snapshots.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Btrfs Snapshots"
msgstr "Snapshot Btrfs"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-snapshots.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Btrfs Snapshots] tab is available for transactional "
"systems.  It lists the most recent snapshots reported by `snapper` and "
"identifies the active and default snapshots."
msgstr "Tab menu:Systems[Btrfs Snapshots] tersedia untuk sistem transaksional. Tab ini mencantumkan snapshot terbaru yang dilaporkan oleh `snapper` serta mengidentifikasi snapshot aktif dan bawaan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-snapshots.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Refresh Snapshots] to schedule an update of the snapshot "
"information.  The refresh action appears in the system events.  "
"{productname} also automatically refreshes snapshot information after a "
"transactional action reports changes.  For when transactional changes become "
"active, see xref:client-configuration:transactional-systems.adoc[]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Refresh Snapshots] untuk menjadwalkan pembaruan informasi snapshot.  Tindakan penyegaran akan muncul dalam peristiwa sistem.  {productname} juga secara otomatis menyegarkan informasi snapshot setelah tindakan transaksional melaporkan perubahan.  Untuk mengetahui kapan perubahan transaksional mulai berlaku, lihat xref:client-configuration:transactional-systems.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Software Channels"
msgstr "Saluran Perangkat Lunak"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Software > Software Channels] section allows you to manage "
"the software channels on the current client.  For more information about "
"software channels, see xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Software > Software Channels] memungkinkan Anda mengelola saluran perangkat lunak pada klien saat ini.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang saluran perangkat lunak, lihat xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software-channels.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Software > Software Channels] subtab is split into "
"sections:"
msgstr "Subtab menu:Systems[Software > Software Channels] dibagi menjadi beberapa bagian:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software-channels.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Base Channel"
msgstr "Saluran Dasar"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software-channels.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This section shows the base channel the current client is subscribed to, as "
"well as any other available base channels."
msgstr "Bagian ini menampilkan saluran dasar yang dilanggan oleh klien saat ini, serta saluran dasar lain yang tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software-channels.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Click the chain icon next to a base channel to see more information about "
"the channel.  Change the base channel subscription by selecting the new base "
"channel, and click btn:[Next] to schedule the change."
msgstr "Klik ikon rantai di samping saluran dasar untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang saluran tersebut.  Ubah langganan saluran dasar dengan memilih saluran dasar baru, lalu klik btn:[Next] untuk menjadwalkan perubahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software-channels.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The child channels associated with the base channel are populated in the "
"`Child Channels` section.  Mandatory child channels are pre-selected.  "
"Toggle the `include recommended` switch to also select recommended child "
"channels."
msgstr "Saluran turunan yang terkait dengan saluran dasar ditampilkan pada bagian `Child Channels`.  Saluran turunan wajib telah dipilih sebelumnya.  Aktifkan sakelar `include recommended` untuk turut memilih saluran turunan yang disarankan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software-channels.adoc:8
msgid ""
"By default, cloned vendor channels match the original vendor channel and "
"automatically select the dependencies.  You can disable the automatic "
"selection for cloned channels by adding the following option in "
"`/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"
msgstr "Secara bawaan, saluran vendor hasil kloning dicocokkan dengan saluran vendor asli dan dependensinya dipilih secara otomatis.  Anda dapat menonaktifkan pemilihan otomatis untuk saluran hasil kloning dengan menambahkan opsi berikut dalam `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software-channels.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.cloned_channel_auto_selection = false\n"
msgstr "java.cloned_channel_auto_selection = false\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software-channels.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In general, channel pre-selection is necessary to avoid problems with "
"missing dependencies for a given channel but it only works flawlessly for "
"vendor channels.  For cloned channels, {productname} relies on the channel "
"label to define dependencies and use it in auto selection.  This heuristic "
"sometimes lead to either selecting unnecessary child channels or overlooking "
"some essential ones.  Users should exercise caution and pay attention in "
"such case that correct channels are selected."
msgstr "Secara umum, pemilihan awal saluran diperlukan untuk menghindari masalah dependensi yang tidak tersedia bagi saluran tertentu, tetapi mekanisme ini hanya bekerja dengan sempurna untuk saluran vendor.  Untuk saluran hasil kloning, {productname} mengandalkan label saluran untuk menentukan dependensi dan menggunakannya dalam pemilihan otomatis.  Pendekatan heuristik ini terkadang menyebabkan pemilihan saluran turunan yang tidak diperlukan atau terlewatnya saluran yang penting.  Dalam situasi tersebut, pengguna harus berhati-hati dan memastikan saluran yang benar telah dipilih."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software-channels.adoc:11
msgid "For Salt clients, apply the highstate after changing software channels."
msgstr "Untuk klien Salt, terapkan highstate setelah mengubah saluran perangkat lunak."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software-channels.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Child Channels"
msgstr "Saluran Turunan"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software-channels.adoc:13
msgid ""
"This section shows the software product and child channels associated with "
"the currently selected base channel."
msgstr "Bagian ini menampilkan produk perangkat lunak dan saluran turunan yang terkait dengan saluran dasar yang saat ini dipilih."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software-channels.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Hover over the information icon next to the channel name to see channel "
"requirements.  Click the chain icon next to a base channel to see more "
"information about the channel."
msgstr "Arahkan penunjuk ke ikon informasi di samping nama saluran untuk melihat persyaratan saluran.  Klik ikon rantai di samping saluran dasar untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang saluran tersebut."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software-channels.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Child channels are can be either recommended or mandatory.  Mandatory child "
"channels must be installed for the selected client to use the associated "
"base channel.  Recommended child channels should be installed to provide "
"additional packages.  All other child channels are optional."
msgstr "Saluran turunan dapat bersifat disarankan atau wajib.  Saluran turunan wajib harus diinstal agar klien yang dipilih dapat menggunakan saluran dasar terkait.  Saluran turunan yang disarankan sebaiknya diinstal untuk menyediakan paket tambahan.  Semua saluran turunan lainnya bersifat opsional."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software-channels.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Check the child channels you want to install, and click btn:[Next] to "
"schedule the change."
msgstr "Centang saluran turunan yang ingin Anda instal, lalu klik btn:[Next] untuk menjadwalkan perubahan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Software"
msgstr "Perangkat Lunak"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-software.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Software] section allows you to manage software on the "
"selected client."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Software] memungkinkan Anda mengelola perangkat lunak pada klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[States] section allows you to manage Salt states on the "
"selected client.  States provide configuration templates for Salt clients.  "
"Applying the highstate applies all outstanding Salt states.  This is only "
"available for Salt clients."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[States] memungkinkan Anda mengelola state Salt pada klien yang dipilih.  State menyediakan templat konfigurasi untuk klien Salt.  Penerapan highstate akan menerapkan semua state Salt yang belum diterapkan.  Bagian ini hanya tersedia untuk klien Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc:4
msgid "The menu:Systems[States] subtab is split into sections:"
msgstr "Subtab menu:Systems[States] dibagi menjadi beberapa bagian:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Highstate"
msgstr "Highstate"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc:6
msgid ""
"This section provides details of the highstate for the selected client.  It "
"includes a state summary for the selected client, showing a list of states, "
"formulas, and configuration channels.  On transactional systems, highstate "
"applies transactional changes first, followed by any required live work.  "
"When a reboot is needed, live work runs after the operating system starts "
"from the snapshot; otherwise, it runs immediately.  To schedule a time to "
"apply the highstate, select the date and time and click btn:[Apply "
"Hightstate].  Toggle the btn:[Test mode] switch to test the highstate before "
"you apply it."
msgstr "Bagian ini menyediakan detail highstate untuk klien yang dipilih.  Bagian ini mencakup ringkasan state untuk klien yang dipilih, yang menampilkan daftar state, formula, dan saluran konfigurasi.  Pada sistem transaksional, highstate menerapkan perubahan transaksional terlebih dahulu, kemudian menjalankan pekerjaan yang diperlukan pada sistem yang sedang berjalan.  Jika mulai ulang diperlukan, pekerjaan tersebut dijalankan setelah sistem operasi dimulai dari snapshot; jika tidak, pekerjaan langsung dijalankan.  Untuk menjadwalkan waktu penerapan highstate, pilih tanggal dan waktu, lalu klik btn:[Apply Hightstate].  Aktifkan sakelar btn:[Test mode] untuk menguji highstate sebelum menerapkannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This section allows you to manage package states for the selected client.  "
"Package states determine which packages and versions should be installed on "
"the selected client."
msgstr "Bagian ini memungkinkan Anda mengelola state paket untuk klien yang dipilih.  State paket menentukan paket dan versi yang harus diinstal pada klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Use the search tool to search for the package you want to change.  To set "
"the package state to install the package, select `Installed` as the new "
"state.  To always upgrade the package to the latest version, select "
"`latest`.  Click btn:[Save] to save the changes to the state.  Click "
"btn:[Apply changes] to apply the new package state to the selected client."
msgstr "Gunakan alat pencarian untuk mencari paket yang ingin Anda ubah.  Untuk menetapkan state paket agar paket diinstal, pilih `Installed` sebagai state baru.  Untuk selalu meningkatkan paket ke versi terbaru, pilih `latest`.  Klik btn:[Save] untuk menyimpan perubahan state.  Klik btn:[Apply changes] untuk menerapkan state paket baru pada klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc:10
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Use the `Changes` subtab to see what changes will occur on the selected "
"client when this state is applied."
msgstr "Gunakan subtab `Changes` untuk melihat perubahan yang akan terjadi pada klien yang dipilih saat state ini diterapkan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Channels"
msgstr "Saluran Konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc:12
msgid ""
"This section allows you to manage configuration channels for the selected "
"client."
msgstr "Bagian ini memungkinkan Anda mengelola saluran konfigurasi untuk klien yang dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Use the search tool to search for the configuration channel you want to "
"manage.  This section shows the list of configuration channels that are "
"available for the selected client to subscribe to.  To subscribe the "
"selected client to a configuration channel, check the channel, and click "
"btn:[Apply].  To apply the saved configuration-channel states to the "
"selected client, click btn:[Execute States].  On transactional systems, "
"select `Use transactional update` to stage these states in a snapshot, or "
"leave it unselected to apply them live."
msgstr "Gunakan alat pencarian untuk mencari saluran konfigurasi yang ingin Anda kelola.  Bagian ini menampilkan daftar saluran konfigurasi yang tersedia untuk dilanggan oleh klien yang dipilih.  Untuk membuat klien yang dipilih berlangganan saluran konfigurasi, centang saluran, lalu klik btn:[Apply].  Untuk menerapkan state saluran konfigurasi yang tersimpan pada klien yang dipilih, klik btn:[Execute States].  Pada sistem transaksional, pilih `Use transactional update` untuk menyiapkan state ini dalam snapshot, atau biarkan tidak dipilih untuk menerapkannya langsung pada sistem yang sedang berjalan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For more information about configuration channels, see "
"xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[].  For more "
"information about transactional operations, see "
"xref:client-configuration:transactional-systems.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang saluran konfigurasi, lihat xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[].  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang operasi transaksional, lihat xref:client-configuration:transactional-systems.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-transfer.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transfer"
msgstr "Pemindahan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-transfer.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Details > Transfer] section allows you to move clients "
"between organizations.  Clients can only belong to one organization at any "
"time."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Details > Transfer] memungkinkan Anda memindahkan klien antarorganisasi.  Klien hanya dapat menjadi anggota satu organisasi pada satu waktu."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-transfer.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You will need to establish trust between organizations when you want to move "
"clients.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:organizations.adoc[]."
msgstr "Anda perlu membangun hubungan kepercayaan antarorganisasi saat ingin memindahkan klien.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:administration:organizations.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-transfer.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To move a client to a different organization, select the name of the "
"organization in the `Organization Name` field, and click btn:[Migrate "
"System]."
msgstr "Untuk memindahkan klien ke organisasi lain, pilih nama organisasi pada kolom `Organization Name`, lalu klik btn:[Migrate System]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-transfer.adoc:5
msgid ""
"When you move a client to a different organization, channel assignments, "
"system group membership, custom data values, configuration channels, "
"reactivation keys, and snapshots are deleted from the system configuration.  "
"You will need to set these values again when the move is complete."
msgstr "Saat Anda memindahkan klien ke organisasi lain, penetapan saluran, keanggotaan grup sistem, nilai data kustom, saluran konfigurasi, kunci pengaktifan kembali, dan snapshot dihapus dari konfigurasi sistem.  Anda perlu menetapkan kembali nilai-nilai ini setelah pemindahan selesai."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-groups.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Groups"
msgstr "Grup Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-groups.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System Groups] section displays the list of system groups "
"in your organization."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System Groups] menampilkan daftar grup sistem dalam organisasi Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-groups.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click the name of a group to work with it, or to add or delete clients in "
"the group."
msgstr "Klik nama grup untuk mengelolanya atau untuk menambahkan atau menghapus klien dalam grup tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-groups.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The list shows an icon if there are updates available for any of the clients "
"in the group.  Click the icon to see more information about the updates "
"available."
msgstr "Daftar ini menampilkan ikon jika pembaruan tersedia untuk salah satu klien dalam grup.  Klik ikon untuk melihat informasi selengkapnya tentang pembaruan yang tersedia."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-groups.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update Status Icons"
msgstr "Ikon Status Pembaruan"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-groups.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Icon\n"
"| Description\n"
"| Action Required\n"
"\n"
