#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Systems List"
msgstr "Daftar Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System List] section lists all clients available in your "
"{productname} environment."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List] mencantumkan semua klien yang tersedia dalam lingkungan {productname} Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:5
msgid "The menu:Systems[System List] section is split into submenus:"
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List] dibagi menjadi beberapa submenu:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "All"
msgstr "Semua"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System List > All] section lists every client that you have "
"permission to manage."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List > All] mencantumkan setiap klien yang boleh Anda kelola sesuai izin Anda."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Physical Systems"
msgstr "Sistem Fisik"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System List > Physical Systems] section lists every client "
"that is installed on physical hardware."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List > Physical Systems] mencantumkan setiap klien yang diinstal pada perangkat keras fisik."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unprovisioned Systems"
msgstr "Sistem yang Belum Melalui Provisioning"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System List > Unprovisioned Systems] section lists every "
"bare metal client that the {productname} Server is aware of, but has not yet "
"been registered."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List > Unprovisioned Systems] mencantumkan setiap klien bare metal yang diketahui oleh Server {productname}, tetapi belum didaftarkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For more information about bare metal clients, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang klien bare metal, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Out of Date"
msgstr "Belum Diperbarui"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System List > Out of Date] section lists every client that "
"has available updates."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List > Out of Date] mencantumkan setiap klien yang memiliki pembaruan tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For more information about managing client updates, see "
"xref:client-configuration:package-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan pembaruan klien, lihat xref:client-configuration:package-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requiring Reboot"
msgstr "Memerlukan Mulai Ulang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System List > Requiring Reboot] section lists every client "
"that requires rebooting."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List > Requiring Reboot] mencantumkan setiap klien yang perlu dimulai ulang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System List > Non Compliant] section lists every client "
"that has non-compliant packages installed.  Packages are considered "
"non-compliant if they have been installed from a source other than "
"{productname}.  In the list, the `Extra Packages` column shows the number of "
"non-compliant packages on the client.  If there is at least one "
"non-compliant package, you can click the number to display listings of those "
"non-compliant packages per system."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List > Non Compliant] mencantumkan setiap klien yang memiliki paket tidak sesuai yang terinstal.  Paket dianggap tidak sesuai jika diinstal dari sumber selain {productname}.  Dalam daftar, kolom `Extra Packages` menampilkan jumlah paket tidak sesuai pada klien.  Jika terdapat setidaknya satu paket tidak sesuai, Anda dapat mengeklik angka tersebut untuk menampilkan daftar paket tidak sesuai per sistem."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Without System Type"
msgstr "Tanpa Jenis Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System List > Without System Type] section lists every "
"client that does not have a base system type recorded."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List > Without System Type] mencantumkan setiap klien yang tidak memiliki jenis sistem dasar yang tercatat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:22
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For more information about system types, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-types.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang jenis sistem, lihat xref:client-configuration:system-types.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ungrouped"
msgstr "Tanpa Grup"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:24
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System List > Ungroups] section lists every client that is "
"not assigned to a system group."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List > Ungroups] mencantumkan setiap klien yang tidak ditetapkan ke grup sistem."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inactive"
msgstr "Tidak Aktif"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System List > Inactive] section lists every client that has "
"not checked in with the {productname} Server in 24 hours or more."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List > Inactive] mencantumkan setiap klien yang belum melapor ke Server {productname} selama 24 jam atau lebih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:28
msgid ""
"For more information about client connections to the server, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang koneksi klien ke server, lihat xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For more information on troubleshooting inactive clients, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pemecahan masalah klien yang tidak aktif, lihat xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recently Registered"
msgstr "Baru Didaftarkan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System List > Recently Registered] section lists every "
"client that has registered within a given period.  Select the period to view "
"from the `View systems registered` field."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List > Recently Registered] mencantumkan setiap klien yang didaftarkan dalam periode tertentu.  Pilih periode yang ingin ditampilkan pada kolom `View systems registered`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System List > Proxy] section lists every client that is "
"registered as a proxy."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List > Proxy] mencantumkan setiap klien yang terdaftar sebagai proxy."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Duplicate Systems"
msgstr "Sistem Duplikat"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:35
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System List > Duplicate Systems] section lists clients that "
"share IP addresses, host names, or MAC addresses.  Use the tabs to compare "
"clients."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List > Duplicate Systems] mencantumkan klien yang memiliki alamat IP, nama host, atau alamat MAC yang sama.  Gunakan tab untuk membandingkan klien."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Currency"
msgstr "Kemutakhiran Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:37
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System List > System Currency] section lists all clients "
"with information about available updates, and provides a currency score for "
"each.  You can use the currency score to determine in which order clients "
"should be updated.  A score with a larger number indicates that a client is "
"not current, and might require critical updates."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List > System Currency] mencantumkan semua klien beserta informasi pembaruan yang tersedia dan memberikan skor kemutakhiran untuk setiap klien.  Anda dapat menggunakan skor kemutakhiran untuk menentukan urutan pembaruan klien.  Skor yang lebih tinggi menunjukkan bahwa klien belum mutakhir dan mungkin memerlukan pembaruan kritis."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Types"
msgstr "Jenis Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-list.adoc:39
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[System List > System Types] section lists every client, "
"their base system type, add-on system type, and base channel.  It also gives "
"a count of clients of each system type."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[System List > System Types] mencantumkan setiap klien beserta jenis sistem dasar, jenis sistem tambahan, dan saluran dasarnya.  Bagian ini juga menampilkan jumlah klien untuk setiap jenis sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:2
msgid "The `Systems` section allows you to manage your client systems."
msgstr "Bagian `Systems` memungkinkan Anda mengelola sistem klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[] menu contains submenu entries in the left navigation bar "
"and as its overview page displays the menu:Systems[System List > All] "
"listing with all client systems registered to the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Menu menu:Systems[] memuat entri submenu pada bilah navigasi kiri dan menampilkan daftar menu:Systems[System List > All] sebagai halaman gambaran umumnya, yang mencakup semua sistem klien yang terdaftar pada Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This listing contains information about the clients, including available "
"software updates, extra packages (otherwise often referenced as "
"non-compliant packages), and the base channel they are subscribed to."
msgstr "Daftar ini memuat informasi tentang klien, termasuk pembaruan perangkat lunak yang tersedia, paket tambahan (yang juga sering disebut paket tidak sesuai), dan saluran dasar yang dilanggan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:5
msgid "All the submenu entries:"
msgstr "Semua entri submenu:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "`System List`          - xref:reference:systems/systems-list.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`System List`          - xref:reference:systems/systems-list.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "`System Groups`\t    - xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`System Groups`    - xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "`System Set Manager`   - xref:reference:systems/ssm-menu.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`System Set Manager`   - xref:reference:systems/ssm-menu.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Bootstrapping`\t    - xref:reference:systems/bootstrapping.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Bootstrapping`    - xref:reference:systems/bootstrapping.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Proxy Configuration`  - xref:reference:systems/proxy-configuration.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Proxy Configuration`  - xref:reference:systems/proxy-configuration.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Advanced Search`\t    - xref:reference:systems/advanced-search.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Advanced Search`    - xref:reference:systems/advanced-search.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Activation Keys`\t    - xref:reference:systems/activation-keys.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Activation Keys`    - xref:reference:systems/activation-keys.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Stored Profiles`\t    - xref:reference:systems/stored-profiles.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Stored Profiles`    - xref:reference:systems/stored-profiles.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Custom System Info`   - xref:reference:systems/custom-system-info.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Custom System Info`   - xref:reference:systems/custom-system-info.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Autoinstallation`\t    - xref:reference:systems/autoinst-menu.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Autoinstallation`    - xref:reference:systems/autoinst-menu.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Virtual Host Managers` - "
"xref:reference:systems/virtual-host-managers.adoc[]\n"
msgstr "`Virtual Host Managers` - xref:reference:systems/virtual-host-managers.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Click the name of a client to go to that client system's `Details` overview "
"page and all its tabs and subtabs.  For more information about the `System "
"Details` overview page in the {webui}, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc[]."
msgstr "Klik nama klien untuk membuka halaman gambaran umum `Details` sistem klien tersebut beserta semua tab dan subtabnya.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang halaman gambaran umum `System Details` dalam {webui}, lihat xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-details.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Check a client to add it to the system set manager.  For more information "
"about the system set manager, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "Centang klien untuk menambahkannya ke pengelola kumpulan sistem.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelola kumpulan sistem, lihat xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/systems-menu.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Add Systems] to go to menu:Systems[Bootstrapping].  For more "
"about bootstrapping new clients, see "
"xref:reference:systems/bootstrapping.adoc[]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Add Systems] untuk membuka menu:Systems[Bootstrapping].  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang bootstrapping klien baru, lihat xref:reference:systems/bootstrapping.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/virtual-host-managers.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtual Host Managers"
msgstr "Pengelola Host Virtual"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/virtual-host-managers.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Systems[Virtual Host Managers] section lists the active virtual "
"host managers (VHMs)."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Systems[Virtual Host Managers] mencantumkan pengelola host virtual (VHM) yang aktif."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/virtual-host-managers.adoc:3
msgid ""
"VHMs can be used to collect private or public cloud instances and organize "
"them into virtualization groups."
msgstr "VHM dapat digunakan untuk mengumpulkan instans cloud privat atau publik dan mengaturnya ke dalam grup virtualisasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/virtual-host-managers.adoc:4
msgid "For more information about VHMs, see xref:client-configuration:vhm.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang VHM, lihat xref:client-configuration:vhm.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/active-users.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Active Users"
msgstr "Pengguna Aktif"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/active-users.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Users[User List > Active] section shows all active users in your "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Users[User List > Active] menampilkan semua pengguna aktif pada Server {productname} Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/active-users.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Each user in the list shows the username, real name, assigned roles, and the "
"date the user last signed in.  Click btn:[Create User] to create a new user "
"account.  Click the username to go to the `User Details` page."
msgstr "Setiap pengguna dalam daftar menampilkan nama pengguna, nama asli, peran yang ditetapkan, dan tanggal terakhir pengguna masuk.  Klik btn:[Create User] untuk membuat akun pengguna baru.  Klik nama pengguna untuk membuka halaman `User Details`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/active-users.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/all-users.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/deactivated-users.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/users-menu.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about managing users, see "
"xref:administration:users.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan pengguna, lihat xref:administration:users.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/all-users.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "All Users"
msgstr "Semua Pengguna"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/all-users.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Users[User List > All] section shows all activated and deactivated "
"users in your {productname} Server.  Deleted users are not shown in the "
"list."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Users[User List > All] menampilkan semua pengguna yang diaktifkan dan dinonaktifkan pada Server {productname} Anda.  Pengguna yang telah dihapus tidak ditampilkan dalam daftar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/all-users.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Each user in the list shows the username, real name, assigned roles, the "
"date the user last signed in, and the current status of the user.  Click "
"btn:[Create User] to create a new user account.  Click the username to go to "
"the `User Details` page."
msgstr "Setiap pengguna dalam daftar menampilkan nama pengguna, nama asli, peran yang ditetapkan, tanggal terakhir pengguna masuk, dan status pengguna saat ini.  Klik btn:[Create User] untuk membuat akun pengguna baru.  Klik nama pengguna untuk membuka halaman `User Details`."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/deactivated-users.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deactivated Users"
msgstr "Pengguna yang Dinonaktifkan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/deactivated-users.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Users[User List > Deactivated] section shows all deactivated users "
"in your {productname} Server."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Users[User List > Deactivated] menampilkan semua pengguna yang dinonaktifkan pada Server {productname} Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/deactivated-users.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Each user in the list shows the username, real name, assigned roles, the "
"date the user last signed in, the user who deactivated the account, and the "
"date the account was deactivated.  Click btn:[Create User] to create a new "
"user account.  Click the username to go to the `User Details` page."
msgstr "Setiap pengguna dalam daftar menampilkan nama pengguna, nama asli, peran yang ditetapkan, tanggal terakhir pengguna masuk, pengguna yang menonaktifkan akun, dan tanggal akun dinonaktifkan.  Klik btn:[Create User] untuk membuat akun pengguna baru.  Klik nama pengguna untuk membuka halaman `User Details`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/deactivated-users.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To reactivate a user, check the username in the list and click "
"btn:[Reactivate]."
msgstr "Untuk mengaktifkan kembali pengguna, centang nama pengguna dalam daftar, lalu klik btn:[Reactivate]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/system-group-configuration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Group Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi Grup Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/system-group-configuration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Users[System Configuration] section allows you to configure system "
"groups for your users."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Users[System Configuration] memungkinkan Anda mengonfigurasi grup sistem untuk pengguna Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/system-group-configuration.adoc:3
msgid ""
"System groups allow you to grant permissions to a group of users, instead of "
"granting permissions to individuals.  This is particularly useful if you "
"have many users."
msgstr "Grup sistem memungkinkan Anda memberikan izin kepada sekelompok pengguna, alih-alih memberikan izin kepada setiap pengguna secara terpisah.  Hal ini sangat berguna jika Anda memiliki banyak pengguna."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/system-group-configuration.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can also configure system groups for users that have been externally "
"authenticated."
msgstr "Anda juga dapat mengonfigurasi grup sistem untuk pengguna yang telah diautentikasi secara eksternal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/system-group-configuration.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information about managing users with system groups, see "
"xref:administration:users.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan pengguna dengan grup sistem, lihat xref:administration:users.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Details"
msgstr "Detail Pengguna"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The `User Details` section provides additional details about the user "
"account, and allows you to manage permissions for the user.  You can also "
"deactivate or delete users from this section."
msgstr "Bagian `User Details` menyediakan detail tambahan tentang akun pengguna dan memungkinkan Anda mengelola izin pengguna.  Anda juga dapat menonaktifkan atau menghapus pengguna dari bagian ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:4
msgid "The `User Details` section is split into tabs:"
msgstr "Bagian `User Details` dibagi menjadi beberapa tab:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:6
msgid ""
"This tab allows you to change the name and password of the user account, and "
"provides information about the various permissions the user has assigned."
msgstr "Tab ini memungkinkan Anda mengubah nama dan kata sandi akun pengguna, serta menyediakan informasi tentang berbagai izin yang telah ditetapkan untuk pengguna."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Use this section to assign or remove roles, except for the {productname} "
"Administrator.  To change a user's {productname} Administrator role, "
"navigate to menu:Admin[Users] and check or uncheck `{productname} Admin?` as "
"required."
msgstr "Gunakan bagian ini untuk menetapkan atau menghapus peran, kecuali peran Administrator {productname}.  Untuk mengubah peran Administrator {productname} seorang pengguna, buka menu:Admin[Users] dan centang atau hapus centang `{productname} Admin?` sesuai kebutuhan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Groups"
msgstr "Grup Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This tab shows the system groups the user is assigned to.  Check or uncheck "
"system groups as required."
msgstr "Tab ini menampilkan grup sistem yang ditetapkan untuk pengguna.  Centang atau hapus centang grup sistem sesuai kebutuhan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:11
msgid ""
"This tab shows the clients the user is able to administer.  Use system "
"groups to modify client access levels."
msgstr "Tab ini menampilkan klien yang dapat dikelola oleh pengguna.  Gunakan grup sistem untuk mengubah tingkat akses klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Select multiple systems from this page to add them to the system set manager "
"(SSM).  For more information about SSM, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "Pilih beberapa sistem dari halaman ini untuk menambahkannya ke pengelola kumpulan sistem (SSM).  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang SSM, lihat xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Permissions"
msgstr "Izin Saluran"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:14
msgid "This tab shows the channel permissions for the user."
msgstr "Tab ini menampilkan izin saluran untuk pengguna."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The `Subscription` subtab shows channels that the user has subscription "
"permissions for.  The `Management` subtab shows channels that the user has "
"management permissions for."
msgstr "Subtab `Subscription` menampilkan saluran yang dapat dilanggan oleh pengguna sesuai izinnya.  Subtab `Management` menampilkan saluran yang dapat dikelola oleh pengguna sesuai izinnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:16
msgid "Check channels in the list to grant permissions."
msgstr "Centang saluran dalam daftar untuk memberikan izin."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:17
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Preferences"
msgstr "Preferensi Pengguna"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:18
msgid "This tab is used to configure preference settings for users."
msgstr "Tab ini digunakan untuk mengonfigurasi pengaturan preferensi pengguna."

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option                | Description   | Default\n"
"| Email Notification    | Receive email for client and Taskomatic "
"notifications, including a daily summary email. | Checked\n"
"| {productname} List Page Size | Maximum number of items that can appear in "
"a list on a single page. | 25 entries\n"
"| \"Overview\" Start Page | Select the information panes to display on the "
"menu:Home[Overview] page. | All checked\n"
"| Time Zone             | Set your local timezone. | System timezone\n"
"| CSV Files             | Select whether to use comma or semi-colon "
"delimiters when producing downloadable CSV files. | Comma\n"
msgstr ""
"| Opsi                  | Deskripsi     | Nilai Bawaan\n"
"| Notifikasi Email      | Menerima email notifikasi klien dan Taskomatic, termasuk email ringkasan harian. | Dicentang\n"
"| Ukuran Halaman Daftar {productname} | Jumlah maksimum item yang dapat ditampilkan dalam daftar pada satu halaman. | 25 entri\n"
"| Halaman Awal \"Gambaran Umum\" | Pilih panel informasi yang akan ditampilkan pada halaman menu:Home[Overview]. | Semua dicentang\n"
"| Zona Waktu            | Tetapkan zona waktu lokal Anda. | Zona waktu sistem\n"
"| Berkas CSV      | Pilih penggunaan pemisah koma atau titik koma saat menghasilkan berkas CSV yang dapat diunduh. | Koma\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:22
msgid ""
"This tab shows the mailing addresses associated with the user.  Click "
"btn:[Fill in this address] to set a mailing address.  Click btn:[Edit this "
"address] to change an existing mailing address."
msgstr "Tab ini menampilkan alamat surat-menyurat yang terkait dengan pengguna.  Klik btn:[Fill in this address] untuk menetapkan alamat surat-menyurat.  Klik btn:[Edit this address] untuk mengubah alamat surat-menyurat yang sudah ada."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/users-list.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "User List"
msgstr "Daftar Pengguna"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/users-list.adoc:2
msgid "The menu:Users[User List] section provides access to the lists of users."
msgstr "Bagian menu:Users[User List] menyediakan akses ke daftar pengguna."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/users-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users Menu"
msgstr "Menu Pengguna"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/users-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The `Users` menu provides access to grant and edit permissions for those who "
"administer your system groups.  You can create new users, and edit user "
"details, roles, and system groups."
msgstr "Menu `Users` menyediakan akses untuk memberikan dan mengedit izin bagi pengguna yang mengelola grup sistem Anda.  Anda dapat membuat pengguna baru serta mengedit detail pengguna, peran, dan grup sistem."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/users-menu.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The `Users` menu is only available if you are signed in to {productname} "
"with an administrator account."
msgstr "Menu `Users` hanya tersedia jika Anda masuk ke {productname} menggunakan akun administrator."

